<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="EXO" style="id">Nyamwezi</book>
  <para style="toc3">Ku'f</para>
  <para style="toc2">Ku'fuma</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ki'tabu cha Ku'fuma</para>
  <para style="mt1">Ku'fuma</para>
  <para style="imt">Mihayo zya Mbele zya Ki'tabu cha Ku'fuma</para>
  <para style="ip">Ki'tabu cha Ku'fuma ki'li' ki'tabu cha wu'v'i'li' mugati' na mwilondo gwa vitabu vya Ilagano lya Kale. Ki'tabu cheni'chi' ki'li'wendelezya igani'lo lya igongo lyamwa Abalahamu i'lo li'fumile mu ki'tabu cha Mbu'ki'. Ki'li'witanwa “Ku'fuma” ku'nguno ki'li'welezezya igambo lya V'aizilaeli lya ku'pu'lu'gu'ka ku'fuma mu wu'sese wa ku' Misili na ku'su'v'a ku' nsi' i'yo Mulungu ndi' wamulagana Abalahamu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ku'londana na mahembeko, v'asomi v'ali'sani'zya ku'v'a lwandi' lu'hanya lwa ki'tabu cheni'chi' chatonwa na mufumbu'zi Mose. Igambo lyeni'li' li'li'wiolecha ku' ki'tabu cheni'ki'li' cha Ku'fuma, ku' ifungu 24:4, ninga vitabu vingi' vya Ilagano lya Kale na Ilagano Ipya vili' na lwandi' u'lo lu'temulile na ku'nukulu lwandi' lwa ki'tabu cheni'chi' ku' ku'yomba ki'ti' i'vi: “Ki'ti' i'vyo yi'tonilwe mu Ki'tabu chamwa Mose.”</para>
  <para style="ip">Yi'li'wigelisya ku'v'a igambo lya V'aizilaeli ku'fuma mu nsi' ya Misili yav'age hagati' ya myaka 1300 na 1400 K.K. (aho akaali' ku'v'yalwa Kilisito). Mu ki'tabu cha 1 V'atemi 6:1 yi'temulilwe ku'v'a igambo lya ku'fuma lyav'age mu mwaka gwa 480 aho ndi' gu'kaali' mwaka gwa 4 gwa ku'tema kwamwa Salomo ku'v'a mutemi wa Izilaeli.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ki'tabu cha Ku'fuma ki'li'kang'anti'zya i'vyo Mulungu wav'age ali'gelani'zya ilagano lyakwe i'lo ndi' waki'ndi'ka na ku'v'alagana Abalahamu, Isaka na Yakobo. Ki'li'gani'la magambo mahanya ga wu'pi'zya wamwa Mulungu ku' wu'v'yalwa wamwa Abalahamu, av'o hu' nsi' ya Izilaeli, aho ndi' v'afumile ku' nsi' ya Misili. Mulungu wayi'ki'ndi'ka Pasaka ya kwandya aho ndi' wav'i'ta mu igu'lya na nnumba zya V'aizilaeli itungo i'lo ndi' wav'awu'laga v'av'yalwa v'a mbele v'a Ki'misili. Pasaka yeni'yo hu' yene Yesu ndi' wayi'v'ezezya mwanya aho ndi' akaali' ku'fwa.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ku'fuma kwenu'ko Mulungu ndi' wav'alondola mpaka ku' ngiligili na lu'gu'lu' lwa Sinai, u'lo Mulungu ndi' wamwitana Mose na ku'mupa nzi'la zya nhana nyingi ki'gele V'aizilaeli v'azilonde. Nzi'la zyeni'zi zili'welezezya ki'ti'le cha kikali'le chav'o, i'vyo ndi' v'ali'koov'iwa ku'fumya kalu'mbi'lo na vitaambo, haki'mo na ku'v'ezya myanya. Hangi' zili'fumya maelezo ga mugati' ago gav'age ku'nguno ya wu'zyengi wa Ihema Isondo, lwandi' u'lo ndi' lu'li'koov'iwa lu'v'e wikalo wa Mulungu hagati' nav'o, haki'mo na isandi'ko lya wu'sangi'lwa na vilwani'lo vingi' ku'nguno ya muli'mo gwa mugati' na ihema, na vizwalo visondo ku'nguno ya v'ahozya.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ali'vi ku'nguno ya igambo lya wu'tale wu'hanya aho V'aizilaeli ndi' v'iv'ezezya ki'mbulimbuli cha ndama cha zahabu, Mose ndi' waliina hangi' ku'kapoma na Mulungu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ku' lwandi' lwa ku' mpelo lwa ki'tabu cheni'chi', ku'li'soma mmola ya ihema haki'mo na vilwani'lo vyalyo i'vyo vitemulilwe mugati' na wu'tonwe, i'vyo ndi' viv'eziv'ilwe ki'ti' i'vyo Mulungu ndi' walagi'li'zya.</para>
  <para style="iot">Mihayo ku' wu'guhi'</para>
  <para style="io1">1. Ifungu lya 1 li'li'welezezya V'aizilaeli i'vyo ndi' v'ingi'ziwa mu wu'sese mu nsi' ya Misili.</para>
  <para style="io1">2. Ifungu lya 2 mpaka lya 4 li'li'molecha Mose na ku'gani'la wikalo wakwe ku'fuma wu'yanda wakwe mpaka aho ndi' witanwa ku'v'akomola v'antu' v'a Mulungu.</para>
  <para style="io1">3. Ifungu lya 5 mpaka lya 15:21 li'li'welezezya i'vyo Mulungu ndi' wav'ezya migaka na ku'yi'gu'ma nsi' ya Misili ku' vigu'mo vihanya ku'nguno ya ku'v'akomola v'antu' v'akwe ku'fuma mu nsi' yeni'yo, na ku'fuma mu wu'kange wa v'asilikale v'amwa Falao.</para>
  <para style="io1">4. Ifungu lya 15:22 mpaka lya 19 li'li'welezezya musi'nzo gwa V'aizilaeli i'vyo ndi' v'ayu'mba na ku'fika ku' lwandi' lwa lu'gu'lu' lwa Sinai.</para>
  <para style="io1">5. Ifungu lya 20 mpaka lya 31 li'li'welezezya i'vyo Mulungu ndi' wamupa Mose nzi'la ya nhana, ya ki'v'ezezye i'yo ndi' yi'li' na maelezo ga mugati' ago ndi' gali'lagi'la v'antu' v'a Mulungu, V'aizilaeli, i'vyo ndi' v'ali'koov'iwa ku'v'a na wikalo na ku'mwisenga.</para>
  <para style="io1">6. Ifungu lya 32 li'li'welezezya V'aizilaeli i'vyo ndi' v'amutala Mulungu aho ndi' v'amugahani'zya Aloni, muku'lu'ye na Mose, av'av'ezezye ki'mbulimbuli cha ndama cha zahabu.</para>
  <para style="io1">7. Ifungu lya 33 mpaka lya 40 li'li'welezezya i'vyo Mose ndi' walu'wona lu'kumo lwamwa Mulungu, na ku'v'ahembeka V'aizilaeli nzi'la zya nhana zyamwa Mulungu na ku'v'alagi'la ki'zyengele cha Ihema Isondo, isandi'ko lya wu'sangi'lwa na vilwani'lo vingi' vya kwisengela mugati' na ihema, haki'mo na vintu' vya kapanga i'vyo vili'koov'iwa ku' vizwalo vya ki'hozya.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="EXO 1" />
  <para style="s">Lu'duko lwa V'aizilaeli ku' nsi' ya Misili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 1:1" />Aga hu' mina ga v'ana v'a ki'gosya v'amwa Izilaeli, ku' lina li'ngi' Yakobo, av'o ndi' waya nav'o ku' nsi' ya Misili, ki'la yu'mo wayaga na mugana gwakwe: <verse eid="EXO 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 1:2" />Lubeni, Simiyoni, Lawi, Yuda, <verse eid="EXO 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 1:3" />Isakali, Sebuloni, Benyamini, <verse eid="EXO 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 1:4" />Dani, Nafutali, Gadi na Asheli. <verse eid="EXO 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 1:5" />V'av'yalwa v'ose v'amwa Yakobo v'av'age maku'mi mupungati'. Itungo lyeni'lo Yosefu wasangwa watongelile kwenu'ko ku' Misili.<verse eid="EXO 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 1:6" />Aho lyav'i'ta itungo, Yosefu na v'adu'gu'ye, haki'mo na izyi'ka lya itungo lyeni'lo, v'agulalaga. <verse eid="EXO 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 1:7" />Ali'vi V'aizilaeli v'asangwa v'akiv'yala na kwingi'ha muno. Wingi wav'o wav'aga na nguzu muno na v'asambalaga mu nsi' yose.<verse eid="EXO 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 1:8" />Hangi' watemaga mutemi yu'ngi' mu nsi' ya Misili u'yo wav'age akamumanya Yosefu. <verse eid="EXO 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 1:9" />Nawe wav'awi'laga v'antu' v'akwe ati', “Lingagi, V'aizilaeli v'av'aga v'ingi muno, hangi' v'ali' na nguzu ku'ki'la iswe. <verse eid="EXO 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 1:10" />Yi'li'ku'dima ku'koov'e nzi'la ya ku'v'ahangi'li'zya ki'gele v'aleke kwingi'ha, ku'nguno u'lu' wigele wu'lu'gu' v'akowolile kwisangya na v'anisi v'iswe ku'lasana niswe, na ku'toloka mu nsi' yeni'yi'.” <verse eid="EXO 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 1:11" />Hohene V'amisili v'atu'u'laga v'i'mi'li'zi v'a ku'v'i'mi'li'zya V'aizilaeli na v'av'atu'mamyaga mili'mo zya wu'sese. V'aizilaeli v'atu'mamaga mili'mo zya ku'muzyengela Falao<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lina Falao li'li' isumbi' lya wu'temi ku' Misili.</char></note> kaya zya Pitomu na Lamesesi zya ku'tu'u'li'la viv'ango vyamwa Falao. <verse eid="EXO 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 1:12" />Ali'vi, aho v'atusiv'agwa, na hu' vyene v'endeleyaga kwingi'ha na ku'sambala mu nsi'. Ku'nguno yeni'yo V'amisili v'av'ogohaga muno V'aizilaeli. <verse eid="EXO 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 1:13" />Hohene V'amisili v'av'atu'mamyaga V'aizilaeli ku' wu'kandi. <verse eid="EXO 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 1:14" />V'av'av'ezyaga v'av'e na wikalo wu'lambu ku'nguno ya mili'mo mitimbu zya nswakala na matofali, na mili'mo zyose zya mu migu'nda. Mugati' na mili'mo zyose V'amisili v'av'atu'mamyaga V'aizilaeli ku' wu'kandi!<verse eid="EXO 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 1:15" />Hangi' mutemi wa Misili wav'awi'laga Shifula na Pua, av'o v'av'age v'ingi' v'a v'aki'ma v'a Ki'ebulania, ati', <verse eid="EXO 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 1:16" />“Ha itungo lya ku'v'av'yazya v'aki'ma v'a Ki'ebulania muv'e muli'wikomya. U'lu' wav'yalwa mwana wa ki'gosya mumuwu'lage, na u'lu' wa ki'ki'ma mumuleke azuwu'ke.” <verse eid="EXO 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 1:17" />Ali'vi v'enav'o v'av'age v'amogohile Mulungu. V'akav'ezizye ki'ti' mutemi wa Misili i'vyo walagi'li'zizye, sumbwa v'av'alekaga v'ana v'a ki'gosya v'azuwu'ke. <verse eid="EXO 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 1:18" />Hohene mutemi wa Misili wav'itanaga v'ingi' v'enav'o na ku'v'awu'zya ati', “Ku' ki' mwav'ezyaga vyeni'vyo, ku'v'aleka v'ana v'a ki'gosya v'azuwu'ke?” <verse eid="EXO 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 1:19" />Nav'o v'asu'v'yaga ati', “V'aki'ma v'a Ki'ebulania v'ali' v'asiliganzi, na v'ali' na nguzu. V'akav'ile ki'ti' v'aki'ma v'a Ki'misili. Itungo v'ingi' v'akaali' ku'fika, v'eni'ki'li' v'ali'sangagwa v'ipeku'laga.” <verse eid="EXO 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 1:20" />Ku'nguno yeni'yo, Mulungu wav'av'ezezyaga masoga v'ingi' v'enav'o, na V'aizilaeli v'ingi'haga na ku'v'a na nguzu nyingi. <verse eid="EXO 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 1:21" />Ku' i'vyo v'ingi' v'enav'o v'av'age v'ali'mogoha Mulungu, na Mulungu wav'apaga migana zyav'o v'eni'ki'li'.<verse eid="EXO 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 1:22" />Hangi' Falao wafumyaga ilagi'li'zyo ku' v'antu' v'akwe v'ose na ku'v'awi'la ati', “Ki'la mwana wa ki'gosya u'yo alav'yalwe na V'aebulania atagi'lwe mu mongo gwa Naili, ali'vi mwana wa ki'ki'ma mumuleke azuwu'ke.”<verse eid="EXO 1:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="EXO 2" />
  <para style="s">Ku'v'yalwa kwamwa Mose</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 2:1" />Wav'age ali'ho muntu' yu'mo wa igongo lya V'alawi, wamutoolaga muki'ma u'yo nawe wav'age wa igongo lya V'alawi. <verse eid="EXO 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 2:2" />Muki'ma mwenu'yo wav'aga na mwitungo, wipeku'laga mwana wa ki'gosya. Aho wawonaga ku'v'a mwana mwenu'yu' mukeke ali' musoga, wamuv'isaga ku' itungo lya myezi idatu'. <verse eid="EXO 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 2:3" />Ali'vi aho wawonaga ku'v'a akakowola ku'muv'isa ku' itungo ilihu, wasolaga ki'sege cha wu'loolo na ku'ki'v'ila lami. Haho wamutu'u'laga mwana mwenu'yo mu ki'sege, na waki'v'isaga hagati' na makumbo, ha ngiligili na mongo gwa Naili.<figure style="fig" file="co00763.jpg" size="col" ref="2:3">Mose ali'v'iswa na nnina mu ki'sege</figure> <verse eid="EXO 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 2:4" />Ilu'mbu'ye na mwana mwenu'yo wiv'isaga bi'hi' na henanho, ki'gele awone ago gakamupandi'ka mudu'gu'ye.<verse eid="EXO 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 2:5" />Hohene mwaniki', mwana wamwa Falao, wakulumunkaga ku' mongo ku'ya ku'koga, na v'azya v'akwe v'av'aga v'ali'yu'mbayu'mba ha ngiligili na mongo. Haho mwaniki' mwenu'yo waki'wonaga ki'sege mu makumbo, na wamutu'maga muzya wakwe akaki'lete. <verse eid="EXO 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 2:6" />Waki'funduku'laga ki'sege, lingaga, wamuwonaga mwana mukeke ali'li'la! Wamusayi'laga na ku'yomba ati', “Mwenu'yu' ali' yu'mo mugati' na v'ana v'a Ki'ebulania.”<verse eid="EXO 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 2:7" />Hene haho ilu'mbu'ye na mwana mwenu'yo wifumbu'laga, na wamuwu'zyaga mwaniki', mwana wamwa Falao, ati', “Vihe, nje nkaku'koov'ele wa ku'konsezya mwana mugati' na v'aki'ma v'a Ki'ebulania?” <verse eid="EXO 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 2:8" />Mwaniki' mwenu'yo wasu'v'yaga ati', “Ee, yaga.” Hohene ilu'mbu'ye na mwana mwenu'yo wayaga na wamuletaga nnina. <verse eid="EXO 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 2:9" />Haho mwaniki', mwana wamwa Falao, wayombaga ati', “U'sole mwana mwenu'yu' u'kanosezye, nanne ndaku'li'pe wu'tenensya wako.” Hohene muki'ma mwenu'yu' wamusolaga mwana na ku'monsya.<verse eid="EXO 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 2:10" />Aho mwana waku'laga, nnina wamufili'laga mwaniki', mwana wamwa Falao, nawe wamusolaga av'e mwana wakwe. Mwaniki' mwenu'yo wayombaga, “Namufumizye mu minzi',” hohene wamupaga lina Mose.<verse eid="EXO 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mose ali'peelela ku' Midiani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 2:11" />Aho Mose wav'aga muntu' muhanya, lu'siku' lu'mo ndi' waya ku'kav'asu'u'la V'aebulania v'iye, na ku'wona mili'mo zyav'o zya wu'sese. Wamuwonaga Mumisili yu'mo, ali'mugu'ma Muebulania yu'mo mugati' na v'adu'gu'ye. <verse eid="EXO 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 2:12" />Hohene Mose walingaga u'ku' na u'ko akawine muntu'. Wamugu'maga na wamuwu'lagaga Mumisili mwenu'yo na wamufuli'i'laga mu musengasenga. <verse eid="EXO 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 2:13" />Wangalu'ke Mose wafumaga hangi', lingaga, wav'awonaga V'aebulania v'av'i'li' v'ali'wigu'ma! Hohene wamuwu'zyaga wa ku'mulev'a mwiye ati', “Ku' ki' u'li'mugu'ma Muebulania mwiyo?” <verse eid="EXO 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 2:14" />Nawe wasu'v'yaga ati', “Ali' nde wakaku'tu'u'la ev'e ku'v'a mutemi na muyangu'zi wiswe? Vihe, u'li'koov'a ku'mbu'laga ki'ti' i'vyo wakamuwu'lagaga u'yo Mumisili?” Haho Mose wogohaga muno, na wiganikaga ati', “Kasinaga igambo lyeni'li' lyamanyi'kaga!” <verse eid="EXO 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 2:15" />Falao aho wigagwa mmola zyeni'zyo wakoov'aga ku'muwu'laga Mose. Ali'vi Mose wamupeelaga Falao, na wayaga ku'kav'ezya wikalo wakwe ku' nsi' ya Midiani.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EXO 2:15">Lu'siku' lu'mo, Mose wav'age ikalile ha mpelo ya lwinzi'. <verse eid="EXO 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 2:16" />Hohene v'aniki' mupungati', v'ana v'a muhozya wa ku' Midiani, nav'o v'afikaga henanho, v'adahaga minzi', na v'okazyaga mu mapango ki'gele v'azinywisye nkolo na mbu'li zyamwa sav'o. <verse eid="EXO 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 2:17" />V'adi'mi v'angi' v'izaga henanho na ku'v'asaga v'aniki' v'enav'o. Ali'vi Mose wawu'kaga na ku'v'agwasya v'aniki', na wazinywisyaga minzi' mitugo zyav'o. <verse eid="EXO 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 2:18" />V'aniki' v'enav'o aho v'asu'v'aga ku' lu'go, sav'o Leueli, ku' lina li'ngi' Yetilo, wav'awu'zyaga, “Yav'aga vihe walelo mwangu'ha ku'su'v'a?” <verse eid="EXO 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 2:19" />Nav'o v'asu'v'yaga ati', “Mumisili yu'mo waku'kwasyaga ku'ku'fumya mu makono ga v'adi'mi v'enav'o. Kasinaga muntu' mwenu'yo wadahaga minzi' na ku'zinywisya mitugo ku'nguno yiswe!” <verse eid="EXO 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 2:20" />Sav'o wav'awu'zyaga v'aniki' v'enav'o ati', “Ali' ku'he muntu' mwenu'yo? Ku' ki' mwamuleka kwenu'ko? Mwitani ize alye ki'liwa.”<verse eid="EXO 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 2:21" />Mose wazumyaga kwikala ha muntu' mwenu'yo. Hohene, muntu' mwenu'yo wamupaga Mose mwaniki', lina lyakwe Zipola, av'e muki' wakwe. <verse eid="EXO 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 2:22" />Zipola wamuv'yali'laga mwana wa ki'gosya, nawe Mose wamwitanaga lina Geleshomu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lina “Geleshomu” ku' Ki'ebulania likolile na muhayo “mugeni mwizi'li'zi kwenu'ko.”</char></note>, na ku'yomba, “Nav'aga mugeni mwizi'li'zi mu nsi' ya wu'geni.”<verse eid="EXO 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ki'li'lo cha V'aizilaeli ku' nsi' ya wu'sese</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 2:23" />Aho lyav'i'taga itungo ilihu, mutemi wa Misili wagulalaga.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EXO 2:23">V'aizilaeli v'ali'laga ku' wu'satu wu'hanya ku'nguno v'akoov'age wu'gwasya ku' wu'sese wav'o, na ki'li'lo chav'o chamufiki'i'laga Mulungu. <verse eid="EXO 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 2:24" />Mulungu wigagwa ki'li'lo chav'o, walawagwa ilagano i'lo walagana ku'mwa Abalahamu, Isaka na Yakobo. <verse eid="EXO 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 2:25" />Ku'nguno yeni'yo, Mulungu wav'awonaga V'aizilaeli na wav'asayi'laga.<verse eid="EXO 2:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="EXO 3" />
  <para style="s">Mulungu ali'mwitana Mose</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 3:1" />Lu'siku' lu'mo, Mose wav'age ali'di'ma idale lya nkolo na mbu'li zyamwa Yetilo, mukwiye, muhozya wamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu wa ku' nsi' ya Midiani. Mose wazifilaga mitugo ku'tali' ku' mpilimo na ibalangu', na walu'fiki'laga lu'gu'lu' lwa Holebu, lu'gu'lu' lwa Mulungu. <verse eid="EXO 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 3:2" />Kwenu'ko malaika wamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu wamwifumi'i'laga Mose ku' ilambi' lya moto hagati' na isaka. Mose walingaga na wakumyaga ku'wona isaka li'li'v'aka moto ali'vi li'kav'ile ku'ziga.<figure style="fig" file="co00782.jpg" size="col" loc="Anywhere in v.1-5 or bottom of page" ref="3:2">Mose ali'wona ilambi' lya moto hagati' na isaka</figure> <verse eid="EXO 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 3:3" />Hohene wiyombelaga, “Gwenu'gu' mugaka, isaka ku'v'aka moto ninga ku'ziga ng'o! Leka ngalu'ke ndinge visoga.”<verse eid="EXO 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 3:4" />Gu'ku' Mulungu aho wawonaga ku'v'a Mose wagalu'kaga ki'gele alinge, wamwitanaga ku'fuma mu isaka ati', “Mose! Mose!” Nawe Mose witawu'kaga, “Kalame! Ene aha!” <verse eid="EXO 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 3:5" />Mulungu wamuwi'laga ati', “Ku'du' wegele bi'hi'. Zula vilatu' vyako, ku'nguno henanha wi'mile u'tov'ile lwandi' lwa nsi' nsondo.” <verse eid="EXO 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 3:6" />Hangi' Mulungu wamuwi'laga ati', “Ene ni' Mulungu wamwa so, Mulungu wamwa Abalahamu, Isaka na Yakobo.” Mose wikumbi'laga wu'syu' wakwe ku'nguno wogohaga ku'mulinga Mulungu.<verse eid="EXO 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 3:7" />Gu'ku' Mulungu wamuwi'laga, “Nhana nalu'wonaga lu'duko lwa v'antu' v'anne ku' Misili. Nigagwa ki'li'lo chav'o ku'nguno ya v'i'mi'li'zi v'av'o. Nanne manyile makoye gav'o, <verse eid="EXO 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 3:8" />hohene nasookaga ki'gele mbapi'zye ku'fuma mu makono ga V'amisili. Ndav'afumye mu nsi' yeni'yo na ku'v'afila ku' nsi' nsoga na nhanya, nsi' ya lu'tongo i'yo yi'li'keneneka mav'eele na wu'ki', nsi' ya V'akanaani, V'ahiti, V'aamoli, V'apelizi, V'ahivi na V'ayebusi. <verse eid="EXO 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 3:9" />Gi'si' ki'li'lo cha V'aizilaeli chanfiki'i'laga, nhana, nanne nawonaga i'vyo V'amisili v'ali'v'apa lu'duko. <verse eid="EXO 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 3:10" />Hohene gi'si' nu'ku'tu'ma ku'mwa Falao, ki'gele u'kav'asinie v'antu' v'anne, V'aizilaeli, ku'fuma mu nsi' ya Misili.”<verse eid="EXO 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 3:11" />Ali'vi Mose wasu'v'yaga, “Ene ni' nde, ninga muyi'le Falao na ku'v'asinia V'aizilaeli mu Misili?” <verse eid="EXO 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 3:12" />Mulungu wamuwi'laga ati', “Ene nku'v'a haki'mo nanho. Aho u'lav'e wav'afumya v'antu' mu Misili, mulanisenge ene Mulungu winywe mu lu'gu'lu' lwenu'lu'. Igambo lyeni'li' li'ku'v'a lu'manyi'lo ku' wako ku'v'a ene hu' nku'tu'mile.”<verse eid="EXO 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 3:13" />Mose wamuwu'zyaga Mulungu, “Gi'si' u'lu' nav'ayi'la V'aizilaeli na ku'v'awi'la ati', ‘Mulungu wa v'agu'ku' v'inywe wantu'maga ku' winywe,’ nav'o u'lu' v'ambu'zye, ‘Lina lyakwe nde?’ Nku'v'awi'la ki'?” <verse eid="EXO 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 3:14" />Mulungu wasu'v'yaga ku'mwa Mose ati', <char style="sc">“Ene Ni'ho U'yo Ni'ho.</char> Vyene u'lav'awi'le V'aizilaeli, ‘U'yo ali'witanwa <char style="sc">Ene Ni'ho,</char> mwene wantu'maga ku' winywe.’ ” <verse eid="EXO 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 3:15" />Hangi' Mulungu wamuwi'laga Mose ati', “V'awi'le V'aizilaeli ati', ‘Gu'ku' Mulungu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lina “Gu'ku' Mulungu” ku' Ki'ebulania li'li' lina “Yahweh” ninga “Yehova.” </char></note>, Mulungu wa v'agu'ku' v'inywe, Mulungu wamwa Abalahamu, Isaka na Yakobo, wantu'maga ku' winywe.’ Lyeni'li' hu' lina lyanne nhananhana, li'li' lina lya ku'nizu'ki'la ku' wu'v'yalwa wose. <verse eid="EXO 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 3:16" />Yaga u'kav'akunganie v'anamala v'a Izilaeli, u'v'awi'le ati', ‘Gu'ku' Mulungu, Mulungu wa v'agu'ku' v'inywe, Mulungu wamwa Abalahamu, Isaka na Yakobo, wanifumi'i'laga na ku'mbwi'la ati', “Nakamwikomya na ku'wona i'vyo muli'v'eziwa mu nsi' ya Misili. <verse eid="EXO 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 3:17" />Nu'lagana ku'v'a ndamufumye mu lu'duko lwinywe kwenu'ko ku' Misili, na ku'mufila ku' nsi' ya makabi'la ga V'akanaani, V'ahiti, V'aamoli, V'apelizi, V'ahivi na V'ayebusi, ku' nsi' ya lu'tongo i'yo yi'li'keneneka mav'eele na wu'ki'.” ’<verse eid="EXO 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 3:18" />“V'anamala v'a Izilaeli v'alaku'degeleke. Hangi' ev'e na v'anamala mulaye ku' mutemi wa Misili na ku'muwi'la, ‘Gu'ku' Mulungu, Mulungu wa V'aebulania, wakwifumi'i'laga. U'ku'zumi'zye ku'yu'mbe musi'nzo gwa nsiku' idatu' mu ibalangu', ki'gele ku'kamufumi'zye ki'taambo Gu'ku' Mulungu, Mulungu wiswe.’ ” <verse eid="EXO 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 3:19" />Hangi' Mulungu wayombaga, “Ali'vi manyile ku'v'a mutemi wa Misili akasye amuzumi'zye ku'ya, sumbwa ku' mukono gwanne gwa nguzu gu'mugahani'zye. <verse eid="EXO 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 3:20" />Ku'nguno yeni'yo ndawu'sye mukono gwanne na ku'yi'gu'ma Misili ku' migaka zyanne mingi i'zyo ndav'ezye kwenu'ko. Haho mutemi alamuzumi'zye ku'wu'ka. <verse eid="EXO 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 3:21" />Hangi' ndav'av'ezye V'amisili v'av'e na moyo gwa wu'hegela ku' V'aizilaeli, na aho mulav'e muli'wu'ka mukasye muwu'ke makono du'. <verse eid="EXO 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 3:22" />Ki'la muki'ma Muebulania alamulombe muzenganwa wakwe Mumisili, ninga muki'ma u'yo ikalile mu lu'go lwakwe, amupe vintu' vya mupango vya mawe ga feza na zahabu haki'mo na myenda. Vintu' na myenda zyeni'zyo mulav'azwi'ke v'ana v'inywe v'a ki'gosya na v'a ki'ki'ma. I'vi hu' vyene mulavisampe vintu' vya V'amisili.”<verse eid="EXO 3:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="EXO 4" />
  <para style="s">Mulungu ali'mupa Mose wu'kowozi wa ku'v'ezya migaka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 4:1" />Mose wasu'v'yaga ati', “Yi'lav'e vihe u'lu' v'ize v'aleke ku'nsani'zya, ninga ku'ndegeleka, v'ayombe ati', ‘Gu'ku' Mulungu akaku'fumi'i'lile’?” <verse eid="EXO 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 4:2" />Haho Gu'ku' Mulungu wamuwu'zyaga Mose ati', “U'dimile ki' mu makono gako?” Mose wasu'v'yaga ati', “Mulanga.” <verse eid="EXO 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 4:3" />Gu'ku' Mulungu wamuwi'laga, “Gu'tagi'le ha nsi'.” Mose wagu'tagi'laga ha nsi', nago gwagalu'kaga ku'v'a nzoka! Mose wayi'peelaga. <verse eid="EXO 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 4:4" />Hangi' Gu'ku' Mulungu wamuwi'laga, “Golola mukono gwako u'yi'dime ku' muki'la.” Mose wagololaga mukono gwakwe wayi'dimaga, nayo nzoka yagalu'kaga ku'v'a mulanga mu makono gakwe. <verse eid="EXO 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 4:5" />Gu'ku' Mulungu wayombaga ati', “I'vi hu' vyene V'aizilaeli v'alasani'zye ku'v'a Gu'ku' Mulungu, Mulungu wa v'agu'ku' v'av'o, Mulungu wamwa Abalahamu, Isaka, na Yakobo wakwifumi'i'lile.”<verse eid="EXO 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 4:6" />Hangi' Gu'ku' Mulungu wamuwi'laga Mose, “Ingi'zya mukono gwako mugati' na nhanzo, mu ki'kuv'a chako.” Mose wav'ezyaga vyeni'vyo, ali'vi aho wagu'fumyaga mukono, kasinaga gwav'aga na mbizi, gwape ki'ti' nswakala! <verse eid="EXO 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 4:7" />Hangi' Mulungu wamuwi'laga ati', “Gu'su'v'ye hangi' mukono mugati' na nhanzo, mu ki'kuv'a chako.” Mose wav'ezyaga vyeni'vyo, na aho wagu'fumyaga, kasinaga gwav'aga mupanga ki'ti' viv'alango vingi' vya muv'i'li' gwakwe. <verse eid="EXO 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 4:8" />Haho Gu'ku' Mulungu wamuwi'laga Mose ati', “U'lu' v'aleke ku'ku'sani'zya ninga ku'lawa lu'manyi'lo lwa mugaka gwa kwandya, v'alasani'zye lu'manyi'lo lwa wu'v'i'li'. <verse eid="EXO 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 4:9" />Ali'vi u'lu' v'aleke ku'sani'zya lu'manyi'lo lwa migaka zyeni'zi iv'i'li', ninga ku'sani'zya mihayo zyako, hohene u'ladahye minzi' ga mongo gwa Naili, na u'gite ha nsi' nkazu. Minzi' genago galav'e magazi ha igu'lya na nsi' nkazu.”<verse eid="EXO 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 4:10" />Mose wamuwi'laga Gu'ku' Mulungu ati', “Ev'e Gu'ku' wanne, ene nkakowola ku'yomba visoga ku'fuma kale, ninga ku' itungo i'li' wav'aga u'li'yomba nanne mukumba wako. Lu'li'mi lwanne lu'li' lu'timbu ku'su'nsu'mu'la.” <verse eid="EXO 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 4:11" />Gu'ku' Mulungu wamuwu'zyaga, “Ali' nde u'yo watunda mulomo gwa muntu'? Ali' nde u'yo ali'muv'ezya muntu' ku'v'a kameme ninga nkiv'a? Ali' nde u'yo ali'muv'ezya muntu' ku'wona ninga wu'hofu? Vihe, nkav'ile ene Gu'ku' Mulungu? <verse eid="EXO 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 4:12" />Ev'e yaga, nanne ndagu'londole mulomo gwako na ku'ku'hembeka igambo lya ku'yomba.”<verse eid="EXO 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 4:13" />Ali'vi Mose wasu'v'yaga, “Ev'e Gu'ku' wanne, nu'ku'lomba chaki'sa, u'mutu'me muntu' yu'ngi' ku'v'ezya muli'mo gwenu'go.” <verse eid="EXO 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 4:14" />Haho ki'sila chamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu chapanki'laga ku'mwa Mose, na wamuwu'zyaga, “Vihe, ali'hadu'hu' muku'lu'yo Aloni, Mulawi? Manyile ku'v'a mwene akowolile ku'yomba visoga. Lingaga, nawe ali' mu nzi'la izile ku'ku'su'ngana, na aho aku'ku'wona aku'togwa mu moyo gwakwe. <verse eid="EXO 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 4:15" />U'ku'su'nsu'mu'la nawe na ku'mutu'u'li'la mihayo mu mulomo gwakwe. Ene nku'v'a haki'mo na inywe na nku'mugwasya ku'yomba, na nku'muhembeka igambo lya ku'v'ezya. <verse eid="EXO 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 4:16" />Aloni alasu'nsu'mu'le na V'aizilaeli na mwene alav'e muyombi wako, nanho u'v'e ki'ti' Mulungu wakwe, ku' ku'mupa mihayo zya ku'yomba. <verse eid="EXO 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 4:17" />Gi'si' u'sole mulanga gwenu'gu' mu makono gako ki'gele u'gu'tu'mi'le ku'v'ezezya lu'manyi'lo lwa migaka.”<verse eid="EXO 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mose ali'su'v'a ku' nsi' ya Misili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 4:18" />Haho Mose wasu'v'aga ku'mwa Yetilo mukwiye, wamuwi'laga ati', “Chaki'sa nu'lomba u'nzumi'zye nsu'v'e ku' Misili ku' v'adu'gu' v'anne, nkav'awone u'lu' v'akaali' v'ali'zuwu'ka.” Yetilo wasu'v'yaga, “Yaga na ku'hola.”<verse eid="EXO 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 4:19" />Mose aho wav'age akaali' ali' mu nsi' ya Midiani, Gu'ku' Mulungu wamuwi'laga ati', “Su'v'a ku' Misili ku'nguno v'ose av'o v'akoov'age ku'ku'wu'laga v'amalile ku'gulala.” <verse eid="EXO 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 4:20" />Hohene Mose wamusolaga muki' wakwe na v'ana v'akwe. Wav'aliiniaga ha igu'lya na mpunda, na walamulaga musi'nzo gwa ku'su'v'a ku' Misili. Hangi' wasolaga mulanga u'go walagi'li'ziwa na Mulungu ku'somba mu makono gakwe.<verse eid="EXO 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 4:21" />Gu'ku' Mulungu wamuwi'laga Mose ati', “Aho u'lav'e wasu'v'a ku' Misili wize witeege ku'v'ezya migaka zyose i'zyo naku'pile wu'kowozi wa ku'v'ezya, ali'vi ndagu'v'ezye moyo gwamwa Falao gu'v'e mulambu, nawe akasye av'aleku'li'le V'aizilaeli ku'wu'ka. <verse eid="EXO 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 4:22" />Hangi' u'muwi'le Falao, ‘Gu'ku' Mulungu ali'yomba i'vi: “Izilaeli ali' mwana wanne, muv'yalwa wanne wa mbele wa ki'gosya! <verse eid="EXO 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 4:23" />Nanne nu'ku'wi'la, muleku'li'le mwana wanne awu'ke, ki'gele antu'mami'le. U'lu' u'kaane ku'muleku'li'la, nhana, ndamuwu'lage muv'yalwa wako wa mbele wa ki'gosya.” ’ ”<verse eid="EXO 4:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 4:24" />Mose aho wav'age ali' mu nzi'la ku'su'v'a ku' Misili, aho wafikaga ha lwandi' lwa ku'lala, Gu'ku' Mulungu wamwifumi'i'laga na ku'koov'a ku'muwu'laga ku'nguno ya mwane ndi' akaputwa nyu'nzu'. <verse eid="EXO 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 4:25" />Haho Zipola wasolaga iwe lyu'gi', na waputaga nyu'nzu' ya mwane na wamukumi'ki'zyaga Mose ku' magu'lu'. Wayombaga ati', “Nhana ev'e u'li' mugosi wanne ku'nguno nitaga magazi genaga.” <verse eid="EXO 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 4:26" />Haho Mulungu wamulekaga. Hohene Zipola wamwitanaga Mose, “Mutozi wa magazi,” ku'nguno ya ku'puta yeni'yo nyu'nzu'.<verse eid="EXO 4:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 4:27" />Gu'ku' Mulungu wamuwi'laga Aloni ati', “Yaga ku' ibalangu' u'kamusu'ngane Mose.” Hohene Aloni wayaga na wapomaga na Mose ku' lu'gu'lu' lwa Mulungu, na wamusu'naga. <verse eid="EXO 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 4:28" />Nawe Mose wamuwi'laga Aloni mihayo zyose zyamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu, haki'mo na lu'manyi'lo lwa migaka zyose i'zyo walagi'li'ziv'ilwe ku'ziv'ezya. <verse eid="EXO 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 4:29" />Hangi' Mose na Aloni v'ayaga, na v'av'akunganiaga v'anamala v'ose v'a V'aizilaeli. <verse eid="EXO 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 4:30" />Nawe Aloni wav'awi'laga mihayo zyose zyamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu i'zyo wamuwi'lile Mose. Hangi' wav'ezyaga lu'manyi'lo lwa migaka ha mbele ya v'antu' v'ose. <verse eid="EXO 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 4:31" />Hohene v'antu' v'asani'zyaga. Aho v'igagwa ku'v'a Gu'ku' Mulungu wav'izi'i'laga V'aizilaeli, na ku'v'a walu'wonaga lu'duko lwav'o, v'ose v'akundamyaga mitwe zyav'o na ku'ku'v'i'i'la.<verse eid="EXO 4:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="EXO 5" />
  <para style="s">Falao ali'wongezya lu'duko ku' V'aizilaeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 5:1" />Aho lyav'i'taga itungo, Mose na Aloni v'ayaga ku'mwa Falao, na v'amuwi'laga ati', “Gu'ku' Mulungu, Mulungu wa Izilaeli ali'yomba i'vi: ‘V'aleku'li'le v'antu' v'anne v'awu'ke, v'akambezezye mwanya ku' ibalangu'.’ ” <verse eid="EXO 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 5:2" />Ali'vi Falao wav'awu'zyaga, “Gu'ku' Mulungu mwenu'yo hu' nde, mpaka muku'zye na ku'v'aleku'li'la V'aizilaeli v'awu'ke? Ene nkamumanya Gu'ku' Mulungu mwenu'yo, na nkav'ile ku'v'aleku'li'la V'aizilaeli v'awu'ke.” <verse eid="EXO 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 5:3" />Haho Mose na Aloni v'amuwi'laga, “Mulungu wa V'aebulania wapomaga niswe. Ku'li'ku'lomba u'ku'leku'li'le ku'yu'mbe musi'nzo gwa nsiku' idatu' mu ibalangu' ku'kamufumi'zye vitaambo Gu'ku' Mulungu, Mulungu wiswe. U'lu' ng'o, iswe alaku'gu'me na malwile ga tauni ninga na lu'panga.” <verse eid="EXO 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 5:4" />Ali'vi mutemi wa Misili wasu'v'yaga ati', “Inywe Mose na Aloni, ku' ki' muv'alekya v'antu' mili'mo zyav'o? Su'v'agi ku' mili'mo zinywe.” <verse eid="EXO 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 5:5" />Hangi' Falao wayombaga, “Lingagi, v'antu' v'enav'a v'ali' v'ingi, na inywe muli'v'ahangi'li'zya ku'tu'mama mili'mo.”<verse eid="EXO 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 5:6" />Lu'siku' lwene lu'lo Falao wav'alagi'li'zyaga v'i'mi'li'zi na v'anyampala na ku'v'awi'la ati', <verse eid="EXO 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 5:7" />“Ku'lamuli'la walelo, v'antu' v'enav'a ku'du' muv'ape hangi' mawulule ga ku'v'ezezya matofali. V'eni'ki'li' v'av'e v'ali'ya ku'kikoov'ela. <verse eid="EXO 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 5:8" />Ali'vi lu'v'alo lwa matofali ago gali'v'eziv'agwa nsiku' zyose, lu'v'e lwene lu'lo. Ku'du' lwangi'le ninga hadoo. V'ali'bu'bu'zya ati', ‘Ku'leku'li'le ku'ye ku'kamufumi'zye Mulungu wiswe vitaambo.’ V'ali'yomba vyeni'vyo ku'nguno v'enav'a v'ali' v'avila. <verse eid="EXO 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 5:9" />V'ezi mili'mo zyav'o ku'v'a milambu muno, ki'gele v'azifumi'zye lu'yi'lo na ku'leka ku'degeleka wu'fi.”<verse eid="EXO 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 5:10" />Hohene v'i'mi'li'zi na v'anyampala v'a v'antu' v'afumaga na ku'v'awi'la V'aizilaeli ati', “Falao ali'yomba i'vi: ‘Nkasye mupe hangi' mawulule. <verse eid="EXO 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 5:11" />Yagi mukakoov'e mawulule inywe v'eni'ki'li', ku' ki'la lwandi' u'ko mukowolile ku'gapandi'ka. Ali'vi mili'mo zinywe ziku'leka ku'dohiwa ninga hadoo.’ ” <verse eid="EXO 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 5:12" />Hohene v'antu' v'asambalaga hose mu nsi' ya Misili, ki'gele v'akoov'e mawulule ga ku'v'ezezya matofali, ali'vi v'apandi'kaga makung'unti'lwa ga viliwa. <verse eid="EXO 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 5:13" />Nav'o v'i'mi'li'zi v'av'akang'anti'zyaga na ku'yomba, “Mugelani'zye mili'mo zinywe zya nsiku' zyose ki'ti' itungo i'lo ndi' mwaletelagwe mawulule.” <verse eid="EXO 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 5:14" />V'i'mi'li'zi v'a Ki'misili v'av'agu'maga v'anyampala v'a Ki'izilaeli, av'o v'asogolilwe kwi'mi'li'zya mili'mo, na ku'v'awu'zya, “Ku' ki' mukafikizye lu'v'alo lwinywe lwa nsiku' zyose lwa matofali, igolo na walelo ki'ti' ha mbu'ki'?”<verse eid="EXO 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 5:15" />Haho v'anyampala v'a Ki'izilaeli v'ayaga ku'kamuli'li'la Falao na ku'yomba ati', “Ku' ki' u'li'ku'v'ezezya vyeni'vi iswe v'asese v'ako? <verse eid="EXO 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 5:16" />V'asese v'ako ku'kav'ile ku'piwa mawulule, ninga vyeni'vyo v'ali'ku'gahani'zya ku'v'ezya matofali. Lingaga, ku'li'gu'mwa, ali'vi ipu'v'yo li'li' lya v'antu' v'ako.” <verse eid="EXO 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 5:17" />Falao wasu'v'yaga ati', “Inywe muli' v'avila, v'avila v'ahanya, hene muli'yomba, ‘Ku'leku'li'le ku'ye ku'kamufumi'zye Gu'ku' Mulungu vitaambo.’ <verse eid="EXO 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 5:18" />Gi'si' yagi ku' mili'mo. Mukav'ile ku'piwa mawulule ninga madoo, na matofali muv'ezye ku' lu'v'alo lwene lu'lo.” <verse eid="EXO 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 5:19" />Hohene v'anyampala v'a Ki'izilaeli v'awonaga v'ali' mu lu'duko, aho v'awi'lagwa ati', “Mukav'ile ku'pu'ngu'zya lu'v'alo lwa matofali ga ki'la lu'siku'.”<verse eid="EXO 5:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 5:20" />Aho v'afumaga ku'mwa Falao, v'apomaga na Mose na Aloni mu nzi'la, aho v'av'age v'av'alindi'lile. <verse eid="EXO 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 5:21" />Hohene v'av'awi'laga Mose na Aloni ati', “Gu'ku' Mulungu ali'wone igambo lyeni'li', amufumi'zye inywe wu'yangu'! Ku'nguno mwaku'v'ezyaga ku'mufufume Falao na v'akumba v'akwe, na ku'v'apa nguno ya ku'ku'wu'laga.”<verse eid="EXO 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mulungu ali'lahana ku'v'akomola V'aizilaeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 5:22" />Hangi' Mose wasu'v'aga ku'mwa Gu'ku' Mulungu na wamuwi'laga ati', “Ev'e Gu'ku', ku' ki' wav'aletelile lu'duko v'antu' v'enav'a? Ku' ki' wantu'mile ene? <verse eid="EXO 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 5:23" />Ku'fuma aho ndi' naya ku'kasu'nsu'mu'la na Falao ku' lina lyako, nawe wav'av'ezezyaga makoye v'antu' v'enav'a, nanho u'kav'ezizye igambo ninga li'mo lya ku'v'akomola v'antu' v'ako!”<verse eid="EXO 5:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="EXO 6" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 6:1" />Ali'vi Gu'ku' Mulungu wasu'v'yaga ati', “Gi'si' u'lawone i'vyo ndamuv'ezezye Falao. Ku' mukono gwanne gwa nguzu alav'aleku'li'le v'antu' v'anne v'awu'ke. Hangi' ku' mukono gwanne gwa nguzu alav'asage v'amufume mu nsi' yakwe.”<verse eid="EXO 6:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 6:2" />Hangi' Mulungu wamuwi'laga Mose, “Ene ni' Gu'ku' Mulungu. <verse eid="EXO 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 6:3" />Nav'ifumi'i'la Abalahamu, Isaka na Yakobo, ki'ti' Mulungu wa Nguzu, ninga i'vi ku' lina lyanne, Gu'ku' Mulungu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lina “Gu'ku' Mulungu” ku' Ki'ebulania li'li' lina “Yahweh” ninga “Yehova.” Hangi' lina “Mulungu wa Nguzu” li'li' lina “El Shadai.”</char></note>, ndi' nkamanyi'kile ku' wav'o. <verse eid="EXO 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 6:4" />Hangi' naki'ndi'ka ilagano nav'o ku'v'a ndav'ape nsi' ya Kanaani, u'ko v'av'age v'ikalile ki'ti' v'ageni. <verse eid="EXO 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 6:5" />Kongelezya genago, nigilwe ki'li'lo cha wu'satu cha V'aizilaeli, i'vyo V'amisili v'ali'v'atu'mamya mili'mo zya ki'sese, nanne nalawagwa ilagano lyanne. <verse eid="EXO 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 6:6" />Ku'nguno yeni'yo, u'v'awi'le V'aizilaeli i'vi: ‘Ene ni' Gu'ku' Mulungu! Nanne ndamufumye mu segeya i'zyo mwatungi'lilwe na V'amisili. Ndamukomole mufume mu wu'sese winywe. Ene ndamukomole ku' mukono gwa nguzu u'go gu'gololokile, u'go gu'lav'ape lu'duko lu'hanya V'amisili. <verse eid="EXO 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 6:7" />Ndamuv'ezye muv'e v'antu' v'anne, nanne ndav'e Mulungu winywe. Haho mulamanye ku'v'a ene hu' ni' Gu'ku' Mulungu, Mulungu winywe, u'yo namufumizye mu segeya zya wu'sese zya V'amisili. <verse eid="EXO 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 6:8" />Nanne ndamufile ku' nsi' i'yo nalahi'la ku'v'apa Abalahamu, Isaka na Yakobo. Ndamupe nsi' yeni'yo yi'v'e yinywe. Ene hu' ni' Gu'ku' Mulungu.’ ” <verse eid="EXO 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 6:9" />Mose wav'awi'laga V'aizilaeli mihayo zyeni'zyo. Ali'vi v'akamudegelekile ku'nguno ya wu'satu wa mu moyo na wu'sese wa ki'kandi.<verse eid="EXO 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 6:10" />Haho Gu'ku' Mulungu wamuwi'laga Mose, <verse eid="EXO 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 6:11" />“Yaga ku'mwa Falao, mutemi wa Misili, u'kamuwi'le av'aleku'li'le V'aizilaeli v'awu'ke mu nsi' yakwe.” <verse eid="EXO 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 6:12" />Ali'vi Mose wasu'v'yaga ati', “Lingaga, u'lu' V'aizilaeli v'akandegelekile ene, vihe, Falao aku'ndegeleka ene muntu' u'yo nkamanya ku'yomba visoga?” <verse eid="EXO 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 6:13" />Haho Gu'ku' Mulungu wayombaga na Mose na Aloni, wav'alagi'li'zyaga ku' V'aizilaeli haki'mo na Falao, mutemi wa Misili, ku'v'a v'av'afumye V'aizilaeli mu nsi' ya Misili.<verse eid="EXO 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nfumi'i'lo ya igongo lyamwa Mose na Aloni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 6:14" />V'enav'a hu' v'av'age v'ahanya v'a magongo ga V'aizilaeli.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EXO 6:14">V'ana v'a ki'gosya v'amwa Lubeni, muv'yalwa wa mbele wamwa Izilaeli, v'av'age: Hanoki, Palu, Heziloni na Kalimi. V'enav'o v'av'age hu' v'ahanya v'a magongo gamwa Lubeni.<verse eid="EXO 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 6:15" />V'ana v'a ki'gosya v'amwa Simiyoni v'av'age: Yemueli, Yamini, Ohadi, Yakini, Sohali na Shauli, u'yo wav'age mwana wa muki'ma Mukanaani. V'enav'o v'av'age hu' v'ahanya v'a magongo gamwa Simiyoni.<verse eid="EXO 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 6:16" />Aga hu' mina ga v'ana v'a ki'gosya v'amwa Lawi na wu'v'yalwa wav'o: Gelesoni, Kohati na Melali. Wikalo wamwa Lawi mu welelo, wikalaga myaka igana li'mo na maku'mi adatu' na mupungati'. <verse eid="EXO 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 6:17" />V'ana v'a ki'gosya v'amwa Gelesoni v'av'age: Libini na Shimei. Magongo gav'o gatemulilwe ku' mina gav'o. <verse eid="EXO 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 6:18" />V'ana v'a ki'gosya v'amwa Kohati v'av'age: Amulamu, Ishali, Hebuloni na Uzieli. Wikalo wamwa Kohati mu welelo, wikalaga myaka igana li'mo na maku'mi adatu' na idatu'. <verse eid="EXO 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 6:19" />V'ana v'a ki'gosya v'amwa Melali v'av'age: Mahili na Mushi. Genaga hu' magongo ga V'alawi ku'londana na wu'v'yalwa wav'o.<verse eid="EXO 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 6:20" />Amulamu wamutoolaga Yokebedi, sengiye, nawe wamuv'yali'laga Aloni na Mose. Wikalo wamwa Amulamu mu welelo, wikalaga myaka igana li'mo na maku'mi adatu' na mupungati'. <verse eid="EXO 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 6:21" />V'ana v'a ki'gosya v'amwa Ishali v'av'age: Kola, Nefegi na Zikili. <verse eid="EXO 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 6:22" />V'ana v'a ki'gosya v'amwa Uzieli v'av'age: Mishaeli, Elisafani na Sitili. <verse eid="EXO 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 6:23" />Aloni wamutoolaga Elisheba, mwaniki' mwana wamwa Aminadabu, ilu'mbu'ye na Nashoni, nawe wamuv'yali'laga: Nadabu, Abihu, Eleazali na Itamali. <verse eid="EXO 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 6:24" />Nav'o v'ana v'a ki'gosya v'amwa Kola v'av'age: Asili, Elikana na Abiasafu, av'o v'av'age v'ahanya v'a igongo lyamwa Kola. <verse eid="EXO 6:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 6:25" />Eleazali, mwana wamwa Aloni, wamutoolaga yu'mo mugati' na v'aniki' v'ana v'amwa Putieli, nawe wamuv'yali'laga mwana, lina lyakwe Finehasi. V'enav'a hu' v'av'age v'ahanya v'a V'alawi na magongo gatemulilwe ku' mina gav'o.<verse eid="EXO 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 6:26" />Aloni na Mose, hu' av'o ndi' v'awi'lwa na Gu'ku' Mulungu, “Muv'afumye v'antu' v'a Izilaeli mu nsi' ya Misili, ku' madale gav'o.” <verse eid="EXO 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 6:27" />Hu' v'ene v'av'o av'o ndi' v'ayombaga na Falao, mutemi wa Misili, ki'gele ku'v'afumya V'aizilaeli mu nsi' ya Misili.<verse eid="EXO 6:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mose na Aloni v'ali'zumya ku'dima mulagi' gwamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 6:28" />Yav'aga lu'siku' u'lo Gu'ku' Mulungu wav'age ali'yomba na Mose mu nsi' ya Misili, <verse eid="EXO 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 6:29" />wamuwi'laga, “Ene hu' ni' Gu'ku' Mulungu. Muwi'le Falao, mutemi wa Misili, mihayo zyose i'zyo nu'ku'wi'la.” <verse eid="EXO 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 6:30" />Ali'vi Mose wasu'v'yaga ati', “Ene nkamanya ku'yomba visoga. Falao aku'ndegeleka vihe?”<verse eid="EXO 6:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="EXO 7" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 7:1" />Gu'ku' Mulungu wamuwi'laga Mose ati', “Lingaga, naku'v'ezyaga u'v'e ki'ti' Mulungu ku'mwa Falao, na mwenu'yo muku'lu'yo Aloni aku'v'a mufumbu'zi wako. <verse eid="EXO 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 7:2" />U'layombe gose ago ndav'e nu'ku'lagi'li'zya, nawe Aloni, muku'lu'yo, alamuwi'le Falao av'aleku'li'le V'aizilaeli v'afume mu nsi' yakwe. <verse eid="EXO 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 7:3" />Ali'vi ndagu'v'ezye moyo gwamwa Falao ku'v'a mulambu, ninga i'vi ndav'ezye lu'manyi'lo na migaka ziv'e mingi mu nsi' ya Misili. <verse eid="EXO 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 7:4" />Ali'vi Falao akasye amudegeleke inywe, nanne ndawu'sye mukono gwanne gwa nguzu na ku'yi'pa lu'duko lu'hanya nsi' ya Misili. Ndav'afumye v'antu' v'anne ku' madale gav'o, v'afume mu nsi' ya Misili. <verse eid="EXO 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 7:5" />Itungo aho ndagu'wu'sye mukono gwanne ku' nsi' ya Misili, na ku'v'afumya V'aizilaeli mugati' yav'o, haho V'amisili v'alamanye ku'v'a ene hu' ni' Gu'ku' Mulungu.” <verse eid="EXO 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 7:6" />Mose na Aloni v'av'ezyaga vyene vivyo ki'ti' i'vyo Gu'ku' Mulungu walagi'li'zyaga. <verse eid="EXO 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 7:7" />Mwenu'yo Mose wasangwa ali' na musimo gwa myaka maku'mi munane, na Aloni wav'age na myaka maku'mi munane na idatu', aho v'ayombaga na Falao.<verse eid="EXO 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mulanga gwamwa Aloni gu'li'v'ezya migaka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 7:8" />Gu'ku' Mulungu wav'awi'laga Mose na Aloni, <verse eid="EXO 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 7:9" />“U'lu' Falao wamuwi'la ati', ‘V'ezi mugaka,’ hohene u'muwi'le Aloni, ‘Sola mulanga gwako u'gu'tagi'le ha nsi' ha mbele yamwa Falao,’ nago mulanga gu'ku'v'a nzoka.” <verse eid="EXO 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 7:10" />Haho Mose na Aloni v'ayaga ku'mwa Falao, v'av'ezyaga ki'ti' i'vyo Gu'ku' Mulungu walagi'li'zyaga. Aloni wagu'tagi'laga mulanga ha nsi' ha mbele yamwa Falao haki'mo na v'akumba v'akwe, nago mulanga gwagalu'kaga ku'v'a nzoka. <verse eid="EXO 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 7:11" />Ali'vi Falao nawe wav'itanaga v'alogi na v'afumu, na v'amanyi v'enav'a v'a Ki'misili nav'o v'av'ezyaga vyene vivyo ku' mbisi'i'la ya wu'manyi wav'o. <verse eid="EXO 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 7:12" />Ki'la yu'mo wagu'tagi'laga mulanga gwakwe ha nsi', nago gwagalu'kaga ku'v'a nzoka. Ali'vi mulanga gwamwa Aloni gwazimilaga milanga zyav'o. <verse eid="EXO 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 7:13" />Ali'vi moyo gwamwa Falao gwav'aga mulambu. Akav'adegelekile Mose na Aloni, ki'ti' i'vyo Gu'ku' Mulungu wayombile.<verse eid="EXO 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vigu'mo iku'mi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 7:14-12:36">Ku'fuma 7:14-12:36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="s2">Ki'gu'mo cha kwandya: Minzi' ku'v'a magazi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 7:14" />Hangi' Gu'ku' Mulungu wamuwi'laga Mose ati', “Moyo gwamwa Falao mulambu. Ali'kaana ku'v'aleku'li'la V'aizilaeli v'awu'ke. <verse eid="EXO 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 7:15" />Hohene, igolo ndiyu' u'ye ku'mwa Falao, itungo i'lo alav'e ayile ku' mongo gwa Naili. U'kamulindi'le ha ngiligili ya mongo, ki'gele mwiwone nawe. U'sole mulanga mu makono gako u'go ndi' gwagalu'ka ku'v'a nzoka. <verse eid="EXO 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 7:16" />Hangi' u'muwi'le, ‘Gu'ku' Mulungu, Mulungu wa V'aebulania, wantu'maga nize nku'wi'le i'vi: “V'aleku'li'le v'antu' v'anne v'aye, ki'gele v'akanyisenge ku' ibalangu'. Lingaga, ali'vi mpaka gi'si' u'kav'ile ku'ndegeleka.” <verse eid="EXO 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 7:17" />Hohene Gu'ku' Mulungu ali'yomba ku' igambo lyeni'li' u'ku'mumanya ku'v'a mweni'ki'li' ali' nde: Lingaga, ene nku'gagu'ma minzi' genaga ga Naili na mulanga u'gu' ni'nago mu makono ganne, nago gaku'galu'ka ku'v'a magazi. <verse eid="EXO 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 7:18" />Nsonvi i'zyo zili'mo mu mongo gwenu'go gwa Naili ziku'fwa, na minzi' ga mongo gaku'nunha muno, na V'amisili v'alapotwe ku'ganywa.’ ”<verse eid="EXO 7:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 7:19" />Hangi' Gu'ku' Mulungu wamuwi'laga Mose ati', “Muwi'le Aloni, ‘Sola mulanga gwako, u'golole mukono gwako u'gu'sunge ha igu'lya na minzi' ga Misili, ha igu'lya na myongo, tu'syelele twa minzi', matav'a na malambo gose,’ nago gaku'galu'ka gav'e magazi. Magazi galav'e hose mu Misili, ninga mu viseme vya miti' na vya mawe.”<verse eid="EXO 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 7:20" />Mose na Aloni v'av'ezyaga ki'ti' i'vyo Gu'ku' Mulungu wav'alagi'li'zyaga. Aloni wagu'wu'syaga mulanga ha mbele ya minso gamwa Falao, haki'mo na v'akumba v'akwe. Wagagu'maga minzi' ga mongo gwa Naili, na minzi' gose gagalu'kaga ku'v'a magazi. <verse eid="EXO 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 7:21" />Nsonvi zya mu mongo zyafwaga, nago mongo gwanunhaga muno. V'amisili v'apotagwa ku'ganywa minzi' genago. Magazi gakwi'laga hose mu nsi' ya Misili. <verse eid="EXO 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 7:22" />Ali'vi v'afumu v'a Misili, ku' mbisi'i'la ya wu'fumu wav'o, nav'o v'av'ezyaga vyene vivyo, nago moyo gwamwa Falao gwav'aga mulambu. Akav'adegelekile Mose na Aloni, ki'ti' i'vyo Gu'ku' Mulungu ndi' wayombaga. <verse eid="EXO 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 7:23" />Hohene, Falao wasu'v'aga mu nnumba yakwe, na igambo lyeni'lo akali'tu'u'lile mu moyo. <verse eid="EXO 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 7:24" />V'amisili v'ose v'asi'mbangaga mu ngiligili ya mongo gwa Naili, ki'gele v'apandi'ke minzi' ga ku'nywa, ku'nguno ndi' v'apotwa ku'ganywa minzi' ga mu mongo.<verse eid="EXO 7:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 7:25" />Zyav'i'taga nsiku' mupungati' ku'fuma aho Gu'ku' Mulungu wagu'gu'maga mongo gwa Naili.<verse eid="EXO 7:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="EXO 8" />
  <para style="s">Ki'gu'mo cha wu'v'i'li': Vyu'la</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 8:1" />Haho Gu'ku' Mulungu wamuwi'laga Mose ati', “Yaga ku'mwa Falao, u'kamuwi'le ati', ‘Gu'ku' Mulungu ali'yomba i'vi: “V'aleku'li'le v'antu' v'anne v'aye, ki'gele v'akanyisenge. <verse eid="EXO 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 8:2" />Ali'vi u'lu' u'kaane ku'v'aleku'li'la v'awu'ke, nhana, nku'yi'gu'ma nsi' yose ku' ku'leta vyu'la. <verse eid="EXO 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 8:3" />Mongo gwa Naili gu'kokala vyu'la, hangi' navyo viku'liina mu nnumba yako, na ku'mbele ku' wako kwa ku'lala, na ha wu'li'li' wako, na mu nnumba zya v'akumba v'ako, na ku' v'antu' v'ako. Vyu'la vyeni'vyo vikwingi'la mu maliko ginywe na mu viseme vya ku'kanyi'la wu'fuma. <verse eid="EXO 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 8:4" />Hangi' vyu'la vyeni'vyo, viku'ku'liini'li'la ha igu'lya na muv'i'li' gwako, na ku' miv'i'li' zya v'antu' v'ako haki'mo na v'akumba v'ako v'ose.” ’ ”<verse eid="EXO 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 8:5" />Haho Gu'ku' Mulungu wamuwi'laga Mose ati', “Muwi'le Aloni agolole mukono gwakwe na mulanga gwakwe agu'sunge ha igu'lya na myongo, tu'syelele twa minzi' na matav'a, navyo vyu'la vikwiza ha igu'lya na nsi' yose ya Misili.” <verse eid="EXO 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 8:6" />Hohene Aloni wagololaga mukono gwakwe ha igu'lya na minzi' ga Misili, navyo vyu'la vyafumaga na ku'yi'kumba nsi' yose ya Misili. <verse eid="EXO 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 8:7" />Ali'vi v'afumu nav'o ku' mbisi'i'la ya wu'fumu wav'o, v'av'ezyaga vyene vivyo na ku'vileta vyu'la mu Misili.<verse eid="EXO 8:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 8:8" />Haho Falao wav'itanaga Mose na Aloni, wav'awi'laga, “Mumulombe Gu'ku' Mulungu avisinie vyu'la ku' wanne na ku' v'antu' v'anne, nanne nku'v'aleku'li'la v'antu' v'inywe v'aye ku'kamufumi'zya Gu'ku' Mulungu ki'taambo.” <verse eid="EXO 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 8:9" />Mose wamuwi'laga Falao ati', “Nu'ku'pa isima na ku'ku'wi'la u'sogole lu'siku' u'lo u'li'koov'a nku'lombele ku'mwa Gu'ku' Mulungu, ev'e, v'akumba v'ako na v'antu' v'ako, ki'gele vyu'la vizimangu'ziwe, vifume ku' wako na ku' v'antu' v'ako. Vyu'la vilasigale ku' mongo gwa Naili du'.” <verse eid="EXO 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 8:10" />Falao wasu'v'yaga, “Igolo.” Mose wayombaga ati', “Yi'ku'v'a ki'ti' i'vi u'li'yomba, ki'gele u'manye ku'v'a ku'du'hu' yu'ngi' ki'ti' Gu'ku' Mulungu, Mulungu wiswe. <verse eid="EXO 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 8:11" />Vyu'la vilafume ku' wako, mu nnumba zyako, ku' v'akumba v'ako na ku' v'antu' v'ako. Vilasigale mu mongo gwa Naili du'.”<verse eid="EXO 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 8:12" />Hohene Mose na Aloni v'afumaga ku'mwa Falao, nawe Mose wamuli'li'laga Gu'ku' Mulungu, ki'gele amusini'zye Falao vyu'la i'vyo ndi' wavileta. <verse eid="EXO 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 8:13" />Nawe Gu'ku' Mulungu, wav'ezyaga ki'ti' i'vi Mose walombaga. Vyu'la vyafwi'laga mu nnumba, mu masesa na mu migu'nda. <verse eid="EXO 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 8:14" />V'agakumingaga matuntu matuntu, na nsi' yose yanunhaga. <verse eid="EXO 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 8:15" />Ali'vi Falao, aho wawonaga ku'v'a hav'aga hambu'hambu', wav'ezyaga moyo gwakwe ku'v'a mulambu, ninga akav'adegelekile Mose na Aloni, ki'ti' i'vyo Gu'ku' Mulungu wali' wayombaga.<verse eid="EXO 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Ki'gu'mo cha wu'datu': Mpani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 8:16" />Hangi' Gu'ku' Mulungu wamuwi'laga Mose ati', “Muwi'le Aloni awu'sye mulanga gwakwe agu'me lu'wuwu lwa nsi', nalo lu'ku'galu'ka ku'v'a mpani mu nsi' yose ya Misili.” <verse eid="EXO 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 8:17" />Mose na Aloni v'av'ezyaga vyeni'vyo. Aloni wawu'syaga mulanga gwakwe, na walu'gu'maga lu'wuwu lwa nsi', nalo lwagalu'kaga ku'v'a mpani, na ku'v'aliini'li'la v'antu' haki'mo na ndimu. Lu'wuwu lose mu nsi' yose ya Misili, lwagalu'kaga ku'v'a mpani. <verse eid="EXO 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 8:18" />Nav'o v'afumu v'agemaga ku' wu'fumu wav'o ku'v'ezya mpani, ali'vi v'akakowolile. Mpani zyeni'zyo wasambalaga ku' v'antu' na ku' ndimu. <verse eid="EXO 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 8:19" />V'afumu v'enav'o v'amuwi'laga Falao ati', “Igambo lyeni'li' gu'li' mukono gwamwa Mulungu.” Ali'vi moyo gwamwa Falao gwendeleyaga ku'v'a mulambu, akav'adegelekile Mose na Aloni. Yav'aga ki'ti' i'vyo Gu'ku' Mulungu ndi' wayomba.<verse eid="EXO 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Ki'gu'mo cha wu'ne: Nsasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 8:20" />Hangi' Gu'ku' Mulungu wamuwi'laga Mose, “Igolo wipune ndiyu', u'ye ku'mwa Falao, itungo i'lo alav'e ayile ku' mongo. U'muwi'le ati', ‘Gu'ku' Mulungu ali'yomba i'vi: “V'aleku'li'le v'antu' v'anne v'awu'ke, ki'gele v'akanyisenge. <verse eid="EXO 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 8:21" />U'lu' u'kaane ku'v'aleku'li'la v'antu' v'anne v'awu'ke, nhana, ndalete madale mahanya ga nsasi, ku' wako, ku' v'akumba v'ako, ku' v'antu' v'ako na ku' nnumba zinywe, na nnumba zya V'amisili zilokale nsasi. Nsi' yose ya Misili yi'lokale nsasi. <verse eid="EXO 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 8:22" />Ali'vi lu'siku' lwenu'lo ku' lwandi' lwa Gosheni u'ko v'ikalile v'antu' v'anne, ku'kasye ku'v'e na nsasi. Haho u'lamanye ku'v'a ni' Gu'ku' Mulungu, nu'v'ezya genaga mu nsi' yeni'yi'. <verse eid="EXO 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 8:23" />Nanne ndav'aki'ge v'antu' v'anne, ki'gele galeke ku'v'apandi'ka magambo ago galav'apandi'ke v'antu' v'ako. Lu'manyi'lo lwa mugaka gwenu'go gu'lav'ezyeke igolo.” ’ ” <verse eid="EXO 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 8:24" />Gu'ku' Mulungu wav'ezyaga vyeni'vyo. Madale mahanya ga nsasi gingi'laga mu nnumba yamwa Falao, na nnumba zya v'akumba v'akwe, na nsi' yose ya Misili yav'ipaga ku'nguno ya nsasi.<verse eid="EXO 8:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 8:25" />Haho Falao wamwitanaga Mose na Aloni na ku'v'awi'la ati', “Yagi mukamufumi'zye Mulungu winywe ki'taambo, ali'vi yi'v'e mwenu'mu mu Misili.” <verse eid="EXO 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 8:26" />Haho Mose wasu'v'yaga ati', “Lyeni'li' li'kakowoleka. Ku'nguno ki'taambo i'cho ku'lamufumi'zye Gu'ku' Mulungu, Mulungu wiswe, ha mbele ya V'amisili, ki'li' igayi'li'zyo. V'amisili u'lu' v'aku'wone ku'li'fumya ki'taambo i'cho ki'li' igayi'li'zyo ha mbele yav'o, vihe, v'akasye v'aku'gu'me na mawe v'aku'wu'lage? <verse eid="EXO 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 8:27" />Yi'li'ku'dima ku'ya musi'nzo gwa nsiku' idatu' mu ibalangu' ku'kamufumi'zye Gu'ku' Mulungu, Mulungu wiswe, ki'taambo ki'ti' i'vyo walagi'li'zyaga.”<verse eid="EXO 8:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 8:28" />Falao wayombaga, “Nku'muleku'li'la muye ku'kamufumi'zya Mulungu winywe ki'taambo kwenu'ko ku' ibalangu', ali'vi ku'du' muye ku'tali'. Gi'si' mundombele.” <verse eid="EXO 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 8:29" />Mose wasu'v'yaga, “Nku'v'a u'lu' nawu'ka du' na ku'ku'leka henanha, nku'mulomba Gu'ku' Mulungu, igolo nsasi zyose zisini'ke ku' wako, ku' v'akumba v'ako na v'antu' v'ako. Ali'vi ku'du' wize u'v'ezye wu'yengani wa ku'kaana ku'v'aleku'li'la v'antu' ku'ya ku'kamufumi'zya Gu'ku' Mulungu ki'taambo.”<verse eid="EXO 8:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 8:30" />Hohene Mose wahafumaga hamwa Falao na wamulombaga Gu'ku' Mulungu. <verse eid="EXO 8:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 8:31" />Nawe Gu'ku' Mulungu wav'ezyaga ki'ti' i'vyo Mose walombaga. Madale ga nsasi gasini'kaga ku'mwa Falao, v'akumba v'akwe na v'antu' v'akwe, lu'kasigalile ninga lu'mo. <verse eid="EXO 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 8:32" />Ali'vi hangi' Falao wendeleyaga ku'v'a na moyo mulambu. Akav'aleku'li'lile V'aizilaeli v'awu'ke.<verse eid="EXO 8:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="EXO 9" />
  <para style="s2">Ki'gu'mo cha wu'tano: Ku'fwa kwa mitugo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 9:1" />Haho Gu'ku' Mulungu wamuwi'laga Mose, “Yaga ku'mwa Falao, u'kamuwi'le ati', ‘Gu'ku' Mulungu, Mulungu wa V'aebulania, ali'yomba i'vi: “V'aleku'li'le v'antu' v'anne v'awu'ke, ki'gele v'akanyisenge. <verse eid="EXO 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 9:2" />U'lu' u'kaanile ku'v'aleku'li'la v'awu'ke, na u'lu' wendeleye ku'v'adimi'li'la, <verse eid="EXO 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 9:3" />nhana, ndawu'sye mukono gwanne na ku'leta malwile ga tauni ku' mitugo zinywe zyose: falasi, mpunda, ntwangawu'lende, ng'ombe, nkolo na mbu'li. <verse eid="EXO 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 9:4" />Ali'vi ndazikome mitugo zya V'aizilaeli na mitugo zya V'amisili, ki'gele ndimu zya V'aizilaeli ku'du' yi'fwe ninga yi'mo.” ’ ”<verse eid="EXO 9:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 9:5" />Hangi' Gu'ku' Mulungu watu'u'laga itungo lya ku'v'ezya na wayombaga, “Igolo ene Gu'ku' Mulungu ndali'v'ezye igambo lyeni'li' mu nsi' ya Misili.” <verse eid="EXO 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 9:6" />Wangalu'ke Gu'ku' Mulungu wav'ezyaga ki'ti' i'vyo wakayombaga. Mitugo zyose zya V'amisili zyafwaga, ali'vi ku'du'hu' mutugo ninga gu'mo gwa V'aizilaeli u'go gwafwaga. <verse eid="EXO 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 9:7" />Falao wawu'zi'li'zyaga, nawe wawi'lagwa ati', lingaga, ku'du'hu' mutugo ninga gu'mo gwa V'aizilaeli u'go gwafwaga! Ali'vi Falao wendeleyaga ku'v'a na moyo mulambu, wakaanaga ku'v'aleku'li'la V'aizilaeli v'awu'ke.<verse eid="EXO 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ki'gu'mo cha mukaga: Mapute</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 9:8" />Gu'ku' Mulungu wamuwi'laga Mose na Aloni ati', “Soli matunde ha itanuli mu viganza, nawe Mose agapepemule mu igu'lya ha mbele yamwa Falao. <verse eid="EXO 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 9:9" />Matunde genago galav'e lu'wuwu lu'bu'hu ha igu'lya na nsi' yose ya Misili. Lu'wuwu lu'lalenge mapute ago galatunyu'ke na ku'v'a malonda ku' v'antu' na ku' ndimu, mu nsi' yose ya Misili.” <verse eid="EXO 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 9:10" />Hohene v'asolaga matunde ga ha itanuli, na v'i'maga ha mbele yamwa Falao. Nawe Mose wagapepemulaga matunde mu igu'lya, nago galengaga mapute ga ku'vindi'zya na ku'tunyu'ka ku' miv'i'li' zya v'antu' na ku' ndimu. <verse eid="EXO 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 9:11" />Nav'o v'afumu v'aki'i'mile ha mbele yamwa Mose, ku'nguno na v'ene v'apandi'kaga mapute mu miv'i'li' zyav'o, ki'ti' V'amisili v'angi' v'ose. <verse eid="EXO 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 9:12" />Ali'vi Gu'ku' Mulungu wagu'v'ezyaga moyo gwamwa Falao ku'v'a mulambu, nawe akav'adegelekile Mose na Aloni, ki'ti' i'vyo Mulungu wamuwi'lile Mose.<verse eid="EXO 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Ki'gu'mo cha mupungati': Nvula ya mawe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 9:13" />Hangi' wamuwi'laga Mose ati', “Igolo wipune ndiyu', u'ki'i'me ha mbele yamwa Falao, u'muwi'le ati', ‘Gu'ku' Mulungu, Mulungu wa V'aebulania, ali'yomba i'vi: “V'aleku'li'le v'antu' v'anne v'awu'ke, ki'gele v'akanyisenge. <verse eid="EXO 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 9:14" />Ku'nguno itungo i'li' ndalete vigu'mo vidaki ku' wako, ku' v'akumba v'ako na v'antu' v'ako. Haho u'lamanye ku'v'a hadu'hu' yu'ngi' ki'ti' ene mu welelo yose. <verse eid="EXO 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 9:15" />Itungo lyeni'li' nali' mbe nagololile mukono gwanne ku'ku'gu'ma ev'e na v'antu' v'ako ku' malwile ga tauni, inywe mwali' muku'v'a mwazimangu'kile mu welelo. <verse eid="EXO 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 9:16" />Ali'vi namulekile inywe muv'e na wikalo ku' ndaka yeni'yi', ki'gele mulagi'le wu'kowozi wanne, na lina lyanne li'kumu'kiwe mu welelo yose. <verse eid="EXO 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 9:17" />Ali'vi u'kaali' u'li'wiku'li'li'zya ku' v'antu' v'anne, na u'kaanile ku'v'aleku'li'la v'awu'ke. <verse eid="EXO 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 9:18" />Lingaga, igolo itungo ki'ti' lyeni'li' ndalete nvula ya mawe nhanya muno, i'yo yi'kaali' yi'tonyage mu nsi' ya Misili, ku'fumi'i'la aho yakatundi'lwa mpaka walelo. <verse eid="EXO 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 9:19" />Ku'nguno yeni'yo u'fumye ilagi'li'zyo, mitugo zyako zyose ziku'fume ku' idi'ma, na vintu' vyako vyose i'vyo vili' ku' migu'nda vitu'u'lwe ha wu'salama. Ku'nguno nvula ya mawe yi'lamutonyele ki'la muntu' na ki'la ndimu. U'yo alasangwe akav'ile ha lu'go alafwe.” ’ ”<verse eid="EXO 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 9:20" />Mugati' na v'akumba v'amwa Falao av'o ndi' v'ogoha muhayo gwamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu v'av'ezyaga wangu' ku'v'aleta v'asese v'av'o na mitugo zyav'o mu nnumba mu wu'salama. <verse eid="EXO 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 9:21" />Ali'vi av'o v'akogohile muhayo gwamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu v'av'alekaga v'asese v'av'o na mitugo zyav'o ku' migu'nda.<verse eid="EXO 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 9:22" />Haho Gu'ku' Mulungu wamuwi'laga Mose, “Golola mukono gwako mu igu'lya mu ilunde ki'gele nvula ya mawe yi'tonye mu Misili yose. Yi'v'atonyele v'antu', ndimu na mimelo zyose zya mu migu'nda.” <verse eid="EXO 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 9:23" />Mose aho wawu'syaga mulanga gwakwe mu igu'lya mu ilunde, nawe Gu'ku' Mulungu waletaga ngilimo na nvula ya mawe. Moto gwa nku'v'a gwameku'laga mpaka ha nsi'. I'vi hu' vyene Gu'ku' Mulungu waletaga nvula ya mawe mu nsi' ya Misili. <verse eid="EXO 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 9:24" />Hohene nvula nhanya ya mawe yatonyaga, na nku'v'a yameku'laga hose. Yav'aga li'tete ihanya i'lo li'kaali' ligelage mu nsi' yose ya Misili, ku'fumi'i'la aho yakatundi'lwa mpaka walelo. <verse eid="EXO 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 9:25" />Nvula ya mawe yeni'yo yav'ipyaga ki'la ki'ntu' mu nsi' yose ya Misili i'cho chav'age mu migu'nda. Yagu'maga ndimu haki'mo na v'antu' av'o v'av'age mu migu'nda. Nvula yeni'yo ya mawe yav'ipyaga mimelo na ku'vunagu'la ki'la muti'. <verse eid="EXO 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 9:26" />Igambo lyeni'lo lyav'ezyekaga mu nsi' yose ya Misili, sumbwa ku' Gosheni u'ko v'av'age v'ikalile V'aizilaeli nvula ya mawe ndi' yi'katonyile.<verse eid="EXO 9:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 9:27" />Hohene Falao wav'itanaga Mose na Aloni, na wav'awi'laga, “Lu'gendo u'lu' nav'ezyaga wu'kenagu'zi. Gu'ku' Mulungu ali' wa lole, ene na v'antu' v'anne kwahu'v'ile. <verse eid="EXO 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 9:28" />Mumulombe Gu'ku' Mulungu, ku'nguno ngilimo na nvula yeni'yi' ya mawe zyalenga! Ene nku'muleku'li'la muwu'ke. Ku'du' mwendeleye kwikala henanha.” <verse eid="EXO 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 9:29" />Nawe Mose wasu'v'yaga ati', “Nku'v'a du' mbe nafuma ha ibala na kaya, nku'wu'sya makono na ku'mulomba Gu'ku' Mulungu. Ngilimo na nvula ya mawe viku'leka. Haho u'ku'manya ku'v'a welelo yi'li' yamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu. <verse eid="EXO 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 9:30" />Ali'vi manyile ku'v'a ev'e na v'akumba v'ako mukaali' ku'mogoha Gu'ku' Mulungu.”<verse eid="EXO 9:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 9:31" />Katani na shayili vyose vyav'ipaga, ku'nguno shayili yasangwa yi'li' na ngala na katani yav'age yi'li' na malawu', <verse eid="EXO 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 9:32" />ali'vi ngano na mimelo zingi' zya mpese zikav'ipile ku'nguno ndi' zikaali' ku'komeela.<verse eid="EXO 9:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 9:33" />Haho Mose wahafumaga hamwa Falao, wayaga ha ibala na kaya. Hohene wawu'syaga makono gakwe ku'mulomba Gu'ku' Mulungu. Ngilimo na nvula ya mawe zyadugaga, na nvula yalekaga ku'tonya mu nsi'. <verse eid="EXO 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 9:34" />Ali'vi Falao aho wawonaga ku'v'a nvula, ngilimo na nvula ya mawe zyadugaga, wasu'v'i'laga hangi' wu'kenagu'zi wakwe. Mweni'ki'li' na v'akumba v'akwe v'av'aga na myoyo milambu. <verse eid="EXO 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 9:35" />Hohene moyo gwamwa Falao gwendeleyaga ku'v'a mulambu. Wakaanaga ku'v'aleku'li'la V'aizilaeli v'aye, ki'ti' i'vyo Gu'ku' Mulungu wayombile ku'v'i'ti'la mulomo gwamwa Mose.<verse eid="EXO 9:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="EXO 10" />
  <para style="s2">Ki'gu'mo cha munane: Nzige</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 10:1" />Gu'ku' Mulungu wamuwi'laga Mose, “Yaga ku'mwa Falao. Ene namuv'ezyaga av'e na moyo mulambu haki'mo na v'akumba v'akwe ki'gele mbezye lu'manyi'lo lwa migaka mugati' nav'o. <verse eid="EXO 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 10:2" />Hangi' na inywe mwize muv'atentemuli'le v'ana na v'izu'ku'lu' v'inywe, i'vyo nav'av'ezezizye V'amisili ku' wu'daki, na ku'v'ezya lu'manyi'lo lwa migaka mugati' nav'o. Hu' i'vyo mulamanye ku'v'a ene ni' Gu'ku' Mulungu.”<verse eid="EXO 10:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 10:3" />Hohene Mose na Aloni v'ayaga ku'mwa Falao na v'amuwi'laga, “Gu'ku' Mulungu, Mulungu wa V'aebulania, ali'yomba i'vi: ‘Mpaka nanali' u'kwendeleya ku'kaana kwitunia ha mbele yanne? V'aleku'li'le v'antu' v'anne v'awu'ke, ki'gele v'akanyisenge. <verse eid="EXO 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 10:4" />U'lu' u'kaane ku'v'aleku'li'la v'antu' v'anne v'awu'ke, nhana, igolo ndalete nzige ziyi'tinge nsi' yako. <verse eid="EXO 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 10:5" />Nsi' yose ya Misili yi'lakumbwe na nzige zyeni'zyo mpaka yi'laleke kwigela. Zilalye ki'la chene i'cho chasigali'lile ha itungo lya nvula i'yo ya mawe. Hangi' zilalye ki'la madu'tu' ago gafulumile ku' miti' mu migu'nda zinywe. <verse eid="EXO 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 10:6" />Nzige zyeni'zyo zilokale mu nnumba zyako, mu nnumba zya v'akumba v'ako na zya V'amisili v'ose. Zilav'e na wingi u'wo ninga v'a sinywe na v'agu'ku' v'inywe v'akaali' v'awonage ku'fuma ku'v'yalwa kwav'o mpaka walelo.’ ” Hohene Mose wahafumaga hamwa Falao.<verse eid="EXO 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 10:7" />V'akumba v'amwa Falao v'amuwu'zyaga, “Vihe, muntu' mwenu'yu' alaku'tusye mpaka nanali'? V'aleku'li'le v'antu' v'enav'a v'awu'ke v'aye v'akamwisenge Gu'ku' Mulungu, Mulungu wav'o. Vihe, u'kaali' ku'manya ku'v'a nsi' yakav'ipa?”<verse eid="EXO 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 10:8" />Haho Mose na Aloni v'itanagwa v'asu'v'e ku'mwa Falao, nawe wav'awi'laga ati', “Yagi mukamwisenge Gu'ku' Mulungu, Mulungu winywe. Ali'vi nu'wu'zya, v'a nde muku'ya nav'o?” <verse eid="EXO 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 10:9" />Mose wasu'v'yaga ati', “Ku'ku'ya na v'asu'mbana na v'aniki', v'anamala na v'akiku'lu', haki'mo na v'ana v'iswe v'a ki'ki'ma na v'a ki'gosya, haki'mo na ng'ombe, nkolo na mbu'li ziswe zyose. Ku'ku'ya iswe v'ose ku'nguno ku'li'kamuv'ezezya mwanya Gu'ku' Mulungu.”<verse eid="EXO 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 10:10" />Falao wav'awi'laga ati', “Gu'ku' Mulungu av'e haki'mo na inywe, u'lu' muleku'li'le muwu'ke haki'mo na v'aki' v'inywe na v'ana v'inywe. Yi'manyi'kile ku'v'a muli' na ndaka mbi mu myoyo zinywe. <verse eid="EXO 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 10:11" />Ayi' ng'o yi'kakowoleka! V'agosya du' av'o v'aku'ya ku'kamwisenga Gu'ku' Mulungu, ku'nguno lyeni'lo hu' lyene muli'lombaga.” Haho Aloni na Mose v'asagagwa ha mbele ya minso gamwa Falao.<verse eid="EXO 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 10:12" />Gu'ku' Mulungu wamuwi'laga Mose, “Golola mukono gwako mu igu'lya na nsi' ya Misili, ki'gele nzige ziyi'kumbe nsi', na ku'lya mimelo zyose i'zyo zyasigalile ha itungo lya nvula ya mawe.” <verse eid="EXO 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 10:13" />Hohene wawu'syaga mulanga gwakwe na ku'gu'sunga ha igu'lya na nsi' ya Misili. Gu'ku' Mulungu waletaga muyaga ku'fuma mu ki'ya, na gwayumaga lyu'v'a zelele wu'ziku'pee. Aho wu'ziku' wasyaga muyaga gwenu'go gwaletaga nzige. <verse eid="EXO 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 10:14" />Nzige zyayi'kumbaga Misili yose na zyasambalaga hose mu nsi'. Nzige zyeni'zyo zyav'age idale ihanya muno, li'kaali' kwigela idale ki'ti' lyeni'lo na li'kasye ligele hangi'. <verse eid="EXO 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 10:15" />Nzige zyeni'zyo zyayi'kumbaga nsi' yose ya Misili, mpaka nsi' yose yav'aga giti. Zyalyaga mimelo zyose na visumo vyose vya ku' miti' i'vyo ndi' vyasigali'lile ha itungo lya nvula ya mawe. Hadu'hu' idu'tu' ninga li'mo i'lo ndi' lyasigali'la ku' miti' ninga ku' ki'la mumelo mu nsi' ya Misili.<verse eid="EXO 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 10:16" />Haho Falao wav'itanaga Mose na Aloni wangu', na ku'v'awi'la, “Nav'ezyaga wu'kenagu'zi ku'mwa Gu'ku' Mulungu, Mulungu winywe, na ku' winywe. <verse eid="EXO 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 10:17" />Ku'nguno yeni'yo nu'mulomba muntondole wu'kenagu'zi wanne kenaka du'. Mukandombele ku'mwa Gu'ku' Mulungu, Mulungu winywe, ansini'zye lu'fu lwenu'lu'.” <verse eid="EXO 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 10:18" />Hohene Mose wawu'kaga hamwa Falao, na wamulombaga Gu'ku' Mulungu. <verse eid="EXO 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 10:19" />Nawe Gu'ku' Mulungu wagalu'laga muyaga ku'v'a mudaki gu'fumi'i'le mu mweli, nago gwaziwu'syaga nzige zyose na ku'zipepemuli'la mu Nyanza ya Shamu. Ku'du'hu' nzige ninga yi'mo i'yo ndi' yasigali'la mu nsi' yose ya Misili. <verse eid="EXO 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 10:20" />Ali'vi Gu'ku' Mulungu wagu'v'ezyaga moyo gwamwa Falao ku'v'a mulambu, nawe Falao akav'aleku'li'lile V'aizilaeli v'awu'ke.<verse eid="EXO 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Ki'gu'mo cha kenda: Giti totolo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 10:21" />Gu'ku' Mulungu wamuwi'laga Mose, “Golola mukono gwako mu igu'lya mu ilunde, ki'gele yi'v'eho giti totolo mu nsi' yose ya Misili, i'yo yi'ku'v'av'ezya v'antu' v'apalapasye mu giti.” <verse eid="EXO 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 10:22" />Hohene Mose wawu'syaga mukono gwakwe mu igu'lya mu ilunde, na giti nhanya yayi'kumbaga nsi' yose ya Misili ku' nsiku' idatu'. <verse eid="EXO 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 10:23" />V'antu' v'alekaga kwiwona, ninga ku'segezya ku'fuma aho ki'la mwene yamusangi'laga giti ku' nsiku' zyeni'zyo idatu'. Ali'vi V'aizilaeli v'ose v'av'age na mwanga ku' Gosheni u'ko ndi' v'ikalile.<verse eid="EXO 10:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 10:24" />Haho Falao wamwitanaga Mose, wamuwi'laga, “Yagi mukamwisenge Gu'ku' Mulungu, Mulungu winywe, v'aki' v'inywe na v'ana v'inywe muyage nav'o. Ali'vi ng'ombe, nkolo na mbu'li zinywe muzileke.” <verse eid="EXO 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 10:25" />Ali'vi Mose wasu'v'yaga ati', “Yi'li'ku'dima u'ku'leku'li'le ku'sole na ndimu zya vitaambo vya ku'zigya na zya vitaambo vingi', ki'gele ku'kamwisenge Gu'ku' Mulungu, Mulungu wiswe. <verse eid="EXO 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 10:26" />Yi'li'ku'dima ku'wu'ke na mitugo ziswe, ku'du'hu' chu'ga ninga ki'mo cha ku'sigala. Ku'nguno mugati' na mitugo zyeni'zyo ku'kamanya i'zyo zili'koov'iwa ku'mufumi'zya Gu'ku' Mulungu, Mulungu wiswe, ki'taambo. Ku' itungo lyeni'li' ku'kaali' ku'manya ndimu zya Ku'sogola mpaka aho ku'lafike kwenu'ko.”<verse eid="EXO 10:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 10:27" />Ali'vi Gu'ku' Mulungu wagu'v'ezyaga moyo gwamwa Falao ku'v'a mulambu. Falao wakaanaga ku'v'aleku'li'la V'aizilaeli v'awu'ke. <verse eid="EXO 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 10:28" />Hangi' wamuwi'laga Mose ati', “Hafume ha mbele yanne! Wiangali'le muno. Ku'du' wize u'mbone hangi'. Lu'siku' u'lize ha mbele yanne u'lafwe.” <verse eid="EXO 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 10:29" />Mose wasu'v'yaga ati', “Yi'v'age ki'ti' i'vi wayombaga. Nkasye nize ku'ku'wona hangi'!”<verse eid="EXO 10:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="EXO 11" />
  <para style="s2">Ki'gu'mo cha iku'mi: Ku'wu'lagwa v'av'yalwa v'a mbele</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 11:1" />Hohene Gu'ku' Mulungu wamuwi'laga Mose ati', “Ku'kaali' ku'li' na ki'gu'mo ki'mo i'cho ndetile ku'mwa Falao na v'antu' v'a mu nsi' ya Misili. Haho alamuleku'li'le muwu'ke henanha, nawe u'lu' wamuleku'li'la, alamusage muku'fume ku'no kayekaye. <verse eid="EXO 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 11:2" />Gi'si' u'v'awi'le V'aizilaeli ati', ki'la mugosya na muki'ma yi'li'mudima alombe ku' muzenganwa wakwe vintu' vya mupango i'vyo viv'eziv'ilwe ku' mawe ga feza na zahabu.” <verse eid="EXO 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 11:3" />Haho Gu'ku' Mulungu wav'av'ezyaga V'amisili v'av'e na moyo gwa wu'hegela ku' V'aizilaeli. Hangi' nawe Mose waku'ziv'agwa muno mu nsi' ya Misili, na ha mbele ya v'akumba v'amwa Falao, na mu minso ga v'antu' v'ose v'a mu Misili.<verse eid="EXO 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 11:4" />Haho Mose wamuwi'laga Falao ati', “Gu'ku' Mulungu ali'yomba i'vi: ‘Ha itungo lya wu'ziku' hagati' walelo, nku'v'i'ta hagati' na nsi' ya Misili. <verse eid="EXO 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 11:5" />U'lu' nav'i'ta, ki'la muv'yalwa wa mbele mu nsi' yose ya Misili aku'fwa, ku'lamuli'la muv'yalwa wa mbele wamwa Falao u'yo ikali'lile isumbi' lya wu'temi, mpaka muv'yalwa wa mbele wa muzya u'yo musya viliwa ha iwe, haki'mo na ki'la ki'v'yalwa cha mbele cha mitugo. <verse eid="EXO 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 11:6" />Haho ku'ku'v'a na ki'li'lo ki'hanya mu nsi' yose ya Misili, ki'li'lo i'cho ki'kaali' kwigelaga, hangi' ki'kasye kigele nhananhana. <verse eid="EXO 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 11:7" />Ali'vi mugati' na V'aizilaeli ku'lav'e sele, ku'du'hu' ninga mbwa i'yo yi'lav'amoke v'antu' ninga ndimu. Haho mulamanye ku'v'a Gu'ku' Mulungu ali'koma mugati' ya V'aizilaeli na V'amisili.’ <verse eid="EXO 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 11:8" />Hangi' v'akumba v'ako v'alize ku' wanne na ku'nku'v'i'i'la ku' iku'zyo na ku'yomba, ‘Wu'ka u'hafume, ev'e haki'mo na v'antu' v'ose av'o v'ali'ku'londa!’ Haho ndawu'ke.” Hohene Mose wahafumaga hamwa Falao u'ku' ali' na ki'sila ki'daki.<verse eid="EXO 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 11:9" />Haho Gu'ku' Mulungu wamuwi'laga Mose ati', “Falao akaku'degeleke, ki'gele migaka zyanne zingi'he mu nsi' ya Misili.” <verse eid="EXO 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 11:10" />Mose na Aloni ndi' v'av'ezya migaka zyeni'zyo zyose ha mbele yamwa Falao. Ali'vi Gu'ku' Mulungu wasangwa wagu'v'ezizye moyo gwamwa Falao ku'v'a mulambu. Hene akazumizye ku'v'aleku'li'la V'aizilaeli v'awu'ke mu nsi' yakwe.<verse eid="EXO 11:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="EXO 12" />
  <para style="s">Ilagi'li'zyo lya Pasaka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="DEU 16:1-8">Mwizu' 16:1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 12:1" />Gu'ku' Mulungu wav'awi'laga Mose na Aloni, aho v'av'age v'akaali' v'ali' mu nsi' ya Misili ati', <verse eid="EXO 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 12:2" />“Mwezi gwenu'gu' gu'ku'v'a gwa kwandya gwa mwaka ku' winywe. <verse eid="EXO 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 12:3" />V'awi'lagi iv'ilingano lyose lya V'aizilaeli ati', lu'siku' lwa iku'mi lwa mwezi gwenu'gu', ki'la mugosya ha lu'go lwakwe alasole kadi'lana kamo ku'nguno ya mugana gwakwe, na yeni'yi' yi'lav'e ku' ki'la nnumba. <verse eid="EXO 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 12:4" />U'lu' mbe nnumba yi'mo yi'li' na v'antu' v'adoo av'o v'akakowola ku'mala kadi'lana kose, nnumba yeni'yo yi'lav'adime v'asangi'le na v'antu' v'a nnumba ya wu'zenganwa wa bi'hi', ku'londana na wingi wa v'antu' v'a mwenu'mo. Haho v'alasogole ndimu ku'londana na ki'lyi'le cha ki'la muntu'. <verse eid="EXO 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 12:5" />Kadi'lana ako mulasogole, kav'e kagosya ka mwaka gu'mo, ako kakav'ile na wu'lema. Mukowolile ku'sola mugati' na nkolo ninga mbu'li. <verse eid="EXO 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 12:6" />Mulav'e muli'yi'tu'u'la yeni'yo ndimu na ku'yi'su'nga mpaka lu'siku' lwa iku'mi na ine lwa mwezi gwenu'gu'. Lu'siku' lwenu'lo mpi'ndi', iv'ilingano lyose lya V'aizilaeli yi'lav'adime ku'si'nza ndimu zyeni'zyo. <verse eid="EXO 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 12:7" />Hangi' v'alav'e v'ali'sola lwandi' lwa magazi ga ndimu zyeni'zyo, na ku'v'ila mu mi'i'mo zya muzigo na mu vipimbilyango vya mu igu'lya, ku' ki'la nnumba i'yo v'alav'e v'ali'lyi'la tu'di'lana twenu'to. <verse eid="EXO 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 12:8" />Wu'ziku' wene wu'wo v'alav'e v'ali'yi'komela nyama ha moto, na ku'yi'lya haki'mo na mugate u'go gu'katumba na nyenyi zya madu'tu' ndu'lu'. <verse eid="EXO 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 12:9" />Ku'du' mwize muyi'lye ntoto, ninga ya ku'tekwa na minzi', sumbwa mulav'e muli'yi'komela ha moto, haki'mo na mutwe, magu'lu', vikono na nyama zyayo zya mugati'. <verse eid="EXO 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 12:10" />Hangi' ku'du' mwize muv'e muli'lekela nyama ninga yi'mo mpaka ndiyu'. U'lu' yasigali'la mpaka ndiyu', mulayi'time ha moto. <verse eid="EXO 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 12:11" />Kadi'lana kenako mulakalye i'vi: Mulitunge mikwato mu miki'mbi'li' zinywe, ku'no muzwalile vilatu', na ku'dima milanga mu makono ginywe. Hangi' mulalye wangu' wangu'. Yeni'yo yi'li' Pasaka yamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu.<verse eid="EXO 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 12:12" />“Nanne ndav'i'te wu'ziku' wenu'wo mu nsi' yose ya Misili, na ku'wu'laga ki'la ki'v'yalwa cha mbele cha v'antu' na cha ndimu. Nanne ndazitemele ki'tanga milungu zyose zya mu Misili. Ene hu' ni' Gu'ku' Mulungu. <verse eid="EXO 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 12:13" />Ali'vi ku' lwandi' lwinywe, magazi genago galav'e hu' lu'manyi'lo lwa ku'lagi'la nnumba i'zyo muli'. Nanne ndav'e u'lu' nagawona magazi genago, ndav'i'te ha igu'lya yinywe, ki'gele ku'du' mupandi'ke ki'gu'mo cha ku'zimangu'ziwa, aho ndav'e nu'yi'gu'ma nsi' ya Misili. <verse eid="EXO 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 12:14" />Lu'siku' lwenu'lo lu'lav'e lwa mwizu' ku' winywe, na inywe mulalu'v'ezye lu'v'e mwanya gwamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu. Yeni'yi' yi'lav'e nhama ya nhananhana ku'v'ezya mwanya mu wu'v'yalwa winywe wose.”<verse eid="EXO 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 12:15" />Hangi' Gu'ku' Mulungu wayombaga ati', “Mugati' na nsiku' mupungati' mulav'e muli'lya migate i'zyo zikatumba. Lu'siku' lwa kwandya lwa nsiku' zyeni'zyo, mulasinie itumbyo mu nnumba zinywe. Muntu' u'yo alalye ki'ntu' ninga ki'mo i'cho ki'li' na itumbyo mu itungo lya nsiku' zyeni'zyo mupungati'. Yi'lamudime akomwe ku'le na iv'ilingano lya V'aizilaeli. <verse eid="EXO 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 12:16" />Lu'siku' lwa kwandya na lu'siku' lwa mupungati' mulav'e na nkuti'la nsondo. Mugati' na nsiku' zyeni'zyo iv'i'li' ku'du' mwize mutumame muli'mo ninga gu'mo, sumbwa muli'mo gwa kwiv'anga ki'liwa cha ki'la yu'mo, cheni'cho du' hu' i'cho mulav'ezye. <verse eid="EXO 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 12:17" />Mudime nsiku' zya ku'v'ezya Mwanya gwa Migate I'zyo Zikatumba, ku'nguno gwenu'go hu' gu'li' mwanya gwa kwizu'ki'la lu'siku' u'lo ndi' namufumya inywe, madale ga V'aizilaeli ku'fuma ku' Misili. Lu'siku' lwenu'lo mulalu'v'ezezye mwizu' ku' wu'v'yalwa winywe wose ku'v'a nhama ya nhananhana. <verse eid="EXO 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 12:18" />Mugati' na mwezi gwa kwandya, mulav'e muli'lya migate i'zyo zikatumba, ku'lamuli'la mpi'ndi' ya lu'siku' lwa iku'mi na ine lwa mwezi, mpaka mpi'ndi' ya lu'siku' lwa maku'mi av'i'li' na lu'mo. <verse eid="EXO 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 12:19" />Mu itungo lyeni'lo lya nsiku' mupungati', ku'du' mwize muv'e na itumbyo ninga hadoo mugati' na nnumba zinywe. Muntu' u'yo alalye ki'ntu' ninga ki'mo cha wu'sankalazu, av'e mugeni mwizi'li'zi ninga muv'anda, yi'lamudime akomwe ku'le na iv'ilingano lya V'aizilaeli. <verse eid="EXO 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 12:20" />Ki'la aho mulakikale, gu'li' muzilo ku'lya cha itumbyo. Yi'li'mudima ku'lya migate i'zyo zikatumba.”<verse eid="EXO 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pasaka ya kwandya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 12:21" />Haho Mose wav'itanaga v'anamala v'ose v'a Izilaeli, na ku'v'awi'la ati', “Yagi mukasogole tu'di'lana ku'londana na migana zinywe i'vyo zili', na mukasi'nze ki'la yu'mo kadi'lana ka Pasaka. <verse eid="EXO 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 12:22" />Musole katambi' ka itigala lya hisopo, na ku'dobya magazi mu ki'seme na ku'v'ila ha vipimbilyango, na mu mi'i'mo zyose iv'i'li' zya mizigo zya nnumba zinywe. Muntu' ninga yu'mo ku'du' afume ha ibala na muzigo gwa nnumba yakwe mpaka ndiyu'. <verse eid="EXO 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 12:23" />Ku'nguno Gu'ku' Mulungu aku'v'i'ta ki'gele av'agu'me v'enav'o V'amisili. Ali'vi u'lu' wagawona magazi genago ha vipimbilyango na mu mi'i'mo zya mizigo, aku'v'i'ta ha igu'lya, aku'leka ku'muzumi'zya muwu'lagi ingi'le mu nnumba zinywe na ku'muwu'laga inywe. <verse eid="EXO 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 12:24" />Muli'dime igambo lyeni'li', inywe na v'av'yalwa v'inywe, yi'v'e nhama ya nhananhana. <verse eid="EXO 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 12:25" />Aho mulav'e mwingi'la mu nsi' i'yo Gu'ku' Mulungu alamupe, ki'ti' i'vyo walagana, yi'lamudime ku'dima mwanya gwenu'gu'. <verse eid="EXO 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 12:26" />Hangi' ki'la aho v'ana v'inywe v'alav'e u'lu' v'awu'zya, ‘Mwanya gwenu'gu' gu'li' na nguno ki'?’ <verse eid="EXO 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 12:27" />Hohene mulav'awi'le ati', ‘Cheni'chi' ki'li' ki'taambo cha Pasaka yamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu, u'yo ndi' wav'i'ta ha igu'lya na nnumba zya V'aizilaeli ku' nsi' ya Misili, aho wav'age ali'v'awu'laga V'amisili, ali'vi iswe akaku'wu'lagile.’ ” Haho V'aizilaeli v'akundamyaga mitwe zyav'o na ku'ku'v'i'i'la.<verse eid="EXO 12:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 12:28" />Hangi' V'aizilaeli v'ayaga ku'kav'ezya magambo genago, ki'ti' i'vyo Gu'ku' Mulungu wav'alagi'li'zizye Mose na Aloni.<verse eid="EXO 12:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mulungu ali'wu'laga v'av'yalwa v'a mbele v'a Ki'misili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 12:29" />Yav'aga mu itungo lya wu'ziku' wa hagati', Gu'ku' Mulungu wamuwu'lagaga ki'la muv'yalwa wa mbele mu nsi' ya Misili. Ku'lamuli'la muv'yalwa wa mbele wamwa Falao u'yo ikali'lile isumbi' lya wu'temi, mpaka muv'yalwa wa mbele wa mutungwa wa mu igelezya. Hangi' na viv'yalwa vya mbele vya ndimu navyo vyafwaga. <verse eid="EXO 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 12:30" />Hohene Falao, v'akumba v'akwe v'ose, na V'amisili v'ose, v'atunu'laga wu'ziku'. Kasinaga ku'li' na ki'li'lo ki'hanya mu nsi' yose ya Misili, ku'nguno ndi' ku'du'hu' nnumba ninga yi'mo i'yo akafwile muntu'. <verse eid="EXO 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 12:31" />Haho Falao wav'itanaga Mose na Aloni wu'ziku' wenu'wo, na ku'v'awi'la ati', “Wu'ki! Mumufume mugati' na v'antu' v'anne. Yagi inywe haki'mo na V'aizilaeli, mukamwisenge Gu'ku' Mulungu ki'ti' i'vyo mwayombile. <verse eid="EXO 12:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 12:32" />Solagi madale ginywe ga ng'ombe, nkolo na mbu'li ki'ti' i'vyo mwayombile. Muye mukandombele nanne lu'v'ango.”<verse eid="EXO 12:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 12:33" />Nav'o V'amisili v'av'angu'hyaga V'aizilaeli ki'gele v'awu'ke wangu' na ku'yi'leka nsi' yav'o. V'ayombaga, “Nhanayene ku'ku'fwa v'ose!” <verse eid="EXO 12:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 12:34" />Hohene V'aizilaeli v'asolaga wu'fuma wav'o wa wu'kanywe, u'wo wu'kaali' ku'ti'ti'lwa itumbyo, v'awu'tu'u'laga mu mabakuli gav'o ga ku'kanyi'la, v'agatungaga mu myenda zyav'o, na ku'gasomba mu mav'ega gav'o. <verse eid="EXO 12:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 12:35" />V'aizilaeli v'asangwa v'av'ezyaga ki'ti' i'vyo Mose wakav'awi'laga: V'av'alombaga V'amisili vintu' vya mupango i'vyo viv'eziv'ilwe ku' mawe ga feza na zahabu, haki'mo na vizwalo. <verse eid="EXO 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="EXO 12:36" />Nawe Gu'ku' Mulungu wasangwa wav'av'ezyaga V'amisili ku'v'a na moyo gwa wu'hegela ku' V'aizilaeli, nav'o V'amisili v'av'apaga ki'la ki'ntu' i'cho ndi' v'alombaga. I'vi hu' vyene V'aizilaeli v'asampaga nsawo zya V'amisili.<verse eid="EXO 12:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">V'aizilaeli v'ali'wu'ka ku' Misili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="EXO 12:37" />V'aizilaeli v'awu'kaga na v'ayu'mbaga ku'fuma ku' kaya ya Lamesesi, v'ayaga mpaka ku' kaya ya Sukoti. Lu'v'alo lwav'o v'av'age v'afikile v'agosya ki'ti' laki mukaga, ku'leka v'aki'ma av'o v'av'age nav'o haki'mo na v'ana. <verse eid="EXO 12:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="EXO 12:38" />Hangi' kwav'age na v'antu' v'angi' av'o ndi' v'ilonda nav'o, haki'mo na madale mahanya ga mitugo mingi, ng'ombe, nkolo na mbu'li. <verse eid="EXO 12:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="EXO 12:39" />Haho v'av'ezyaga migate i'zyo zikatumba, ku' wu'fuma wa wu'kanywe u'wo v'awu'fumizye ku' Misili. Wu'fuma wenu'wo ndi' v'akawu'tu'u'li'lile itumbyo, ku'nguno v'afumiv'agwa ku' Misili wangu' wangu' na ku'gaiwa itungo lya kwiv'anga ki'liwa chav'o.<verse eid="EXO 12:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="EXO 12:40" />Wikalo wa V'aizilaeli ku' Misili, v'ikalaga itungo lya myaka magana ane na maku'mi adatu'. <verse eid="EXO 12:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="EXO 12:41" />Yav'aga lu'siku' lwa ku' mpelo lwa myaka zyeni'zyo magana ane na maku'mi adatu', lu'siku' lwene lu'lo v'antu' v'amwa Gu'ku' Mulungu ku' madale gav'o gose v'aku'fumaga ku' nsi' ya Misili. <verse eid="EXO 12:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="EXO 12:42" />Wu'ziku' wenu'wo Gu'ku' Mulungu wav'alindi'li'zya V'aizilaeli ki'gele av'afumye mu nsi' ya Misili. Wenu'wo wu'li' wu'ziku' wa ku'keyu'la na kwizu'ki'la ku' V'aizilaeli v'ose mugati' na wu'v'yalwa wav'o, ku'nguno Gu'ku' Mulungu ndi' wav'alindi'li'zya.<verse eid="EXO 12:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="EXO 12:43" />Gu'ku' Mulungu wamuwi'laga Mose na Aloni ati', “I'yi' hu' nhama ya ki'lyi'le cha Pasaka. Muntu' mugeni ku'du' ize alye kadi'lana ka Pasaka. <verse eid="EXO 12:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="EXO 12:44" />Sumbwa mukumba u'yo wagu'lilwe na muntu' ku' hela, u'lu' waputwa nyu'nzu', haho alazumi'ziwe ku'lya kadi'lana ka Pasaka. <verse eid="EXO 12:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="EXO 12:45" />Ali'vi muv'i'tayi'la na mutu'mami, akasye azumi'ziwe ku'lya kadi'lana ka Pasaka. <verse eid="EXO 12:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="EXO 12:46" />Kadi'lana ka Pasaka kalaliwe mu nnumba yi'mo. Ku'du' mwize mufumye nyama ninga yi'mo ha ibala na nnumba yeni'yo, ninga ku'du' mwize muv'ele iguha ninga li'mo. <verse eid="EXO 12:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="EXO 12:47" />V'aizilaeli v'ose yi'li'v'adima ku'v'ezya mwanya gwenu'go. <verse eid="EXO 12:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="EXO 12:48" />Mugeni mwizi'li'zi u'yo alav'e ikalile mugati' na inywe, u'lu' watogwa ku'muv'ezezya Gu'ku' Mulungu Mwanya gwa Pasaka, yi'lamudime ku'v'a av'e av'aputile nyu'nzu' v'agosya v'ose v'a mu nnumba yakwe, haho alazumi'ziwe ku'yi'lya ki'ti' muv'anda. Mugosya u'yo akaputwa nyu'nzu' akazumi'ziwa ku'yi'lya. <verse eid="EXO 12:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="EXO 12:49" />Yeni'yi' yi'ku'v'a nzi'la ya nhana ku' ki'la muv'anda, haki'mo na mugeni mwizi'li'zi u'yo ikalile mugati' na inywe.” <verse eid="EXO 12:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="EXO 12:50" />I'vi hu' vyene V'aizilaeli v'ose v'adimaga ilagi'li'zyo ki'ti' i'vyo Gu'ku' Mulungu wav'awi'lile Mose na Aloni. <verse eid="EXO 12:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="EXO 12:51" />Lu'siku' lwene lu'lo Gu'ku' Mulungu wav'afumyaga V'aizilaeli ku' nsi' ya Misili ku' madale gav'o.<verse eid="EXO 12:51" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="EXO 13" />
  <para style="s">Mwanya gwa Migate I'zyo Zikatumba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 13:1" />Gu'ku' Mulungu wamuwi'laga Mose ati', <verse eid="EXO 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 13:2" />“Munsondohezye ki'la muv'yalwa wa mbele wa ki'gosya. Ki'la muv'yalwa wa mbele wa V'aizilaeli na ki'la ki'v'yalwa cha mbele cha ndimu vili' vyanne.”<verse eid="EXO 13:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 13:3" />Haho Mose wav'awi'laga v'antu' ati', “Mulwizu'ki'le lu'siku' lwenu'lu' u'lo mwafumaga mu nsi' ya Misili, u'mo mwav'age v'asese. Lwenu'lu' hu' lu'siku' u'lo Gu'ku' Mulungu ndi' wamufumya mwenu'mu ku' nguzu zya mukono gwakwe. Mugati' na lu'siku' lwenu'lu', ku'du' mwize mulye mugate u'go gu'li' na itumbyo. <verse eid="EXO 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 13:4" />Lu'siku' lwenu'lu', mwezi gwa kwandya gwa Abibu, muku'wu'ka mu nsi' ya Misili. <verse eid="EXO 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 13:5" />Yi'ku'v'a aho Gu'ku' Mulungu alamufikye ku' nsi' ya V'akanaani, V'ahiti, V'aamoli, V'ahivi na V'ayebusi, nsi' i'yo walahi'la ku' v'agu'ku' v'inywe ku'v'a alav'ape, nsi' ya lu'tongo i'yo yi'li'keneneka mav'eele na wu'ki', yi'lamudime ku'lu'v'ezezya mwizu' lu'siku' lu'hanya lwenu'lu' mugati' na mwezi gwenu'gu'. <verse eid="EXO 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 13:6" />Ku' itungo lya nsiku' mupungati' mulav'e muli'lya migate i'zyo zikatumba, na lu'siku' lwa mupungati' gu'lav'e mwanya gwa ku'muku'zya Gu'ku' Mulungu. <verse eid="EXO 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 13:7" />Ku' itungo lyeni'lo lya nsiku' mupungati', mulav'e muli'lya migate i'zyo zikatumba. Ku'du' kize kigele ki'ntu' ninga ki'mo i'cho ki'li' na itumbyo, ninga ki'la itumbyo ku'du' lize ligele ku' winywe, ninga mugati' na nsi' yinywe yose. <verse eid="EXO 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 13:8" />Lu'siku' lwenu'lo mulav'awi'le v'ana v'inywe ati', ‘ku'li'v'ezya vyeni'vi ku'nguno ya igambo i'lo Gu'ku' Mulungu ndi' waku'v'ezezya aho kwav'age ku'li'wu'ka ku' nsi' ya Misili.’ <verse eid="EXO 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 13:9" />Mwanya gwenu'go gu'lav'e hu' mwizu' ki'ti' lu'manyi'lo u'lo lu'tungilwe ku' makono ginywe na ku' wu'syu' winywe, ki'gele nzi'la ya nhana yamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu yi'v'e mu milomo zinywe. Ku'nguno Gu'ku' Mulungu hu' mwene wamufumizye ku' nsi' ya Misili ku' nguzu zya mukono gwakwe. <verse eid="EXO 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 13:10" />Yi'li'mudima muyi'dime nhama yeni'yi' ku' ki'la mwaka ku' itungo lyalyo.”<verse eid="EXO 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ku'v'asondohya v'av'yalwa v'a mbele</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 13:11" />Mose wendeleyaga ku'v'awi'la v'antu' ati', “Yi'lav'e aho Gu'ku' Mulungu alav'e wamufikya ku' nsi' ya Kanaani na ku'mupa inywe nsi' yeni'yo, ki'ti' i'vyo walahi'la ku' winywe na ku' v'agu'ku' v'inywe, <verse eid="EXO 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 13:12" />yi'li'mudima ku'mufumi'zya Gu'ku' Mulungu ki'la muv'yalwa wa mbele wa ki'gosya. Hangi' ki'la ki'v'yalwa cha mbele cha ki'gosya cha mitugo zinywe ki'lav'e chamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu. <verse eid="EXO 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 13:13" />Sumbwa ki'v'yalwa cha mbele cha mpunda mulaki'komole ku' ku'mufumi'zya Gu'ku' Mulungu kadi'lana, ali'vi u'lu' mukaanile ku'ki'komola, mulaki'wu'lage lwa ku'ki'vuna nhingo yacho. Hangi' ki'la muv'yalwa wa mbele wa ki'gosya wa muntu' mulamukomole ku' ku'fumya kadi'lana. <verse eid="EXO 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 13:14" />Hangi' yi'lav'e mu nsiku' zya mbele, u'lu' v'ana v'inywe v'iza v'awu'zya ati', ‘Yeni'yi' yi'li' na nguno ki'?’ U'lav'awi'le ati', ‘Ku' mukono gwakwe gwa nguzu, Gu'ku' Mulungu waku'fumya ku' nsi' ya Misili, u'ko kwav'age v'asese. <verse eid="EXO 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 13:15" />Yav'age aho Falao ndi' wiv'ezya ku'v'a na moyo mulambu ku'ku'zumi'zya ku'wu'ke, hohene Gu'ku' Mulungu ndi' wav'awu'laga ki'la muv'yalwa wa mbele wa ki'gosya mu Misili, na ki'la ki'v'yalwa cha mbele cha ki'gosya cha mitugo. Yeni'yi' hu' nguno nu'fumya ki'taambo ku'mwa Gu'ku' Mulungu ki'la ki'v'yalwa cha mbele cha mitugo cha ki'gosya, ali'vi ki'la muv'yalwa wa mbele wa v'ana v'anne wa ki'gosya nu'mukomola.’ <verse eid="EXO 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 13:16" />Igambo lyeni'li' li'lav'e ki'ti' lu'manyi'lo u'lo lu'tungilwe ku' makono gako na ku' wu'syu' wako, ku'nguno Gu'ku' Mulungu hu' mwene waku'fumya ku' nsi' ya Misili, ku' nguzu zya mukono gwakwe.”<verse eid="EXO 13:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nhi'ngi' ya ilunde na moto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 13:17" />Itungo i'lo Falao wav'aleku'li'laga V'aizilaeli v'ayage, Mulungu akav'alondolile ku'v'i'ti'la ku' nsi' ya V'afilisiti, ninga i'vi nzi'la yeni'yo yav'age ngu'hi'. Mulungu ndi' wayomba ati', “V'antu' v'enav'a u'lu' v'apome na wu'lu'gu' v'akowolile ku'galu'zya ndaka na ku'su'v'a ku' Misili.” <verse eid="EXO 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 13:18" />Hohene Mulungu wav'alondolaga V'aizilaeli ku' nzi'la ya ku'pilima ku'v'i'ti'la ku' ibalangu', ku'londa ku' Nyanza ya Shamu. V'aizilaeli aho v'ali'wu'ka ku' Misili ndi' v'awu'ka v'iv'angile ku' wu'lu'gu'.<verse eid="EXO 13:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 13:19" />Mose wagasolaga maguha gamwa Yosefu na ku'gayana, ki'gele v'akagazyi'ki'le u'ko v'ayile, ku'nguno Yosefu ndi' wav'alahi'li'zya v'ana v'amwa Izilaeli ati'. “Nhana Mulungu alamwizi'i'le na ku'mufumya mu nsi' yeni'yi', haho yi'lamudime ku'gasola maguha ganne ku'fuma hano.”<verse eid="EXO 13:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 13:20" />Haho V'aizilaeli v'awu'kaga ku' Sukoti, na v'atu'u'laga nkambi' ku' lwandi' lwa Etamu, ku' lu'v'i'mbi' lwa ibalangu'. <verse eid="EXO 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 13:21" />Nawe Gu'ku' Mulungu wav'alondolaga mu itungo lya lyu'v'a ku' lu'manyi'lo lwa ilunde i'lo lyav'age ki'ti' nhi'ngi', na wu'ziku' wav'atongelelage ku' lu'manyi'lo lwa moto u'go gwav'age ki'ti' nhi'ngi' na ku'v'amu'li'ki'la, ki'gele v'akowole ku'yu'mba lyu'v'a na wu'ziku'. <verse eid="EXO 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 13:22" />I'lo ilunde li'li' ki'ti' nhi'ngi' ha itungo lya lyu'v'a, na u'go moto gu'li' ki'ti' nhi'ngi' ha itungo lya wu'ziku', ndi' zikahafumaga ha mbele na v'antu' v'enav'o.<verse eid="EXO 13:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="EXO 14" />
  <para style="s">V'aizilaeli v'ali'ki'lania nyanza ya Shamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 14:1" />Hangi' Gu'ku' Mulungu wamuwi'laga Mose ati', <verse eid="EXO 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 14:2" />“V'awi'le V'aizilaeli v'asu'v'e ku' nnuma, v'atu'u'le nkambi' ha mbele ya kaya ya Pi-hahiloti, hagati' na kaya ya Migidoli na nyanza ya Shamu. V'atu'u'le nkambi' ha ngiligili ya nyanza matanda na kaya ya Baal-sefoni. <verse eid="EXO 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 14:3" />Haho Falao akwiganika ati', ‘V'aizilaeli v'enav'o v'ali'tuka mugati' na nsi', ku'nguno ya ibalangu' lyav'apotaga ku'v'i'ta.’ <verse eid="EXO 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 14:4" />Nanne nku'gu'v'ezya moyo gwamwa Falao ku'v'a mulambu, nawe aku'mulondezya. Nanne nku'pandi'ka lu'kumo ku'v'i'ti'la ku'mwa Falao na v'asilikale v'akwe v'ose. Haho V'amisili v'alamanye ku'v'a ene hu' ni' Gu'ku' Mulungu.” Nav'o V'aizilaeli v'av'ezyaga vyeni'vyo.<verse eid="EXO 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 14:5" />Nawe Falao, mutemi wa Misili, aho wigagwa ku'v'a V'aizilaeli v'apeelaga, mweni'ki'li' na v'akumba v'akwe v'agalu'zyaga ndaka yav'o ku' V'aizilaeli na ku'yomba, “Kwav'ezya ki' mu ku'v'aleku'li'la V'aizilaeli v'aye v'aleke ku'ku'tu'mami'la hangi'?” <verse eid="EXO 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 14:6" />Hohene Falao wiv'angaga mukokoteni gwakwe gwa wu'lu'gu' gwa ku'kweswa na falasi na wawu'kaga na v'asilikale v'akwe. <verse eid="EXO 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 14:7" />Hangi' wasolaga mikokoteni magana mukaga misoga ku' wu'lu'gu', haki'mo na mikokoteni i'zyo zingi' zyose zya wu'lu'gu' zya V'amisili, na v'ahanya v'a v'asilikale mu mikokoteni zyeni'zyo.<figure style="fig" file="co00819.jpg" size="col" loc="bottom of page" ref="14:7">V'asilikale v'amwa Falao na mikokoteni zyav'o zya wu'lu'gu'</figure> <verse eid="EXO 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 14:8" />Nawe Gu'ku' Mulungu wagu'v'ezyaga moyo gwamwa Falao ku'v'a mulambu, haho Falao wav'alondezyaga V'aizilaeli ku'nguno ndi' v'awu'kaga ku' wu'gaazi. <verse eid="EXO 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 14:9" />V'asilikale v'a Ki'misili haki'mo na falasi na mikokoteni zyav'o zyose zya wu'lu'gu' na v'asilikale v'a ku'liina falasi, v'av'alondezyaga V'aizilaeli, nav'o v'av'apandi'ki'laga aho v'av'age v'atu'u'lile nkambi' yav'o ha ngiligili na nyanza, aho hav'age ha mbele na Pi-hahiloti, matanda na Baal-sefoni.<verse eid="EXO 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 14:10" />V'aizilaeli aho v'ikev'elaga, v'awonaga kasinaga Falao izile na v'asilikale v'akwe. Haho v'agwaga magongofuka, na v'amuli'li'laga Gu'ku' Mulungu. <verse eid="EXO 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 14:11" />V'amuwi'laga Mose ati', “Vihe, ku' Misili kwali' ku'du'hu' viv'i'mbi' vya ku'ku'gelani'la mpaka waku'leta kwize ku'fwi'le ku'no ku' ibalangu'? Ku' ki' waku'fumya ku' Misili? <verse eid="EXO 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 14:12" />Vihe, ndi' ku'kaku'wi'lile muhayo gwenu'gu' ku'fuma ku' Misili? Ndi' kwaku'wi'la u'ku'leke kwendeleye ku'v'a v'asese v'a V'amisili. Yali' yi'li' visoga ku' wiswe ku'v'atu'mami'la V'amisili ku'ki'la ku'fwi'la ku'no ku' ibalangu'!”<verse eid="EXO 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 14:13" />Mose wasu'v'yaga ati', “Muleke kogoha! Inywe jaami mwi'me hi'gi'! Walelo muku'wu'wona wu'pi'zya wamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu. V'enav'a V'amisili muli'v'awona walelo, mukasye muv'awone hangi' nhananhana. <verse eid="EXO 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 14:14" />Gu'ku' Mulungu aku'mwigu'mi'la, na inywe muku'hu'li'ka sele.”<verse eid="EXO 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 14:15" />Haho Gu'ku' Mulungu wamuwi'laga Mose, “Ku' ki' u'li'ndi'li'la ene? V'awi'le V'aizilaeli v'endeleye ku' mbele. <verse eid="EXO 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 14:16" />Nanho u'wu'sye mulanga gwako, na ku'golola mukono gwako ha igu'lya na nyanza. Minzi' gakwiki'ga u'ku' na u'ku', nav'o V'aizilaeli v'aku'v'i'ta hagati' na nyanza ha nsi' nyu'mu. <verse eid="EXO 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 14:17" />Nanne nku'v'av'ezya V'amisili ku'v'a na myoyo milambu, ki'gele v'ingi'le mu nyanza ku'nguno ya ku'mulondezya. Haho nku'pandi'ka lu'kumo ku'v'i'ti'la ku'mwa Falao na v'asilikale v'akwe v'ose, mikokoteni zya wu'lu'gu' zya ku'kweswa na falasi, haki'mo na v'aliina falasi v'akwe. <verse eid="EXO 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 14:18" />Nav'o V'amisili v'aku'manya ku'v'a ene hu' ni' Gu'ku' Mulungu, aho nku'v'a napandi'ka lu'kumo ku'v'i'ti'la ku'mwa Falao, mikokoteni zyakwe zya wu'lu'gu', na v'aliina falasi v'akwe.”<verse eid="EXO 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 14:19" />Hangi' malaika wamwa Mulungu u'yo wav'age ali'yu'mba ha mbele na v'asilikale v'a V'aizilaeli, wawu'kaga na kwikala ku' nnuma yav'o. Hangi' i'lo ilunde li'li' ki'ti' nhi'ngi' lyahafumaga ha mbele yav'o, na lyi'maga ha nnuma yav'o, <verse eid="EXO 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 14:20" />na likalaga hagati' ya v'asilikale v'a Ki'misili na madale ga V'aizilaeli. Ilunde lyeni'lo lyav'aletelaga V'amisili giti, sumbwa ku' V'aizilaeli wu'ziku'pee ndi' li'v'amu'li'ki'lile. Ku'nguno yeni'yo v'akiegelile wu'ziku'pee.<verse eid="EXO 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 14:21" />Haho Mose wagololaga mukono gwakwe ha igu'lya na nyanza, nawe Gu'ku' Mulungu waletaga muyaga muhanya ku'fuma mu ki'ya, nago gwagatenkaga minzi' ga mu nyanza wu'ziku'pee, nago minzi' gihegaga na ku'leka nsi' nyu'mu. Minzi' gikumingaga lwandi' u'u'lu' na u'u'lu'. <verse eid="EXO 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 14:22" />Hohene V'aizilaeli v'av'i'taga hagati' na nyanza ha nsi' nyu'mu, na minzi' ndi' gihegaga na ku'v'ezya igelele, lwandi' lwav'o lwa ku' mumoso na lwa ku' mulyi'la. <verse eid="EXO 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 14:23" />Nav'o V'amisili v'av'alondezyaga V'aizilaeli, ku'v'i'ti'la ha nsi' nyu'mu i'yo ndi' yi'li' hagati' na nyanza. V'av'alondezyaga haki'mo na falasi zyav'o, mikokoteni zyav'o zya wu'lu'gu', na v'aliina falasi v'av'o v'ose. <verse eid="EXO 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 14:24" />Yav'age mu ikingilima, Gu'ku' Mulungu ku'fuma ku' igu'lya wali'lolaga idale lya v'asilikale lya V'amisili, ku'fuma mu ilunde lya moto i'lo li'li' ki'ti' nhi'ngi', na ku'li'hahya muno. <verse eid="EXO 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 14:25" />Hangi' Gu'ku' Mulungu wagapantamyaga maguludumu ga mikokoteni zyav'o, na ku'nguno yeni'yo gayaga ku' lu'duko lu'hanya. Hohene V'amisili ndi' v'ayomba ati', “Ku'v'apeele V'aizilaeli! Ku'nguno Gu'ku' Mulungu ali'v'igu'mi'la.”<verse eid="EXO 14:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 14:26" />Haho Gu'ku' Mulungu wamuwi'laga Mose ati', “Wu'sya mukono gwako ha igu'lya na nyanza, ki'gele minzi' gasu'v'e na ku'v'anyumi'zya V'amisili, haki'mo na mikokoteni zyav'o zyose zya wu'lu'gu' na v'aliina falasi v'av'o.” <verse eid="EXO 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 14:27" />Nawe Mose wawu'syaga mukono gwakwe ha igu'lya na nyanza, na yav'age mu ikingilima nyanza yasu'v'i'laga kikali'le chayo. Haho V'amisili v'agemaga ku'gapeela minzi', ali'vi Gu'ku' Mulungu wav'atenkelaga mu nyanza. <verse eid="EXO 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 14:28" />Minzi' gav'anyumi'zyaga v'aliina falasi v'ose na mikokoteni zyose zya wu'lu'gu', na v'asilikale v'amwa Falao av'o ndi' v'av'alondile V'aizilaeli, v'ose v'afwi'laga mwenu'mo. Akapu'lu'gu'kile ninga yu'mo mugati' nav'o. <verse eid="EXO 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 14:29" />Ali'vi V'aizilaeli v'asangwa v'av'i'taga hagati' na nyanza ha nsi' nyu'mu, u'ku' minzi' gi'maga ki'ti' igelele ku' lwandi' lwav'o lwa mukono gwa ku' mulyi'la na gwa ku' mumoso.<verse eid="EXO 14:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 14:30" />I'vi hu' vyene Gu'ku' Mulungu ndi' wav'api'zya V'aizilaeli ku'fuma mu makono ga V'amisili, nav'o V'aizilaeli ndi' v'aziwona milambo zya V'amisili mu ngiligili ya nyanza. <verse eid="EXO 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 14:31" />Yav'aga V'aizilaeli aho v'awonaga igambo lya mukono gwa nguzu, i'lo Gu'ku' Mulungu wali'v'ezyaga ha igu'lya na V'amisili, v'amogohaga Gu'ku' Mulungu na v'atu'u'laga isani'zyo ku' wakwe na ku'mwa Mose mukumba wakwe.<verse eid="EXO 14:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="EXO 15" />
  <para style="s">Lwi'mbo lwamwa Mose</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 15:1" />Haho Mose haki'mo na V'aizilaeli v'amwi'mbi'laga Gu'ku' Mulungu lwi'mbo u'u'lu':</para>
  <para style="b" vid="EXO 15:1" />
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:1">“Nku'mwi'mbi'la Gu'ku' Mulungu, ku'nguno wakindaga ku' lu'kumo muno.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:1">Falasi na muliina falasi wav'atagi'laga mu nyanza.<verse eid="EXO 15:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 15:2" />Gu'ku' Mulungu ali' nguzu zyanne na lwi'mbo lwanne,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:2">na wav'aga wu'pi'zya wanne.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:2">Mweni'ki'li' ali' Mulungu wanne, nanne nku'mukumi'li'zya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:2">ali' Mulungu wamwa v'av'a wanne, nanne nku'muku'zya.<verse eid="EXO 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 15:3" />Gu'ku' Mulungu ali' mukowozi wa wu'lu'gu',</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:3">Gu'ku' Mulungu hu' lina lyakwe.<verse eid="EXO 15:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 15:4" />Mikokoteni zya wu'lu'gu' zyamwa Falao na v'asilikale v'akwe, wav'atagi'laga mu nyanza.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:4">V'ahanya v'a ku'mwa Falao av'o v'atoneke, v'anyumelaga mu Nyanza ya Shamu.<verse eid="EXO 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 15:5" />Minzi' ga ha mwev'a gav'akumbaga, v'agwi'laga mu nyanza ki'ti' iwe.<verse eid="EXO 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 15:6" />Mukono gwako gwa mulyi'la, ev'e Gu'ku' Mulungu, gwav'aga na lu'kumo lwa nguzu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:6">Ku' mukono gwako, ev'e Gu'ku' Mulungu, wav'azimangu'zyaga v'anisi.<verse eid="EXO 15:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 15:7" />Mugati' na wu'hanya wa lu'kumo lwako, wav'agwisizye ha nsi' av'o v'av'age v'ali'ku'hangi'li'zya.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:7">Ki'sila chako chapanki'lile na chakav'azimangu'zya. V'av'ile ki'ti' mawulule mu'u'mu mu moto.<verse eid="EXO 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 15:8" />Ku' myu'ye zyako minzi' ndi' gikuminga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:8">mav'i'mbi' ndi' gi'ma wi'i'ma ki'ti' igelele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:8">myev'a ndi' zidima hagati' ya nyanza.<verse eid="EXO 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 15:9" />Mwanisi ndi' wayomba ati', ‘Nku'v'alondezya na ku'v'adima.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:9">Nku'v'asampa vintu' mpaka nnamba yanne yi'male.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:9">Nku'kwesa lu'panga lwanne, na mukono gwanne gu'ku'v'azimangu'zya.’<verse eid="EXO 15:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 15:10" />Ali'vi ev'e ndi' wapuga ku' myu'ye yako, nyanza yav'akumba.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:10">V'anyumelaga mu minzi' ki'ti' mawe mu minzi' mingi.<verse eid="EXO 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 15:11" />Ev'e Gu'ku' Mulungu, ali' nde mugati' na milungu u'yo ali' ki'ti' ev'e?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:11">Nde ali' ki'ti' ev'e, u'yo ali' na wu'sondo wu'hanya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:11">wa kogohya ku' lu'kumo, wa ku'kaamazya ku' migaka?<verse eid="EXO 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 15:12" />Wagololaga mukono gwako gwa mulyi'la, na nsi' yav'amilaga v'anisi v'iswe.<verse eid="EXO 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 15:13" />Mugati' na chelu' chako wav'alondolile v'antu' v'ako av'o wav'akomolile.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:13">Ku' nguzu zyako wav'alondolile ku' wikalo wako wu'sondo.<verse eid="EXO 15:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 15:14" />V'antu' v'a makabi'la v'igagwa na ku'tetema,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:14">wu'satu wav'apandi'kaga v'a ku' Wu'filisiti.<verse eid="EXO 15:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 15:15" />V'ahanya v'a ku' Edomu v'ogohaga, v'alondozi v'a ku' Mowabu v'atetemaga ku' wov'a,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:15">v'antu' v'a ku' Kanaani v'agwaga magongofuka.<verse eid="EXO 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 15:16" />Wu'su'pu na wov'a vyav'agwi'laga.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:16">Ku' nguzu zya mukono gwako v'aku'lembela ki'ti' iwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:16">mpaka aho v'antu' v'ako, ev'e Gu'ku' Mulungu, v'alamali'le ku'v'i'ta,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:16">mpaka v'antu' av'o wav'akomolile v'amali'le ku'v'i'ta.<verse eid="EXO 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 15:17" />Ev'e u'lav'ingi'zye na ku'v'ikazya ku' lu'gu'lu' lwako, u'ko waku'sogolile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:17">ev'e Gu'ku' Mulungu, ku'v'a ha wikalo wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:17">hantu' hasondo aho wahahandi'lile ku' makono gako, ev'e Gu'ku'.<verse eid="EXO 15:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 15:18" />Gu'ku' Mulungu aku'tema nhananhana yose!”<verse eid="EXO 15:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 15:19" />Itungo i'lo falasi zyamwa Falao haki'mo na mikokoteni zyakwe zya wu'lu'gu' na v'aliina falasi, aho ndi' v'ingi'la mu nyanza, Gu'ku' Mulungu wagasu'v'yaga minzi' ga mu nyanza, gav'akumbaga. Ali'vi V'aizilaeli ndi' v'av'i'ta ha nsi' nyu'mu hagati' na nyanza.<verse eid="EXO 15:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 15:20" />Hangi' Miliamu, u'yo mufumbu'zi, ilu'mbu'ye na Aloni, wasolaga kagoma mu makono gakwe, na v'aki'ma v'angi' v'ose v'av'age v'amulondile na tu'goma twav'o ku'no v'ali'sapa. <verse eid="EXO 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 15:21" />Haho Miliamu wav'atongelelaga lwi'mbo u'u'lu':</para>
  <para style="b" vid="EXO 15:21" />
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:21">“Mwi'mbi'lagi Gu'ku' Mulungu ku'nguno wakindaga ku' lu'kumo muno.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:21">Falasi na v'aliina falasi wav'atagi'laga mu nyanza.”<verse eid="EXO 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Minzi' malu'lu'</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 15:22" />Hangi' Mose wav'alondolaga V'aizilaeli ku'fuma ku' Nyanza ya Shamu, na kwingi'la ku' ibalangu' lya Shuli. V'ayu'mbaga lu'gendo lwa nsiku' idatu' mu ibalangu' nav'o v'akawine minzi', ninga madoo. <verse eid="EXO 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 15:23" />Aho v'afikaga ku' Mala, v'apotagwa ku'ganywa minzi' ga henanho ku'nguno ndi' malu'lu'. Yeni'yo hu' nguno ya ku'hitana henanho Mala<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:23 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lina “Mala” ku' Ki'ebulania nguno yayo “wu'lu'lu'” ninga “wu'satu.”</char></note>. <verse eid="EXO 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 15:24" />Haho v'antu' v'amwisayi'li'li'laga Mose, ku' ku'yomba, “Ku'nywe ki'?” <verse eid="EXO 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 15:25" />Mose wamuli'li'laga Gu'ku' Mulungu, nawe Gu'ku' Mulungu wamulagi'laga ki'pande cha muti'. Haho Mose waki'tagi'laga mu minzi', nago minzi' gagalu'kaga na ku'v'a masoga.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EXO 15:25">Hohene Gu'ku' Mulungu wav'apaga V'aizilaeli nhama na wu'yangu' ki'gele av'ageme. <verse eid="EXO 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 15:26" />Wayombaga, “U'lu' mbe mugu'degeleke visoga muzwi gwanne, ene Gu'ku' Mulungu, Mulungu winywe, na ku'v'ezya ago gali'gelani'la ha mbele yanne, na ku'ku'zya nhama na milagi' zyanne zyose, hohene ene nkasye mmuletele malwile ki'ti' ago ndi' nav'afili'la V'amisili. Ku'nguno ene hu' ni' Gu'ku' Mulungu wa ku'mupi'zya inywe.”<verse eid="EXO 15:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 15:27" />Haho V'aizilaeli v'afikaga ku' lwandi' lwa Elimu, u'ko kwav'age na tu'sela iku'mi na tu'v'i'li', na miti' maku'mi mupungati' zya mitende. Nav'o v'awonaga v'atu'u'le nkambi' yav'o kwenu'ko bi'hi' na minzi'.<verse eid="EXO 15:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="EXO 16" />
  <para style="s">Mana na nkwale</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 16:1" />Hangi' iv'ilingano lya V'aizilaeli v'ose v'ayu'mbaga ku'fuma ku' lwandi' lwa Elimu, v'ayaga na ku'fika ku' ibalangu' lya Sini, i'lo lyav'age li'li' hagati' ya Elimu na lu'gu'lu' lwa Sinai. Lu'siku' lwenu'lo lwav'age lwa iku'mi na itano lwa mwezi gwa wu'v'i'li' ku'fuma ku'wu'ka ku' nsi' ya Misili. <verse eid="EXO 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 16:2" />Hohene V'aizilaeli v'ose aho v'av'age kwenu'ko ku' ibalangu', v'av'isayi'li'li'laga Mose na Aloni. <verse eid="EXO 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 16:3" />V'aizilaeli v'ayombaga ati', “Ndi' yi'li' visoga Gu'ku' Mulungu aku'wu'lagi'le ku' nsi' ya Misili, u'ko kwav'age kwikalile na ku'lya nyama haki'mo na migate zya kwiku'tya. Ali'vi inywe mwaku'letile ku'no ku' ibalangu', ki'gele muku'wu'lage iv'ilingano lyose lyeni'li' ku' nzala!”<verse eid="EXO 16:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 16:4" />Haho Gu'ku' Mulungu wamuwi'laga Mose ati', “Lingaga, ene nku'v'iti'la migate ku'fuma ku' ilunde ki'ti' matonye ga nvula. Ki'la lu'siku' v'antu' v'aku'v'a v'ali'fuma ha ibala na ku'solela viliwa vya ku'v'agelani'la ku' lu'siku' lu'mo. Ku' nzi'la yeni'yi' nku'v'agema mbone u'lu' v'aku'londa nzi'la yanne ninga ng'o. <verse eid="EXO 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 16:5" />Sumbwa mu lu'siku' lwa mukaga, aho v'alav'e v'ali'wiv'anga ki'liwa cha ku'leta mugati', chene v'alasolele kali' kav'i'li' yakwe, ku'ki'la i'cho v'ali'solelaga nsiku' zingi'.” <verse eid="EXO 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 16:6" />Hohene Mose na Aloni v'av'awi'laga V'aizilaeli v'ose ati', “Mpi'ndi' muku'manya ku'v'a Gu'ku' Mulungu hu' mwene wamufumizye ku'fuma ku' nsi' ya Misili! <verse eid="EXO 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 16:7" />Hangi' ndiyu' mulalu'wone lu'kumo lwamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu, ku'nguno wigagwa misayo zinywe ku' wakwe. Iswe ku'li' v'a nde mpaka mukwisayi'li'li'le?” <verse eid="EXO 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 16:8" />Hangi' Mose wayombaga ati', “Mpi'ndi' Gu'ku' Mulungu aku'v'a ali'mupa nyama muli'lya, na ndiyu' aku'v'a ali'mupa migate, muv'e muli'lya na kwiku'ta, ku'nguno wigagwa misayo zinywe zyose ku' wakwe. Iswe ku'li' v'a nde? Ng'o, mwisayi'li'laga ku'mwa Gu'ku' Mulungu.”<verse eid="EXO 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 16:9" />Haho Mose wamuwi'laga Aloni ati', “Li'wi'le iv'ilingano lya V'aizilaeli v'ose ati', ‘Mwikuminge ha mbele yamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu, ku'nguno wigagwa misayo zinywe.’ ” <verse eid="EXO 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 16:10" />Yav'aga itungo i'lo Aloni wav'aga ali'yomba na iv'ilingano lya V'aizilaeli, v'ose v'alingaga ku' lwandi' lwa ibalangu', kasinaga lu'kumo lwamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu lwigelaga mu ilunde! <verse eid="EXO 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 16:11" />Haho Gu'ku' Mulungu wamuwi'laga Mose ati', <verse eid="EXO 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 16:12" />“Nigagwa misayo zya V'aizilaeli. Hohene u'v'awi'le ati', ‘Mpi'ndi' muku'v'a muli'lya nyama, na ndiyu' muku'v'a muli'lya migate na kwiku'ta. Haho muku'manya ku'v'a ene hu' ni' Gu'ku' Mulungu, Mulungu winywe.’ ”<verse eid="EXO 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 16:13" />Yav'aga mu lyu'v'a lya mpi'ndi', zizaga nkwale nyingi na ku'yi'kumba nkambi' ya V'aizilaeli, na ndiyu' yayo lwagwaga lu'me ki'la lwandi' ku'yi'pilima nkambi' yav'o. <verse eid="EXO 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 16:14" />Yav'aga lu'me lwenu'lo aho lwamalaga, kasinaga gigelaga mav'ale mado mado ki'ti' mugate mulelemazu ha nsi' yeni'yo ya ibalangu'. <verse eid="EXO 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 16:15" />Nav'o V'aizilaeli aho v'awonaga vintu' vyeni'vyo v'akumyaga na kwiwu'zya, “Ki' cheni'chi'?” Nguno v'av'age v'akamanya ku'v'a ki'li' ki'ntu' ki'. Haho Mose wav'awi'laga ati', “Gwenu'gu' gu'li' mugate u'go Gu'ku' Mulungu wamupaga mulye. <verse eid="EXO 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 16:16" />Muhayo gwenu'gu' hu' u'go Gu'ku' Mulungu walagi'li'zizye: ‘Ki'la muntu' akuminge ki'liwa i'cho akowolile ku'lya, asolele muteko gu'mo ku' ki'la muntu' ku'londana na v'antu' av'o ali' nav'o mu ihema lyakwe.’ ”<verse eid="EXO 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 16:17" />Hohene, V'aizilaeli v'av'ezya vyeni'vyo, ali'vi mugati' nav'o v'amo ndi' v'asolela vingi na v'angi' vidoo. <verse eid="EXO 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 16:18" />Nav'o aho v'avipimaga i'vyo v'asolelaga mu muteko, ndi' v'awona ku'v'a u'yo ndi' wasolelaga vingi, ndi' akav'ile na cha ku'sigali'la, na u'yo ndi' wasolelaga ki'doo ndi' akadohelilwe. Ki'la yu'mo wasolelaga ki'ti' i'vyo ki'mugelani'lile ku'lya.<verse eid="EXO 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 16:19" />Hangi' Mose wav'awi'laga ati', “Muntu' ninga yu'mo ku'du' alekele ki'liwa cheni'chi' mpaka ndiyu'.”<verse eid="EXO 16:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 16:20" />Ali'vi v'antu' ndi' v'akamudegelekile Mose. Mugati' nav'o v'amo v'itu'u'li'zyaga ki'liwa mpaka ndiyu'. Ali'vi ki'liwa cheni'cho i'cho ndi' v'itu'u'li'zyaga ku'fiki'la ndiyu' ndi' chasangwa chagasaga na ku'v'a na magunyo. Haho Mose wav'adaki'laga. <verse eid="EXO 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 16:21" />Hohene, ki'la ndiyu' v'av'age v'ali'solela ki'liwa, ki'la yu'mo ku'londana na ki'lyi'le chakwe, na yav'age mbe lyu'v'a lyaliina, i'cho ki'liwa ki'ngi' ndi' chayelage.<verse eid="EXO 16:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 16:22" />Sumbwa mu lu'siku' lwa mukaga v'akumingage kali' kav'i'li' yakwe, ki'la yu'mo miteko iv'i'li'. Hangi' v'anamala v'a Izilaeli v'ayaga ku'mwa Mose na ku'muwi'la igambo lyeni'lo. <verse eid="EXO 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 16:23" />Nawe wav'awi'laga ati', “Yeni'yi' hu' nhama yamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu: Igolo lu'li' lu'siku' lwa ku'lenda, u'lo hu' Sabato nsondo ku'mwa Gu'ku' Mulungu. Ku'nguno yeni'yo yagi mukakomele i'vyo muli'koov'a na mukasev'ye i'vyo muli'koov'a walelo, na viliwa i'vyo viku'sigali'la muvitu'u'le mpaka igolo.” <verse eid="EXO 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 16:24" />Hohene, v'avitu'u'laga viliwa vingi', ki'ti' i'vyo Mose wakalagi'li'zyaga. Wangalu'ke yayo ndiyu', v'aviwonaga vipanga. Vikagasile ninga ku'v'a na magunyo. <verse eid="EXO 16:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 16:25" />Hangi' Mose wav'awi'laga ati', “Lyagi viliwa vyeni'vyo i'vyo vyakasigali'laga, ku'nguno walelo lu'li' lu'siku' lwa ki'suuho, lwamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu. Walelo mukapandi'ke viliwa vyeni'vyo ha ibala na nkambi'. <verse eid="EXO 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 16:26" />Ku' itungo lya nsiku' mukaga mulav'e muli'solela viliwa, sumbwa lu'siku' lwa mupungati' lu'li' lwa ki'suuho. Lu'siku' lwenu'lo vikasye vigele.”<verse eid="EXO 16:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 16:27" />Ninga vyeni'vyo mugati' na v'antu' v'enav'o, v'angi' ndi' v'aya ku'kasolela, ali'vi v'akaviwine. <verse eid="EXO 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 16:28" />Haho Gu'ku' Mulungu wamuwi'laga Mose ati', “Muku'kaana ku'ziku'zya nhama zyanne na nzi'la zyanne mpaka nanali'? <verse eid="EXO 16:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 16:29" />Mumanye ku'v'a Gu'ku' Mulungu wamupile inywe lu'siku' lwa ki'suuho, ku'nguno yeni'yo mu lu'siku' lwa mukaga ali'mupa ki'liwa cha nsiku' iv'i'li'. Ki'la yu'mo yi'li'mudima ku'suuha mu nnumba yakwe lu'siku' lwa mupungati'. Lu'siku' lwenu'lo yi'kakoov'iwa ku'fuma ha ibala, ninga yu'mo.” <verse eid="EXO 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 16:30" />Hohene v'antu' v'enav'o v'asuuhaga lu'siku' lwa mupungati'.<verse eid="EXO 16:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 16:31" />Haho V'aizilaeli v'aki'paga lina ki'liwa cheni'cho “Mana<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:31 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Muhayo “Mana” ku' Ki'ebulania gwikolile na muhayo “ki' cheni'chi'?”</char></note>.” Nacho ki'liwa cheni'cho chav'age kikolile ki'ti' mbiyu' zya wu'si'ga wape, na wu'semu wacho ki'ti' mugate mulelemazu u'go gu'v'eziv'ilwe ku' wu'ki'. <verse eid="EXO 16:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 16:32" />Hangi' Mose wav'awi'laga ati', “U'gu' hu' mulagi' gwamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu: ‘Musole muteko gu'mo gwa mana na ku'yi'tu'u'la, ku'nguno ya wu'v'yalwa winywe u'wo wu'lalonde, ki'gele v'ize v'awone ki'liwa i'cho ndi' namupa mulye ku' ibalangu', aho ndi' mufumizye ku' nsi' ya Misili.’ ”<verse eid="EXO 16:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 16:33" />Hohene Mose wamuwi'laga Aloni ati', “U'sole muteko gwa mana, u'gu'ti'ti'le mugati' na ki'seme. Hangi' u'ki'tu'u'le ha mbele yamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu, ki'gele ki'su'ngwe ku'nguno ya v'av'yalwa v'inywe av'o v'alalonde.”<verse eid="EXO 16:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 16:34" />Hohene ha itungo lya mbele Aloni ndi' wayi'tu'u'la mana ha mbele ya isandi'ko lya wu'sangi'lwa ki'gele yi'su'ngwe, ki'ti' i'vyo Gu'ku' Mulungu wafumizye ilagi'li'zyo ku'mwa Mose. <verse eid="EXO 16:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 16:35" />Nav'o V'aizilaeli v'alyaga mana yeni'yo ku' itungo lya myaka maku'mi ane, mpaka aho v'afikaga ha lwandi' u'lo ndi' lu'li' na v'antu', yaani v'alyaga mpaka aho v'afikaga ku' lu'v'i'mbi' lwa Kanaani. <verse eid="EXO 16:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="EXO 16:36" />Muteko gu'mo gu'gelani'lile na kilo yi'mo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:36 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">“Kilo yi'mo” ku' Ki'ebulania yi'li' lwandi' lwa iku'mi lwa efa. “Muteko” gu'li' ki'pimo cha wokale ku' Ki'ebulania “Omeli” u'go gu'gelani'lile na lita iv'i'li'.</char></note>.<verse eid="EXO 16:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="EXO 17" />
  <para style="s">Minzi' gali'fuma mu itale</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="NUM 20:1-13">Lu'v'alo 20:1-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 17:1" />Iv'ilingano lyose lya V'aizilaeli lyawu'kaga ku'fuma ku' ibalangu' lya Sini, lyayu'mbaga ku'fuma lwandi' lu'mo mpaka lwandi' lu'ngi' ki'ti' i'vyo Gu'ku' Mulungu ndi' walagi'li'zya. V'atu'u'laga nkambi' yav'o ku' lwandi' lwa Lefidimu, ali'vi kwav'age ku'du'hu' minzi' ga ku'nywa v'antu'. <verse eid="EXO 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 17:2" />Ku'nguno yeni'yo v'antu' v'amubu'bu'zyaga Mose na ku'yomba, “Ku'pe minzi' ga ku'nywa,” Nawe Mose wasu'v'yaga ati', “Ku' ki' muli'mbu'bu'zya? Mukav'ile muli'mugema Gu'ku' Mulungu?” <verse eid="EXO 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 17:3" />Ali'vi v'antu' v'ose v'av'age na nota, v'amwisayi'li'li'laga Mose na ku'yomba ati', “Ku' ki' waku'fumizye ku' Misili na ku'ku'leta ku'no ki'gele ku'fwe na nota, iswe, v'ana v'iswe na mitugo ziswe?”<verse eid="EXO 17:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 17:4" />Haho Mose wamuli'li'laga Gu'ku' Mulungu na ku'yomba ati', “Mbav'ezezye ki' v'antu' v'enav'a? Gi'si' v'egela ku'ngu'ma na mawe!” <verse eid="EXO 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 17:5" />Nawe Gu'ku' Mulungu wamuwi'laga Mose ati', “V'i'ta ha mbele ya v'antu' v'enav'a. U'sole mugati' na v'anamala v'a Izilaeli, muv'e haki'mo nav'o. U'sole na mulanga gwako u'go ndi' wagu'gu'mi'la mongo gwa Naili, u'ye nago. <verse eid="EXO 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 17:6" />Lingaga, ene nkwi'ma ha mbele yako ku' itale lya bi'hi' na lu'gu'lu' lwa Holebu, nanho u'kali'gu'me itale lyeni'lo na minzi' gaku'fuma, ki'gele v'antu' v'anywe.” Hohene Mose wav'ezyaga vyeni'vyo ha mbele ya v'anamala v'a Izilaeli. <verse eid="EXO 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 17:7" />Nawe Mose wahapaga lina “Masa” na “Meliba,” ku'nguno ya V'aizilaeli ndi' v'amubu'bu'zyaga na ku'mugema Gu'ku' Mulungu na ku'yomba ati', “Vihe, nhana Gu'ku' Mulungu ali' niswe ninga ng'o?”<verse eid="EXO 17:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wu'lu'gu' wa V'aizilaeli na V'aamaleki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 17:8" />Itungo lyeni'lo V'aamaleki v'izaga na kwigu'ma na V'aizilaeli kwenu'ko ku' Lefidimu. <verse eid="EXO 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 17:9" />Hangi' Mose wamuwi'laga Yoswa ati', “Sogola v'agosya v'amo, muye mukigu'me na V'aamaleki. Igolo ene ndi'me ha nsoto ya kalu'gu'lu', ku'no ndimile mulanga gwamwa Mulungu.” <verse eid="EXO 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 17:10" />Haho Yoswa wav'ezyaga ki'ti' i'vyo Mose wamuwi'laga, wayaga ku'kigu'ma na V'aamaleki. Nav'o Mose, Aloni na Huli v'aliinaga ha nsoto ya kalu'gu'lu'. <verse eid="EXO 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 17:11" />Yav'aga itungo lyose i'lo Mose wav'age u'lu' wawu'sya makono gakwe mu igu'lya, V'aizilaeli v'akindage, sumbwa u'lu' wasosya makono gakwe V'aamaleki v'akindage. <verse eid="EXO 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 17:12" />Ali'vi aho lyav'i'taga itungo, makono gamwa Mose gadedaga. Haho Aloni haki'mo na Huli, v'asolaga iwe, v'ali'tu'u'laga bi'hi' na Mose, ki'gele ikali'le. Hangi' Aloni na Huli v'agadimaga makono gamwa Mose na ku'gawu'sya mu igu'lya, yu'mo ku' mumoso na yu'ngi' ku' mulyi'la. I'vi hu' vyene makono gamwa Mose gav'aga na nguzu, na gav'aga mu igu'lya mpaka lyu'v'a aho lyalokaga. <verse eid="EXO 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 17:13" />Ku'nguno yeni'yo Yoswa wali'kindaga idale lya v'asilikale v'a V'aamaleki.<verse eid="EXO 17:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 17:14" />Hangi' Gu'ku' Mulungu wamuwi'laga Mose ati', “U'li'tone igambo lyeni'li' mu ki'tabu, ki'gele gu'v'e mwizu', ku'v'a nhana ndav'azimangu'zye V'aamaleki haki'mo na mwizu' gwav'o gu'leke ku'v'a gu'li'ho mu welelo. Hangi' u'li'yombe mu matwi gamwa Yoswa.” <verse eid="EXO 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 17:15" />Haho Mose wazyengaga ihozezyo na ku'litana “Gu'ku' Mulungu ali' Bendela Yanne<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lina “Gu'ku' Mulungu ali' Bendela Yanne” ku' Ki'ebulania gu'li' “Yahweh-nisi.”</char></note>.” <verse eid="EXO 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 17:16" />Mose wayombaga, “Muwu'sye mu igu'lya bendela yamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Muhayo “Muwu'sye mu igu'lya bendela yamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu” ku' Ki'ebulania gu'li' “Mukono ku' bendela yamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu” ninga “Mukono ku' isumbi' lya wu'temi lyamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu.”</char></note>. Gu'ku' Mulungu aku'v'a na wu'lu'gu' na V'aamaleki mugati' na wu'v'yalwa wav'o wose u'wo wu'lalonde!”<verse eid="EXO 17:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="EXO 18" />
  <para style="s">Wu'yangu' wamwa Yetilo ku'mwa Mose</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="DEU 1:9-18">Mwizu' 1:9-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 18:1" />Hohene Yetilo, muhozya wa V'amidiani, ise wu'kwi wamwa Mose, wigagwa mmola ya magambo gose ago Gu'ku' Mulungu wamuv'ezezizye Mose haki'mo na V'aizilaeli. Hangi' wigagwa i'vyo Gu'ku' Mulungu wav'afumizye ku' nsi' ya Misili. <verse eid="EXO 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 18:2" />Itungo lyeni'lo Mose wasangwa wakamusu'v'ya muki' wakwe Zipola ku'mwa ise Yetilo, nawe Yetilo wamupokelaga, <verse eid="EXO 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 18:3" />haki'mo na v'ana v'akwe v'av'i'li' v'a ki'gosya. Lina lya mwana wa mbele witanagwe Geleshomu, ku'nguno Mose ndi' wayomba ati', “Nav'aga mugeni mwizi'li'zi mugati' na nsi' ya wu'geni.” <verse eid="EXO 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 18:4" />Lina lya mwana wa wu'v'i'li' witanagwe Eliezeli, ku'nguno Mose ndi' wayomba ati', “Mulungu wamwa v'av'a wanne hu' mwene mugwasya wanne, na wampi'zizye na lu'panga lwamwa Falao.”<verse eid="EXO 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 18:5" />Hohene Yetilo, ise wu'kwi wamwa Mose, haki'mo na muki' wamwa Mose na v'ana v'amwa Mose v'ose v'av'i'li', v'amuyi'laga Mose u'ko ku' ibalangu', u'ko wav'age atu'u'lile nkambi' ku' lu'gu'lu' lwamwa Mulungu. <verse eid="EXO 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 18:6" />Yetilo watu'mi'zyaga nkombe ku'mwa Mose ku'yomba ati', “Ene Yetilo mukwiyo nizile ku' wako, haki'mo na muki' wako na v'ana v'ako v'av'i'li'.” <verse eid="EXO 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 18:7" />Ku'nguno yeni'yo Mose wafumaga ku'kamusu'mbi'la mukwiye, wamusungami'laga na ku'musu'na. V'igisi'li'zyaga na v'ingi'laga mu ihema. <verse eid="EXO 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 18:8" />Haho Mose wamutentemuli'laga mukwiye magambo gose ago Gu'ku' Mulungu wamuv'ezezizye Falao na V'amisili ku'nguno ya V'aizilaeli. Hangi' wamuwi'laga lu'duko u'lo v'alu'pandi'kile mu nzi'la, na i'vi Gu'ku' Mulungu wav'age ali'v'api'zya. <verse eid="EXO 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 18:9" />Yetilo watogeziv'agwa muno ku'nguno ya wu'soga u'wo Gu'ku' Mulungu wav'av'ezezizye V'aizilaeli, ku' ku'v'api'zya v'afume mu makono ga V'amisili. <verse eid="EXO 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 18:10" />Hangi' Yetilo wayombaga ati', “Akumu'kiwe Gu'ku' Mulungu u'yo wamupi'zizye ku'fuma mu makono ga V'amisili, haki'mo na makono gamwa Falao. <verse eid="EXO 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 18:11" />Gi'si' namanya ku'v'a Gu'ku' Mulungu ali' muhanya ku'ki'la milungu zyose, ku'nguno wav'akomolaga v'antu' v'enav'a ku'fuma mu makono ga V'amisili, av'o ndi' v'av'av'ezezyage V'aizilaeli mpazi'i'la.” <verse eid="EXO 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 18:12" />Hangi' Yetilo, ise wu'kwi wamwa Mose, waletaga ki'taambo cha ku'zigya haki'mo na vitaambo vingi' ku'mwa Mulungu. Nawe Aloni haki'mo na v'anamala v'a Izilaeli v'ose v'izaga ku'lya ki'liwa haki'mo na Yetilo, ha mbele yamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu.<verse eid="EXO 18:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 18:13" />Wangalu'ke ndiyu', Mose wikalaga ki'gele av'ayangu'le v'antu', na v'enav'o v'antu' v'i'maga na ku'muzyema Mose ku'fuma ndiyu' mpaka mpi'ndi'. <verse eid="EXO 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 18:14" />Hohene Yetilo aho wawonaga gose ago Mose ali'v'av'ezezya v'antu' wayombaga ati', “Igambo ki' lyeni'li' i'lo u'li'v'av'ezezya v'antu'? Ku'nguno ev'e u'li'v'ayangu'la v'antu' v'enav'a winene, na v'antu' v'ose v'i'maga na ku'ku'zyema ku'fuma ndiyu' mpaka mpi'ndi'?” <verse eid="EXO 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 18:15" />Nawe Mose wasu'v'yaga ku' mukwiye ati', “V'antu' v'ali'wiza ku' wanne ki'gele v'awu'zye ku'mwa Mulungu. <verse eid="EXO 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 18:16" />U'lu' v'ali' na igambo, v'ali'wiza ku' wanne nanne nu'v'ayangu'la mugati' ya yu'mo na mwiye, na ku'v'alagi'la nhama zyamwa Mulungu na nzi'la zya nhana.” <verse eid="EXO 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 18:17" />Hohene mukwiye Yetilo wamuwi'laga Mose ati', “Igambo lyeni'li' u'li'v'ezya li'kav'ile isoga! <verse eid="EXO 18:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 18:18" />Igambo lyeni'li' u'li'li'v'ezya, ev'e haki'mo na av'a v'antu', li'ku'v'a li'li'muzov'ya gele. U'kakowola ku'li'somba winene ku'nguno li'li' itimbu muno. <verse eid="EXO 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 18:19" />Gi'si' u'degeleke wu'yangu' wanne, na Mulungu av'e haki'mo nanho. Yi'li'ku'dima ev'e ku'v'a u'li'ya ha mbele yamwa Mulungu ku'nguno ya v'antu', na ku'mufili'la Mulungu magambo gav'o. <verse eid="EXO 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 18:20" />Nanho u'ku'v'a u'li'v'alagi'la nhama na nzi'la zya nhana zyamwa Mulungu, haki'mo na kikali'le na mili'mo i'zyo zili'koov'iwa ku'v'ezya. <verse eid="EXO 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 18:21" />Ali'vi ku'nguno ya magambo gangi', u'sogole mugati' na v'antu' v'ose, av'o v'amogohile Mulungu, v'a lole, na v'ayi'gayile nsawo ya ihongo. V'enav'o hu' u'v'ape wu'hanya wa madale ga v'antu' mavihu'mbi', magana, maku'mi atano na iku'mi iku'mi. <verse eid="EXO 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 18:22" />U'v'atu'u'le v'enav'o v'av'e hu' v'ayangu'zi v'a v'antu' mugati' na nsiku' zyose. U'v'awi'le v'aku'letele mihayo milambu, sumbwa mido mido v'av'e v'ali'ziyangu'la v'eni'ki'li'. Ku' nzi'la yeni'yi' yi'ku'ku'v'ezya ku'v'a na muligo mudo, ku'nguno nav'o v'aku'somba muligo haki'mo nanho. <verse eid="EXO 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 18:23" />U'lu' u'v'ezye vyeni'vi, na Mulungu u'lu' akoov'ile vyeni'vyo, hohene u'ku'kowola ku'lamba ku' muli'mo gwenu'gu', na v'antu' v'enav'a v'ose v'aku'v'a v'ali'su'v'a na ku'hola ki'la yu'mo ku' lu'go lwakwe.”<verse eid="EXO 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 18:24" />Hohene Mose wadegelekaga wu'yangu' wa mukwiye, na wav'ezyaga vyose ki'ti' i'vyo ndi' wayangu'lagwa. <verse eid="EXO 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 18:25" />Haho Mose wav'asogolaga v'antu' v'a wu'kowozi mugati' na V'aizilaeli v'ose, na ku'v'av'ezya v'av'e v'ahanya v'a madale ga v'antu' mavihu'mbi', magana, maku'mi atano na iku'mi iku'mi. <verse eid="EXO 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 18:26" />Nav'o v'av'ayangu'laga v'antu' nsiku' zyose. Mihayo mido mido v'ayangu'laga v'eni'ki'li'. Ali'vi mihayo milambu zyene v'amuletelaga Mose. <verse eid="EXO 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 18:27" />Aho wav'ezyaga vyeni'vyo, Mose haki'mo na mukwiye v'idahyaga, nawe Yetilo wasu'v'aga ku' nsi' yakwe.<verse eid="EXO 18:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="EXO 19" />
  <para style="s">V'aizilaeli ku' lu'gu'lu' lwa Sinai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 19:1" />Lu'siku' lwa mbele lwa mwezi gwa wu'datu' ku'fuma aho V'aizilaeli ndi' v'awu'ka ku' nsi' ya Misili, lu'siku' lwenu'lo hu' ndi' v'afika ku' ibalangu' lya Sinai. <verse eid="EXO 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 19:2" />Ku'fuma ku' Lefidimu, v'ingi'laga ku' ibalangu' lya Sinai na kwenu'ko v'atu'u'laga nkambi' ha mbele ya lu'gu'lu' lwa Sinai. <verse eid="EXO 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 19:3" />Hangi' Mose waliinaga ku' igu'lya na lu'gu'lu', ki'gele akapome na Mulungu. Haho Gu'ku' Mulungu wamwitanaga ku'fuma ku' lu'gu'lu' lwenu'lo na ku'muwi'la, “I'vi hu' vyene u'ku'v'awi'la v'av'yalwa v'amwa Yakobo, av'o V'aizilaeli: <verse eid="EXO 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 19:4" />‘Inywe v'eni'ki'li' mwawonile i'vi nav'av'ezezizye V'amisili, na i'vi namusolile inywe ki'ti' nyanda i'vyo yi'li'wu'syaga v'ana v'ayo mu manana gayo, na ku'muleta ku' wanne. <verse eid="EXO 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 19:5" />Gi'si' u'lu' mugu'degeleke muzwi gwanne ku' lu'doono, na ku'li'dima ilagano lyanne, haho inywe mulav'e v'antu' v'anne v'asogolwa mugati' na makabi'la gose, ninga i'vi welelo yose yi'li' nsawo yanne. <verse eid="EXO 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 19:6" />Inywe mulav'e ku' wanne wu'temi wa v'ahozya na nsi' nsondo. Zyeni'zyo hu' mihayo i'zyo u'ku'v'awi'la V'aizilaeli.’ ”<verse eid="EXO 19:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 19:7" />Haho Mose wasu'v'aga na wav'itanaga v'anamala v'a Izilaeli na ku'v'awi'la mihayo zyose i'zyo Gu'ku' Mulungu wamulagi'li'zyaga av'awi'le. <verse eid="EXO 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 19:8" />Nav'o v'antu' v'ose v'asu'v'yaga ku' haki'mo ati', “Ku'ku'v'ezya magambo gose ki'ti' i'vyo Gu'ku' Mulungu wayombaga.” Haho Mose wasu'v'yaga mihayo zyav'o ku'mwa Gu'ku' Mulungu. <verse eid="EXO 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 19:9" />Gu'ku' Mulungu wamuwi'laga Mose ati', “Lingaga, ene nku'v'a nu'wiza mugati' na ilunde itimbu, ki'gele v'antu' v'enav'a v'av'e v'ali'wigwa i'vyo nu'yomba nanho, nav'o v'aku'ku'sani'zya mu nsiku' zyav'o zyose.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EXO 19:9">Hangi' Mose wamuwi'laga Gu'ku' Mulungu mihayo zya v'antu'. <verse eid="EXO 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 19:10" />Nawe Gu'ku' Mulungu wamuwi'laga Mose ati', “Yaga u'kav'asondohye v'antu' v'enav'a walelo na igolo. U'v'awi'le v'avikanze vizwalo vyav'o, <verse eid="EXO 19:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 19:11" />na ku'fiki'i'la lu'siku' lwa wu'datu' v'av'e v'igelani'zyaga, ku'nguno lu'siku' lwa wu'datu', ene Gu'ku' Mulungu ndasooke ha igu'lya na lu'gu'lu' lwa Sinai ha mbele ya minso ga v'antu' v'ose. <verse eid="EXO 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 19:12" />Nanho u'v'atu'u'li'le v'antu' lu'v'i'mbi' ku' ki'la lwandi' ku'pilima lu'gu'lu'. U'ku'v'agizya v'iangali'le v'aleke ku'liina lu'gu'lu' lwenu'lu' ninga ku'lu'kuumya. U'yo alalu'kuumye lu'gu'lu' nhanayene alawu'lagwe. <verse eid="EXO 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 19:13" />Muntu' ninga yu'mo ku'du' ize amukuumye muntu' mwenu'yo, ali'vi alagu'mwe na mawe, ninga ku'laswa na masonga. Av'e muntu' ninga ndimu, akasye azuwu'ke. Sumbwa itungo i'lo milangale zilali'le kayawaya, haho v'antu' v'ose v'alegele ha lu'gu'lu'.”<verse eid="EXO 19:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 19:14" />Hohene Mose wasookaga ku'fuma ku' lu'gu'lu', na wav'ayi'laga v'antu' na ku'v'asondohya. Haho nav'o v'avikanzaga vizwalo vyav'o. <verse eid="EXO 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 19:15" />Hangi' wav'awi'laga ati', “Mwiv'ange ku' lu'siku' lwa wu'datu'. Ki'la mugosya ku'du' amwegele muki'ma.”<verse eid="EXO 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 19:16" />Yav'aga mu lu'siku' lwa wu'datu', itungo lya ndiyu', hav'age na ngilimo, wu'meku'le wa nku'v'a, haki'mo na ilunde itimbu ha igu'lya na lu'gu'lu', na muzwi gwa milangale gwali'laga kayawaya. Haho v'antu' v'ose av'o v'av'age ha nkambi' v'atetemaga. <verse eid="EXO 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 19:17" />Hangi' Mose wav'alondolaga v'antu' ku'fuma ha nkambi', ki'gele v'aye v'akiwone na Mulungu. V'ose v'ayaga ku'ki'i'ma ha nsi'li'li' ya lu'gu'lu' lwenu'lo.<verse eid="EXO 19:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 19:18" />Nalo lu'gu'lu' lose lwa Sinai lwakumbi'lagwa na lyonsi, ku'nguno Gu'ku' Mulungu ndi' ali'sooka ha igu'lya nalo mugati' na moto. Nalyo lyonsi lya moto gwenu'go gwaliinaga ku' igu'lya ki'ti' lyonsi lya itanuli ihanya, na lu'gu'lu' lose lwatetemaga ku' nguzu muno. <verse eid="EXO 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 19:19" />Itungo lyeni'lo muzwi gwa milangale gwaku'laga muno. Hangi' Mose wayombaga na Mulungu, Mulungu nawe wasu'v'yaga ku' muzwi gwa ngilimo.<verse eid="EXO 19:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 19:20" />Gu'ku' Mulungu wasookaga ha igu'lya na nsoto na lu'gu'lu' lwa Sinai. Haho wamwitanaga Mose aliine kwenu'ko ku' nsoto na lu'gu'lu'. Hohene Mose waliinaga ku' igu'lya. <verse eid="EXO 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 19:21" />Nawe Gu'ku' Mulungu wamuwi'laga Mose ati', “Sooka ha nsi'li'li' u'kav'ahane v'antu' v'ose ku'du' v'asyepe ku'no ku'ndola ene Gu'ku' Mulungu. U'lu' v'av'ezye vyeni'vyo v'ingi mugati' nav'o v'aku'fwa. <verse eid="EXO 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 19:22" />Ninga v'ahozya av'o v'ali'v'a v'ali'negela yi'li'v'adima v'isondohye, ki'gele ndeke ku'v'apa lu'duko.” <verse eid="EXO 19:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 19:23" />Mose nawe wasu'v'yaga ku'mwa Gu'ku' Mulungu ati', “V'antu' v'enav'a v'akakowola ku'liina ku' lu'gu'lu' lwa Sinai, ku'nguno ev'e mweni'ki'li' waku'gizizye na ku'yomba, ‘Tu'u'li lu'v'i'mbi' mu ngiligili na lu'gu'lu' na ku'lu'leka lu'sondo.’ ” <verse eid="EXO 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 19:24" />Haho Gu'ku' Mulungu wamuwi'laga ati', “Sooka ha nsi'li'li' u'kamulete Aloni ize haki'mo nanho. Ali'vi v'ahozya haki'mo na v'antu' v'angi' ku'du' v'asyepe ku'negela ene, ki'gele ndeke ku'v'apa lu'duko.” <verse eid="EXO 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 19:25" />Hohene Mose wasookaga ku' v'antu' na ku'v'awi'la magambo gose ago walagi'li'ziv'agwa.<verse eid="EXO 19:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="EXO 20" />
  <para style="s">Nhama iku'mi zyamwa Mulungu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="DEU 5:1-21">Mwizu' 5:1-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 20:1" />Mulungu wayombile mihayo zyose zyeni'zi ati', <verse eid="EXO 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 20:2" />“Ene ni' Gu'ku' Mulungu, Mulungu wako, u'yo naku'fumizye ku'fuma ku' nsi' ya Misili, u'ko wav'age musese.<verse eid="EXO 20:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 20:3" />“Ku'du' u'v'e na milungu zingi' sumbwa ene.<verse eid="EXO 20:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 20:4" />“Ku'du' wiv'ezezye ki'mbulimbuli, ninga ki'ntu' cha wikole na ki'ntu' ninga ki'mo i'cho ki'li' mu igu'lya mu chelela, ninga i'cho ki'li' ha nsi'li'li' ha welelo, ninga i'cho ki'li' mu minzi' ha nsi'li'li' ya welelo. <verse eid="EXO 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 20:5" />Ku'du' u'viku'v'i'i'le ninga ku'vitu'mami'la, ku'nguno ene Gu'ku' Mulungu, Mulungu wako, ni' Mulungu wa iwu'v'a. Nu'v'asali'kya v'ana wu'kenagu'zi wa v'asav'o, ninga wu'v'yalwa wa wu'datu' na wa wu'ne wa av'o v'angayile. <verse eid="EXO 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 20:6" />Ali'vi nu'lagi'la chelu' ku' wu'v'yalwa mahu'ya wa v'antu' av'o v'antogilwe na ku'ziku'zya nhama zyanne.<verse eid="EXO 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 20:7" />“Ku'du' u'li'kanie gele lina lyamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu, Mulungu wako. Ku'nguno Gu'ku' Mulungu akasye aleke ku'muv'azi'zya ihu'v'yo muntu' u'yo ali'li'kania lina lyakwe gele.<verse eid="EXO 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 20:8" />“Yi'li'ku'dima u'lwizu'ki'le lu'siku' lwa ki'suuho u'lo lu'li' Sabato, na ku'lu'v'ezya lu'sondo. <verse eid="EXO 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 20:9" />Mugati' na nsiku' mukaga, u'latu'mame na ku'v'ezya magambo gako gose, <verse eid="EXO 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 20:10" />sumbwa lu'siku' lwa mupungati' lwenu'lo lu'li' lu'siku' lwa ki'suuho ku'mwa Gu'ku' Mulungu, Mulungu wako. Lu'siku' lwenu'lo u'leke ku'tu'mama muli'mo ninga gu'mo, ev'e, mwana wako, wa ki'gosya ninga wa ki'ki'ma, haki'mo na mukumba wako na muzya wako, ninga ndimu yako ya ku'sav'a, haki'mo na mugeni u'yo ali' mu kaya yako. <verse eid="EXO 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 20:11" />Ku'nguno ku' nsiku' mukaga Gu'ku' Mulungu watundaga ilunde, li'welelo, nyanza na vyose i'vyo vili' mu welelo yose, na lu'siku' lwa mupungati' wasuuhaga. Ku'nguno yeni'yo Gu'ku' Mulungu walu'dosyaga lu'siku' lwa ki'suuho, na ku'lu'v'ezya lu'sondo.<verse eid="EXO 20:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 20:12" />“Yi'li'ku'dima u'v'aku'zye so na nnoko, ki'gele u'v'e na wikalo wu'lihu mu nsi' i'yo ali'ku'pa Gu'ku' Mulungu, Mulungu wako.<verse eid="EXO 20:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 20:13" />“Ku'du' u'wu'lage.<verse eid="EXO 20:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 20:14" />“Ku'du' u'sihye.<verse eid="EXO 20:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 20:15" />“Ku'du' wiv'e.<verse eid="EXO 20:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 20:16" />“Ku'du' u'mulembekezye muntu' mwiyo.<verse eid="EXO 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 20:17" />“Ku'du' u'yigomelwe nnumba ya mwiyo. Ku'du' u'mwigomelwe muki' wa mwiyo, ninga mukumba wakwe, muzya wakwe, ng'ombe yakwe, mpunda yakwe, ninga ki'ntu' ki'mo i'cho ali'nacho muntu' mwiyo.”<verse eid="EXO 20:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 20:18" />V'antu' v'ose aho v'igwaga ngilimo na ku'wona wu'meku'le wa nku'v'a, na kwigwa muzwi gwa milangale, na ku'wona lu'gu'lu' lu'li'zuka lyonsi, v'ose v'atetemaga ku' wov'a. Haho v'ose v'i'maga ku'le <verse eid="EXO 20:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 20:19" />na ku'muwi'la Mose ati', “Yomba niswe ev'e mweni'ki'li', niswe ku'ku'ku'degeleka. Ali'vi Gu'ku' Mulungu ku'du' u'muleke ayombe niswe, ki'gele ku'du' ku'fwe.” <verse eid="EXO 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 20:20" />Nawe Mose wasu'v'yaga ati', “Muleke kogoha, ku'nguno Mulungu wizaga ku'mugema, ki'gele muv'e na wov'a wa Mulungu na muleke ku'v'ezya wu'kenagu'zi.”<verse eid="EXO 20:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 20:21" />Haho Mose walyegelaga lyeni'lo ilunde lya giti ntimbu, i'lo Mulungu wav'age ali' mwenu'mo. Itungo lyeni'lo v'antu' v'ose v'i'maga ku'le.<verse eid="EXO 20:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ki'v'ezezye cha ihozezyo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 20:22" />Hangi' Gu'ku' Mulungu wamuwi'laga Mose ati', “U'v'awi'le V'aizilaeli i'vi: ‘Inywe v'eni'ki'li' mwiwonelelaga ku'v'a nayombaga na inywe ku'fuma ku' ilunde. <verse eid="EXO 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 20:23" />Ku'du' mwiv'ezezye vimbulimbuli ku'v'a milungu zya ku'ngelani'zya ene, ziv'e zya mawe ga feza ninga zahabu. <verse eid="EXO 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 20:24" />Mulambezezye ihozezyo lya wu'longo, na ha igu'lya yalyo mulanfumi'zye vitaambo vya ku'zigya na vitaambo vya kwiswanania, vya ng'ombe, nkolo na mbu'li zinywe. Ki'la lwandi' u'lo ndahav'ezye lina lyanne li'kumu'kiwe, hene haho ndize na ku'mudosya. <verse eid="EXO 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 20:25" />Na inywe u'lu' mwanzyengela ihozezyo lya mawe, ku'du' mwize muzyengele mawe ga ku'pu'nza, ku'nguno u'lu' mutu'mi'le vilwani'lo vinywe vya ku'pu'nzi'la mawe, mulav'e mwali'v'ezezya zoma. <verse eid="EXO 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 20:26" />Hangi' ku'du' mwize muv'ezye ihozezyo i'lo li'li' na itandi'zyo lya ku'liini'la, ki'gele ku'du' ize asigale du'u'hu' ha igu'lya yalyo.’<verse eid="EXO 20:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="EXO 21" />
  <para style="s">Milagi' ku'nguno ya v'asese</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="DEU 15:12-18">Mwizu' 15:12-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 21:1" />“I'zi hu' milagi' i'zyo u'ku'v'apa V'aizilaeli: <verse eid="EXO 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 21:2" />U'lu' wamugu'la musese wa ki'gosya wa Ki'ebulania, alaku'tu'mami'le ku' itungo lya myaka mukaga. Ali'vi mwaka gwa mupungati', u'lamuleku'li'le iyagalu'le na ku'wu'ka bila ndi'pi. <verse eid="EXO 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 21:3" />U'lu' ndi' wiza akatoola, alawu'ke inene. U'lu' ndi' wiza atoolile alawu'ke na muki' wakwe. <verse eid="EXO 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 21:4" />U'lu' mbe gu'ku' wakwe ndi' wamutozya muki'ma, nawe wamuv'yali'la v'ana v'a ki'gosya ninga v'a ki'ki'ma, hohene muki'ma mwenu'yo haki'mo na v'ana v'akwe v'alav'e nsawo yamwa gu'ku' wakwe, na mwenu'yo musese alawu'ke inene. <verse eid="EXO 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 21:5" />Ali'vi musese mwenu'yo u'lu' ayombe katwipandu' ha mbele yamwa gu'ku' wakwe ati', ‘Mbatogilwe gu'ku' wanne, muki' wanne haki'mo na v'ana v'anne, nkaanile ku'leku'li'lwa niyagalu'le na ku'hafuma,’ <verse eid="EXO 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 21:6" />hohene gu'ku' wakwe alamulete ha mbele yamwa Mulungu. Hangi' alamufile ha muzigo na alamutu'li'ki'zye itwi lyakwe ha mwi'i'mo ninga ha muzigo na ku'li'du'la na saziya. Haho alamutu'mami'le gu'ku' wakwe nsiku' zyose zya wikalo wakwe.<verse eid="EXO 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 21:7" />“Mbe muntu' wamugu'zya mwaniki' wakwe ku'v'a musese, mwenu'yo akasye aleku'li'lwe iyagalu'le ki'ti' v'asese v'a ki'gosya. <verse eid="EXO 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 21:8" />U'lu' gu'ku' ndi' wamukwa mwenu'yo av'e isuli'la wakwe, ali'vi akamutogezizye, haho alazumye akomolwe na ise. Gu'ku' mwenu'yo ali' wu'du'hu' lole ya ku'mugu'zya ku' v'antu' v'ageni v'a nsi' yi'ngi', ku'nguno wamuv'ezezizye wu'yengani. <verse eid="EXO 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 21:9" />U'lu' wakoov'a ku'mutozya ku' mwana wakwe, yi'lamudime amuv'ezezye musese mwenu'yo lole ya ki'ti' mwaniki' mwana wakwe. <verse eid="EXO 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 21:10" />Mbe mwenu'yo gu'ku' asole muki'ma yu'ngi' av'e muki' wakwe ninga isuli'la wakwe akasye amudohezye isuli'la wakwe wa mbele viliwa, myenda na lole ya wu'kwele. <verse eid="EXO 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 21:11" />Sumbwa u'lu' waleka ku'mugelani'zi'zya lole zyeni'zi idatu', hohene isuli'la wakwe mwenu'yo alawu'ke na ku'leku'li'lwa aye bila ninga ku'fumya ndi'pi.<verse eid="EXO 21:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Milagi' ku'nguno ya wu'kandi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 21:12" />“U'yo alamugu'me muntu' na ku'muwu'laga, yi'lamudime ku'wu'lagwa, <verse eid="EXO 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 21:13" />ali'vi u'lu' akamuwu'lagile ku' mpaka, sumbwa Mulungu waleku'li'laga awu'lagwe, hohene muwu'lagi mwenu'yo akowolile ku'peelela u'ko ndamusogolele kwa ku'peelela. <verse eid="EXO 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 21:14" />Sumbwa u'lu' muntu' walomaga ku'mugwi'li'la na ku'muwu'laga mwiye ku' mpaka, mwenu'yo ninga mbe apeelele ha ihozezyo lyanne, u'lamufumye na ku'muwu'laga.<verse eid="EXO 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 21:15" />“U'yo alamugu'me ise ninga nnina yi'lamudime ku'wu'lagwa.<verse eid="EXO 21:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 21:16" />“U'yo alamusampe muntu' na ku'mugu'zya, ninga u'lu' asangwe mu makono gakwe, yi'lamudime ku'wu'lagwa.<verse eid="EXO 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 21:17" />“U'yo alamutyomokele ise ninga nnina yi'lamudime ku'wu'lagwa.<verse eid="EXO 21:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 21:18" />“U'lu' v'antu' v'ikenia, na yu'mo wamugu'ma mwiye na iwe ninga lwa ngumi yakwe, ali'vi akamuwu'lagile, sumbwa wamuv'ezyaga alwali'le na ku'lala ha wu'li'li' wakwe, <verse eid="EXO 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 21:19" />u'lu' wawu'ka hangi' na ku'lamula ku'yu'mba lwa mulanga, haho u'yo wamugu'mile alaleku'li'lwe na ku'tondolwa. Ali'vi yi'lamudime amuli'pe ndi'pi ku'nguno ya itungo i'lo alav'e wamutagi'lile ku' ku'lala ha wu'li'li', na alamulwazye mpaka api'le gi'li'.<verse eid="EXO 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 21:20" />“U'lu' muntu' wamugu'ma musese wakwe, wa ki'gosya ninga wa ki'ki'ma, lwa mulanga nawe afwe hene haho, yi'lamudime apiwe lu'duko. <verse eid="EXO 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 21:21" />Ali'vi musese mwenu'yo u'lu' akafwile mugati' na lu'siku' lu'mo ninga iv'i'li', gu'ku' wakwe mwenu'yo akasye apiwe lu'duko, ku'nguno mwenu'yo wali' ali' nsawo yakwe.<verse eid="EXO 21:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 21:22" />“U'lu' v'agosya v'av'i'li' v'igu'me na ku'muvulazya muki'ma wa mwitungo nawe av'ipye mwitungo gwakwe, ali'vi aleke ku'v'a na wu'vulaziwe wu'ngi', u'yo alav'e wamuvulazyaga yi'lamudime ku'li'pa ndi'pi ya ku'gelani'la ki'ti' i'vyo alav'e wakoov'aga mugosi lya muki'ma mwenu'yo, haki'mo na v'ayangu' i'vyo v'alav'e v'ayangu'la. <verse eid="EXO 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 21:23" />Ali'vi u'lu' wu'v'e wu'li'ho wu'vulaziwe wu'ngi', yi'lamudime ali'pe wu'panga ku' wu'panga, <verse eid="EXO 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 21:24" />linso ku' linso, lino ku' lino, mukono ku' mukono, mugu'lu' ku' mugu'lu', <verse eid="EXO 21:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 21:25" />ku'timwa moto ku' ku'timwa moto, ilonda ku' ilonda, wu'tyu'wu'ke ku' wu'tyu'wu'ke.<verse eid="EXO 21:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 21:26" />“U'lu' muntu' wamugu'ma ku' linso musese wakwe, wa ki'gosya ninga wa ki'ki'ma, na ku'li'v'ipya, yi'lamudime amuleku'li'le iyagalu'le musese mwenu'yo ku'nguno ya linso lyakwe. <verse eid="EXO 21:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 21:27" />U'lu' wamugu'ma ku' lino musese wakwe, wa ki'gosya ninga wa ki'ki'ma, na li'homoke, yi'lamudime amuleku'li'le iyagalu'le musese mwenu'yo ku'nguno ya lino lyakwe.<verse eid="EXO 21:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Milagi' ku'nguno ya mitugo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 21:28" />“U'lu' ng'ombe yi'mupame muntu', mugosya ninga muki'ma, na ku'muwu'laga, yi'lamudime ku'yi'wu'laga ng'ombe yeni'yo ku' ku'yi'gu'ma na mawe, na nyama yakwe yi'kasye yi'liwe. Ali'vi musav'a ng'ombe akasye av'e na musango. <verse eid="EXO 21:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 21:29" />Ali'vi u'lu' ng'ombe yeni'yo yi'mani'lile ku'pama v'antu', na musav'a ng'ombe wawi'lwa ali'vi akayi'tungile, nayo mbe yi'wu'lage muntu', ng'ombe yeni'yo yi'lawu'lagwe ku' ku'gu'mwa na mawe, na musav'a ng'ombe yi'lamudime awu'lagwe. <verse eid="EXO 21:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 21:30" />Ninga vyeni'vyo, muntu' mwenu'yo u'lu' afumiwe masumule ku'nguno ya ku'komola wu'zuwu'ku wakwe, yi'lamudime ali'pe lu'v'alo u'lo lu'li'koov'iwa. <verse eid="EXO 21:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 21:31" />U'lu' ng'ombe yi'mupame mwana, wa ki'gosya ninga wa ki'ki'ma, wu'yangu' wenu'wu' wu'layangu'lwe ku' nzi'la yene yi'yo. <verse eid="EXO 21:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 21:32" />U'lu' ng'ombe yi'mupame musese, wa ki'gosya ninga wa ki'ki'ma, musav'a ng'ombe alamuli'pe gu'ku' wa musese mwenu'yo vipande maku'mi adatu' vya feza, na ng'ombe yeni'yo yi'lawu'lagwe ku' ku'gu'mwa na mawe.<verse eid="EXO 21:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 21:33" />“U'lu' muntu' afundu'ku'le liina, ninga asi'mbe liina aleke ku'li'fundi'ki'zya, na ng'ombe ninga mpunda yi'gwi'le mwenu'mo, <verse eid="EXO 21:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 21:34" />musav'a liina lyeni'lo yi'lamudime afumye ndi'pi. Amuli'pe hela u'yo musav'a mutugo, na mutugo u'go gu'lav'e gwafwaga gu'lav'e gwakwe.<verse eid="EXO 21:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 21:35" />“Ng'ombe ya muntu' u'lu' yi'yi'vulazye ng'ombe ya muntu' yu'ngi' na ku'yi'wu'laga, hohene v'antu' v'enav'a v'av'i'li' v'alayi'gu'zye yeni'yo ng'ombe mpanga na ku'gav'ana mupango gwayo. Vyene vivyo v'alagav'ane na i'yo ya wu'fwe. <verse eid="EXO 21:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="EXO 21:36" />Ali'vi u'lu' yi'manyi'i'ke ku'v'a ng'ombe yeni'yo yi'mani'lile ku'pama ng'ombe ziye, na musav'a ng'ombe akayi'tungile, yi'lamudime musav'a ng'ombe yeni'yo ali'pe ng'ombe ku' ng'ombe, na ng'ombe i'yo ya wu'fwe yi'lav'e yakwe.<verse eid="EXO 21:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="EXO 22" />
  <para style="s">Milagi' ku'nguno ya ndi'pi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 22:1" />“U'lu' muntu' iv'e ng'ombe, nkolo ninga mbu'li na ku'yi'si'nza ninga ku'yi'gu'zya, yi'lamudime ali'pe ng'ombe itano ku' ki'la ng'ombe yi'mo, na nkolo ine ku' ki'la nkolo yi'mo, na mbu'li ine ku' ki'la mbu'li yi'mo. <verse eid="EXO 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 22:2" />U'lu' mwiv'i adimwe aho ali'bomola nnumba wu'ziku', nawe agu'mwe mpaka afwe, u'yo wa ku'muwu'laga akasye av'e na musango gwa kwita magazi. <verse eid="EXO 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 22:3" />Ali'vi mwiv'i u'lu' adimwe itungo i'lo lyu'v'a lyadodomoka na ku'wu'lagwa, wa ku'muwu'laga alav'e na musango gwa kwita magazi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EXO 22:3">“Sumbwa mwiv'i u'lu' adimwe, yi'li'mudima ali'pe. U'lu' ali' wu'du'hu' ki'ntu' cha ku'li'pa, haho mweni'ki'li' alagu'ziwe ki'gele ali'pe ku'nguno ya wiv'i wakwe. <verse eid="EXO 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 22:4" />U'lu' mutugo u'go gwali' gwiv'agwa gwigele mupanga mu makono gakwe, yi'v'e ng'ombe, mpunda, nkolo ninga mbu'li, yi'lamudime ku'li'pa zingi' iv'i'li'.<verse eid="EXO 22:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 22:5" />“U'lu' muntu' wazidi'mi'la mitugo zyakwe mu mugu'nda gwakwe ninga mugu'nda gwakwe gwa mizabibu, na ku'zileku'li'la mitugo zidi'mi'zye mu mugu'nda gwa muntu' yu'ngi', yi'lamudime ku'li'pa viliwa visoga ku'fuma ku' mugu'nda gwakwe mweni'ki'li' ninga ku'fuma ku' mugu'nda gwakwe gwa mizabibu.<verse eid="EXO 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 22:6" />“U'lu' muntu' av'asye moto, nago gu'li'time itimba na ku'sambala mpaka ku'zigya matuntu ga viliwa vya v'antu' v'angi', ninga ku'zigya viliwa i'vyo vikaali' kwi'mbu'lwa, ninga mugu'nda gose gu'zige, wa ku'gu'v'asya moto gwenu'go yi'lamudime ali'pe musango gwenu'go.<verse eid="EXO 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 22:7" />“U'lu' muntu' amutu'u'li'zye muntu' mwiye feza ninga vintu' vingi', ali'vi vintu' vyeni'vyo viv'iwe mu lu'go lwa muntu' mwenu'yo, u'lu' mwiv'i igele yi'lamudime ku'li'pa kav'i'li'. <verse eid="EXO 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 22:8" />Ali'vi mwiv'i u'lu' waleka kwigela, haho musav'a nnumba yi'lamudime egele ha mbele yamwa Mulungu, ki'gele yigele nhana akav'ile hu' mwene wiv'aga nsawo ya mwiye.<verse eid="EXO 22:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 22:9" />“Ki'la igambo lya ku'pu'gana ku'nguno ya nsawo, li'v'e lya ng'ombe, mpunda, nkolo, mbu'li, vizwalo ninga lya ki'la ki'ntu' i'cho chatagi'kile, na ki'la yu'mo ali'yomba ati', ‘Yeni'yi' yi'li' nsawo yanne,’ igambo lyeni'li' lya v'antu' v'av'i'li' li'laletwe ha mbele yamwa Mulungu. U'yo Mulungu alayangu'le ku'v'a hu' mwene akenagu'lile, alamuli'pe mwiye kav'i'li'.<verse eid="EXO 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 22:10" />“U'lu' muntu' av'i'kye ku' mwiye mpunda, ng'ombe, nkolo, mbu'li, ninga mutugo gu'ngi', ki'gele amusu'ngi'le, na mutugo gwenu'go u'lu' gu'fwe, ninga ku'lumi'la, ninga ku'solwa bila muntu' ku'wona, <verse eid="EXO 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 22:11" />hohene v'antu' v'enav'a v'av'i'li' v'alalahi'le ha mbele yamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu ku'v'a mwenu'yo muntu' akav'ile mwiv'i wa nsawo ya mwiye. Musav'a mutugo gwenu'go yi'lamudime azumye igambo lyeni'li', haho ku'lav'e ku'du'hu' ndi'pi. <verse eid="EXO 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 22:12" />Ali'vi u'lu' mutugo gwenu'go gwiv'iwe ku' mwiye, yi'lamudime amuli'pe musav'a mutugo. <verse eid="EXO 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 22:13" />U'lu' gwenu'go mutugo gu'tandagu'lwe na ndimu zya mu ipolu, muntu' u'yo ndi' watu'u'li'ziwa yi'lamudime agu'lete ki'gele yi'v'e wu'sangi'lwa. Haho ku'lav'e ku'du'hu' ndi'pi ku'nguno ya mutugo gwa ku'tandagu'lwa.<verse eid="EXO 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 22:14" />“U'lu' muntu' watizya mutugo ku' mwiye, nago gu'vulali'ke ninga ku'fwa itungo i'lo musav'a mutugo ali'hadu'hu', yi'lamudime u'yo ndi' watizya ku'muli'pa mwiye. <verse eid="EXO 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 22:15" />Ali'vi u'lu' musav'a asangwe ali'ho ha mutugo, hohene u'yo wagu'tizizye akasye ali'pe ki'ntu'. U'lu' mutugo ndi' gwa ku'kodi, feza i'yo yali'pilwe ku' ku'kodi yi'lav'e yi'gelani'lile ku' ndi'pi ya mutugo.<verse eid="EXO 22:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Milagi' ku'nguno ya kikali'le</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 22:16" />“U'lu' muntu' wamuhu'mbi'ka muhala u'yo akaali' ku'kwiwa, na ku'lala nawe, yi'lamudime ku'mukwa ki'gele av'e muki' wakwe. <verse eid="EXO 22:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 22:17" />Ali'vi ise wa muhala mwenu'yo u'lu' akaane kukuntu ku'mutozya u'yo muhala ku' muntu' mwenu'yo, ninga vyeni'vyo yi'lamudime muntu' mwenu'yo ku'li'pa nkwanwa i'yo yi'li'koov'iwa ku' mwaniki' u'yo akaali' muhala.<verse eid="EXO 22:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 22:18" />“Ku'du' u'muleke muki'ma mulogi azuwu'ke.<verse eid="EXO 22:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 22:19" />“Muntu' u'lu' alale na ndimu yi'lamudime awu'lagwe.<verse eid="EXO 22:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 22:20" />“Muntu' u'lu' amufumi'zye ki'taambo mulungu yu'ngi' ku'leka Gu'ku' Mulungu mweni'ki'li', yi'lamudime azimangu'ziwe.<verse eid="EXO 22:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 22:21" />“Ku'du' u'mwiwonelezye mugeni mwizi'li'zi ninga ku'mutusya, ku'nguno ninga inywe ndi' muli' v'ageni ku' nsi' ya Misili.<verse eid="EXO 22:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 22:22" />“Ku'du' u'muv'ezezye mav'i muki'ma mufwi'lwa ninga mwana wa nfuvi. <verse eid="EXO 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 22:23" />U'lu' u'v'av'ezezye mav'i v'enav'o, nav'o mbe v'andi'li'le ene, nhana ndadegeleke ki'li'lo chav'o. <verse eid="EXO 22:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 22:24" />Haho ki'sila channe ki'lapanki'le, nanne ndamuwu'lage inywe ku' lu'panga, v'aki' v'inywe v'alav'e v'afwi'lwa na v'ana v'inywe v'alav'e v'ana v'a nfuvi.<verse eid="EXO 22:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 22:25" />“U'lu' u'mukopisye hela yu'mo mugati' na v'antu' v'anne v'api'na, ku'du' u'v'e ki'ti' mukopisya ninga ku'du' u'mutonele wu'su'lu'. <verse eid="EXO 22:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 22:26" />U'lu' u'sole mwenda gwa muntu' mwiyo na ku'gu'tu'u'la mulehani, yi'li'ku'dima u'musu'v'i'zye aho lyu'v'a li'kaali' ku'loka, <verse eid="EXO 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 22:27" />ku'nguno gwenu'go gu'li' mwenda gwakwe gwinene gwa kwikumbi'la. Ninga U'li'wiganika wu'ziku' akwikumbi'la ki'? U'lu' andi'li'le ndadegeleke ki'li'lo chakwe, ku'nguno ene ni'na moyo gwa ki'sa.<verse eid="EXO 22:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 22:28" />“Ku'du' wize u'mutyomokele Mulungu, ninga ku'mufwizi'i'la mutemi wa v'antu' v'ako.<verse eid="EXO 22:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 22:29" />“Ku'du' wize u'v'e u'li'kendela ku'ndetela kalu'mbi'lo ka ntomolwa ya viliwa vyako, ki'neneko haki'mo na maguta ga muzeituni. Hangi' u'lampe ki'la muv'yalwa wako wa mbele wa ki'gosya. <verse eid="EXO 22:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 22:30" />U'lav'ezye vyeni'vyo na ku' ng'ombe zyako haki'mo na nkolo na mbu'li zyako. U'lav'e u'li'zileka ku'mwa nnina nsiku' mupungati', na lu'siku' lwa munane u'lanfumi'zye. <verse eid="EXO 22:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 22:31" />Na inywe mulav'e v'antu' v'asondo ku' wanne. Ku'nguno yeni'yo ku'du' mwize muv'e muli'lya nyama i'yo yi'tandagu'lilwe na ndimu ya mu ipolu. Nyama yeni'yo mulav'e muli'zipa mbwa.<verse eid="EXO 22:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="EXO 23" />
  <para style="s">Milagi' ku'nguno ya lole na ki'sa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 23:1" />“Ku'du' wize u'v'e u'li'sambazya mmola zya wu'fi. Ku'du' wize u'v'e haki'mo na mukenagu'zi na ku'v'a musangi'lwa wa wu'fi. <verse eid="EXO 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 23:2" />Ku'du' wize u'v'e u'li'wilonda na idale lya v'antu' mu ku'v'ezya wu'kenagu'zi. Ninga ku'du' wize wisangye na idale lya v'antu' aho u'li'fumya wu'sangi'lwa ha iv'anza ku' muhayo ninga gu'mo ki'gele ku'nyongania wu'yangu'. <verse eid="EXO 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 23:3" />Hangi' ku'du' wize u'v'e na wu'hegela ku' mihayo zya mupi'na.<verse eid="EXO 23:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 23:4" />“U'lu' u'yi'sange ng'ombe ninga mpunda ya mwanisi wako yi'tagi'kile, yi'laku'dime ku'yi'su'v'ya ku' wakwe. <verse eid="EXO 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 23:5" />U'lu' u'yi'wone mpunda yakwe u'yo aku'gayile yi'gwile ha nsi' ku'no yi'li' na muligo gwayo, ku'du' wize u'yi'leke haho yi'gwile. Yi'laku'dime u'mugwasye.<verse eid="EXO 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 23:6" />“Ku'du' wize u'nyonganie wu'yangu' u'wo wu'li'koov'iwa ku' mupi'na mugati' na musango gwakwe. <verse eid="EXO 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 23:7" />Wilige ku'le na mihayo zya wu'fi, ninga ku'du' u'v'awu'lage av'o v'ali' wu'du'hu' musango na v'a lole, ku'nguno ene nkasye mmuv'azi'zye lole u'yo mukenagu'zi. <verse eid="EXO 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 23:8" />Ku'du' wize u'zumye ku'pokela ihongo, ku'nguno ihongo li'li'v'ahofuzya minso av'o v'ali'wona, na ku'nyongania mihayo zya v'antu' v'a lole.<verse eid="EXO 23:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 23:9" />“Ku'du' wize u'mwiwonelezye mugeni mwizi'li'zi, ku'nguno inywe v'eni'ki'li' mumanyile i'vyo yi'li' ku' mugeni mwizi'li'zi, ku'nguno ndi' muli' v'ageni ku' nsi' ya Misili.<verse eid="EXO 23:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Milagi' ku'nguno ya lu'siku' lwa ki'suuho u'lo lu'li' Sabato</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 23:10" />“U'lahambe mbiyu' ha nsi' yako ku' itungo lya myaka mukaga, na ku'pandi'ka viliwa vyayo. <verse eid="EXO 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 23:11" />Ali'vi mwaka gwa mupungati' u'laleke ku'gali'ma malale ki'gele gasuuhe, na v'antu' v'api'na mugati' na inywe v'asalale viliwa ku'fuma mu malale genago, nazyo ndimu zya mu ipolu zidi'me u'mo v'alav'e v'ali'lekela. U'lav'e u'li'v'ezya vyene vivyo mu migu'nda zyako zya mizabibu na zya mizeituni.<verse eid="EXO 23:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 23:12" />“Ku' itungo lya nsiku' mukaga u'lav'e u'li'tu'mama mili'mo zyako. Ali'vi lu'siku' lwa mupungati' u'lav'e u'li'suuha, ki'gele ng'ombe yako na mpunda yako ziv'e zili'suuha, nawe mwana wa muzya u'yo wav'yali'lilwe ha lu'go lwako, haki'mo na mugeni, v'apandi'ke ki'suuho. <verse eid="EXO 23:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 23:13" />U'yi'dime yose i'yo naku'wi'lile. U'leke ku'gakania ninga hadoo mina ga milungu zingi', ninga galeke ku'degelekwa ku'fuma ku' mulomo gwako.”<verse eid="EXO 23:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Myanya zya ki'la mwaka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 34:18-26">Ku'fuma 34:18-26</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 16:1-17">Mwizu' 16:1-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 23:14" />Mulungu wendeleyaga ku'yomba ati', “Mulav'e muli'mbezezya mwanya kali' kadatu' ku' ki'la mwaka. <verse eid="EXO 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 23:15" />Muzidime nsiku' zya Mwanya gwa Migate I'zyo Zikatumba, na mulav'e muli'lya migate i'zyo zikatumba mugati' na nsiku' mupungati' ki'ti' i'vyo namulagi'li'zizye. Mulav'ezye vyeni'vyo ku' itungo i'lo li'tu'u'lilwe lya mwezi gwa Abibu, u'go gu'li' mwezi gwa kwandya, ku'nguno mwezi gwenu'go hu' gwene mwafuma ku' Misili. Ku'du' ize igele muntu' ninga yu'mo ha mbele yanne ali' makono du'. <verse eid="EXO 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 23:16" />Hangi' mulav'ezye Mwanya gwa Lu'siku' lwa Lyi'mbu'la, ku' ntomolwa ya mili'mo zya mu migu'nda zinywe. Mulav'ezye Mwanya gwa Lu'siku' lwa Ku'kuminga ku' ndugo ya mwaka, aho mulav'e muli'kuminga viliwa vya makono ginywe. <verse eid="EXO 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 23:17" />V'agosya v'ose v'alav'e v'ali'wikungania ha mbele yamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu kali' kadatu' ki'la mwaka.<verse eid="EXO 23:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 23:18" />“Ku'du' munfumi'zye magazi ga ki'taambo channe haki'mo na mugate u'go gu'tumbile, ninga maguta ga mutugo gwa lu'siku' lwa mwanya gwanne ku'du' mwize muv'e muli'wu'lekela mpaka ndiyu'.<verse eid="EXO 23:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 23:19" />“Hangi' ntomolwa ya ntangi'lo ya nsi' yako u'lav'e u'li'yi'leta mu nnumba yanne, ene Gu'ku' Mulungu, Mulungu wako.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EXO 23:19">“Ku'du' wize u'kasev'ye kadi'lana mu mav'eele gamwa nnina.<verse eid="EXO 23:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ilagano lya ku'tongelelwa na malaika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 23:20" />“Lingagi, ene nu'mutu'ma malaika amutongelele av'e ku' mbele yinywe, ki'gele amusu'nge mu nzi'la na ku'mufila mpaka ku' lwandi' u'lo nakamwiv'aga. <verse eid="EXO 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 23:21" />Mulamuku'zye na ku'mudegeleka i'cho alav'e ali'yomba. Ku'du' mwize mumutale, ku'nguno akasye amutondole wu'kenagu'zi winywe, ku'nguno namutu'mile ku' lina lyanne. <verse eid="EXO 23:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 23:22" />Ali'vi mbe mwize mumudegeleke visoga muzwi gwakwe, na ku'v'ezya gose ago nu'yomba, haho ene ndav'e ni' mwanisi wa v'anisi v'inywe, na ndav'api'i'nge av'o v'ali'mupi'i'nga.<verse eid="EXO 23:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 23:23" />“Malaika wanne alamutongelele ku' mbele yinywe na ku'mufikya ku' nsi' ya V'aamoli, V'ahiti, V'apelizi, V'akanaani, V'ahivi na V'ayebusi, nanne ndav'azimangu'zye v'ose v'enav'o. <verse eid="EXO 23:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 23:24" />U'leke ku'ziku'v'i'i'la milungu zyav'o ninga ku'zitu'mami'la, na ku'londa ki'ti'le chav'o. Ali'vi u'lazibomolange kabisa, na nhi'ngi' zyav'o zya mawe zya kwisengela u'laziv'elange mav'ale mav'ale. <verse eid="EXO 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 23:25" />Na inywe mulantu'mami'le ene Gu'ku' Mulungu, Mulungu winywe, nanne ndavidosye viliwa vinywe na minzi' ginywe. Hangi' ndamusini'zye malwile mugati' na inywe. <verse eid="EXO 23:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 23:26" />Ku'kasye ku'v'e na muki'ma wa ku'v'ipya mwitungo ninga mugu'mba mu nsi' yinywe. Nanne ndamuyali'le muv'e na wikalo wu'lihu.<verse eid="EXO 23:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 23:27" />“Ndafile wov'a ha mbele yinywe, na ku'zihahya ki'la kabi'la i'zyo mulav'e muzifiki'i'la. Ndav'av'ezye v'anisi v'inywe v'ose v'agalu'ke na ku'mupeela. <verse eid="EXO 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 23:28" />Ndatongezye mawugu ha mbele yinywe, ago galav'apeezye V'ahivi, V'akanaani na V'ahiti. <verse eid="EXO 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 23:29" />Ali'vi nkasye mbasage v'antu' v'enav'o ku' itungo lya mwaka gu'mo, ku'nguno nsi' yi'lasigale yi'li' wu'du'hu' ki'ntu' na ndimu zya mu ipolu zilingi'he na ku'mutusya. <verse eid="EXO 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 23:30" />Ndav'asage hado hado mpaka aho mulav'e mwingi'ha na ku'gelani'la ku'yi'tema nsi' yeni'yo. <verse eid="EXO 23:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 23:31" />Nanne ndamutu'u'li'le lu'v'i'mbi' lwinywe ku'lamuli'la ku' Nyanza ya Shamu mpaka ku' Nyanza ya Meditelania<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23:31 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ku' Ki'ebulania nyanza ya V'afilisiti</char></note>, na ku'fumi'i'la ku' ibalangu' mpaka ku' mongo gwa Efulate. Ndav'atu'u'le v'ikazi v'a nsi' yeni'yo mu makono ginywe, na inywe mulav'asage v'ahafume ha mbele yinywe. <verse eid="EXO 23:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 23:32" />Ku'du' u'tu'u'le ilagano ninga li'mo nav'o ninga na milungu zyav'o. <verse eid="EXO 23:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 23:33" />Ku'du' mwize muv'azumi'zye kwikala mu nsi' yinywe, ku'nguno u'lu' muzitu'mami'le milungu zyav'o, nhana yi'lav'e ki'ti' mutego ku' winywe, na v'alamuv'ezye mumbezezye wu'kenagu'zi ene.”<verse eid="EXO 23:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="EXO 24" />
  <para style="s">Ilagano lya magazi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 24:1" />Hangi' Gu'ku' Mulungu wamuwi'laga Mose ati', “Liini mwize ku' wanne, ev'e, Aloni, Nadabu na Abihu, haki'mo na v'anamala maku'mi mupungati' mugati' na v'anamala v'a Izilaeli. Mwi'me katanalo na ku'nku'v'i'i'la. <verse eid="EXO 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 24:2" />Ali'vi ev'e Mose winene du' hu' u'ku'negela bi'hi', sumbwa v'angi' ku'du' v'anegele, ninga V'aizilaeli ku'du' v'aliine haki'mo nanho.”<verse eid="EXO 24:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 24:3" />Hohene Mose wayaga ku'kav'awi'la v'antu' mihayo na milagi' zyose zyamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu. V'antu' v'ose v'asu'v'yaga ku' muzwi gu'mo na ku'yomba ati', “Ki'la muhayo u'go walagi'li'zyaga Gu'ku' Mulungu, ku'ku'v'ezya.” <verse eid="EXO 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 24:4" />Haho Mose watonaga ki'la muhayo u'go Gu'ku' Mulungu wamuwi'laga. Hangi' wangalu'ke ndiyu', wipunaga na ku'zyenga ihozezyo ha nsi'li'li' na lu'gu'lu', na ku'ki'ndi'ka nhi'ngi' iku'mi na iv'i'li' zya mawe ku'londana na lu'v'alo lwa magongo iku'mi na av'i'li' ga V'aizilaeli. <verse eid="EXO 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 24:5" />Hohene wav'atu'maga v'asu'mbana v'a Ki'izilaeli, ki'gele v'amufumi'zye Gu'ku' Mulungu vitaambo vya ku'zigya na vitaambo vya kwiswanania vya ng'ombe nzagamba. <verse eid="EXO 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 24:6" />Nawe Mose wasolaga nusu ya magazi ga vitaambo vyeni'vyo, wagatu'u'laga mu mabakuli, na gangi' wanyanyagi'laga ha ihozezyo. <verse eid="EXO 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 24:7" />Hangi' wasolaga Ki'tabu cha Ilagano na waki'somaga ha mbele ya v'antu' v'ose, nav'o v'ayombaga ati', “Mihayo zyose i'zyo wayombaga Gu'ku' Mulungu ku'ku'ziv'ezya, na ku'ku'muku'zya.” <verse eid="EXO 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 24:8" />Haho Mose wagasolaga ago magazi, na ku'v'anyanyagi'la v'antu' v'enav'o. Wayombaga, “Genaga hu' magazi ga ilagano i'lo Gu'ku' Mulungu wav'ezyaga na inywe ku'londana na mihayo zyeni'zi zyose.”<verse eid="EXO 24:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 24:9" />Hohene Mose, Aloni, Nadabu na Abihu, haki'mo na v'anamala maku'mi mupungati' mugati' na v'anamala v'a Izilaeli, v'aliinaga ku' lu'gu'lu', <verse eid="EXO 24:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 24:10" />nav'o v'amuwonaga Mulungu wa Izilaeli. Ha nsi'li'li' na magu'lu' gakwe hav'age na ki'ntu' i'cho ki'li' ki'ti' ilole i'lo li'v'eziv'ilwe ku' mawe ga yakuti ya samawati, i'lo li'li' isoso ki'ti' chelela cha ilunde. <verse eid="EXO 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 24:11" />Ali'vi Gu'ku' Mulungu akawu'sizye mukono gwakwe ha igu'lya na v'atongelezi v'a V'aizilaeli. Sumbwa v'amuwonaga Mulungu, nav'o v'alyaga na ku'nywa.<verse eid="EXO 24:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mose ali'liina ku' lu'gu'lu' lwa Sinai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 24:12" />Haho Gu'ku' Mulungu wamuwi'laga Mose ati', “Liina ku' igu'lya wize ku'no ku' wanne, wikale ku'no. Nanne nku'ku'pa mav'ale ga mawe ago gatonilwe nhama na nzi'la ya nhana, ki'gele u'kav'ahembeke V'aizilaeli.” <verse eid="EXO 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 24:13" />Hohene Mose wawu'kaga haki'mo na Yoswa, mukumba wakwe, nawe Mose walamulaga ku'liina ku' lu'gu'lu' lwamwa Mulungu. <verse eid="EXO 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 24:14" />Mose wasangwa wav'awi'laga av'o v'anamala v'a Izilaeli ati', “Ku'lindi'li henanha mpaka aho ku'ku'v'a kwasu'v'a. U'lu' muntu' wav'a na igambo aku'v'a ali'ya ku'mwa Aloni na Huli, ku'nguno v'enav'a v'aku'v'a haki'mo na inywe.”<verse eid="EXO 24:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 24:15" />Hohene Mose wendeleyaga ku'liina ku' lu'gu'lu', na ilunde lyalu'kumbaga lu'gu'lu'. <verse eid="EXO 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 24:16" />Lu'kumo lwamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu lwasookaga ha igu'lya na lu'gu'lu' lwa Sinai, na ilunde lyalu'kumbaga lu'gu'lu' nsiku' mukaga. Mu lu'siku' lwa mupungati' Mulungu wamwitanaga Mose ku'fuma mugati' na ilunde lyeni'lo. <verse eid="EXO 24:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 24:17" />Lu'kumo lwamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu lwigelaga ha mbele ya minso ga V'aizilaeli ki'ti' moto gwa ku'zigya kwenu'ko ku' igu'lya na lu'gu'lu'. <verse eid="EXO 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 24:18" />Hangi' Mose wafiki'ki'laga na kwingi'la mugati' na ilunde lyeni'lo. Nawe wikalaga kwenu'ko ku' igu'lya na lu'gu'lu' ku' itungo lya nsiku' maku'mi ane, wu'ziku' na lyu'v'a.<verse eid="EXO 24:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="EXO 25" />
  <para style="s">Kalu'mbi'lo ku'nguno ya Ihema Isondo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 35:4-9">Ku'fuma 35:4-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 25:1" />Mugati' na nsiku' zyeni'zyo, Gu'ku' Mulungu wamuwi'laga Mose ati', <verse eid="EXO 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 25:2" />“U'v'awi'le V'aizilaeli v'anfumi'zye kalu'mbi'lo. U'lav'e u'li'pokela kalu'mbi'lo ku'nguno yanne ku'fuma ku' ki'la muntu' u'yo alav'e ali'fumya ku' moyo gwa ku'togwa. <verse eid="EXO 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 25:3" />Aka hu' kalu'mbi'lo ako u'lav'e u'li'pokela ku'fuma mu makono gav'o: mawe ga feza, zahabu na shaba, <verse eid="EXO 25:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 25:4" />wu'zi wa langi ya bululu, zambalawo na yazaa, wu'zi wa katani nsoga, wu'yenze wa mbu'li, <verse eid="EXO 25:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 25:5" />ndi'li' zya ng'ondi i'zyo ziv'ililwe langi yazaa, ndi'li' zya ndimu zingi' zya mu nyanza, magogo ga muti' gwa mugu'nga, <verse eid="EXO 25:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 25:6" />maguta ga muzeituni ku'nguno ya tala, visanjo ku'nguno ya maguta ga ku'v'ila na wu'bani wu'motu, <verse eid="EXO 25:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 25:7" />mawe ga mupango ga shohamu, na mawe gangi' ga mupango ku'nguno ya ki'zibao na kamufuko ka ha ki'kuv'a ku'nguno ya muhozya muhanya. <verse eid="EXO 25:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 25:8" />Hangi' V'aizilaeli v'ambezezye hantu' hasondo, ki'gele nikale mugati' yav'o. <verse eid="EXO 25:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 25:9" />V'ambezezye ihema lyeni'lo haki'mo na vilwani'lo vyalyo vyose, na ku'gelani'zya ki'ti' i'vi nku'ku'lagi'la.<verse eid="EXO 25:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isandi'ko lya wu'sangi'lwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 37:1-9">Ku'fuma 37:1-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 25:10" />“U'lav'ezye isandi'ko lya mbawo zya mugu'nga. Li'v'e na wu'lihu wa sentimita igana li'mo na iku'mi, wu'gali'nhu li'v'e na sentimita maku'mi mukaga na mukaga, na wi'i'ma walyo li'v'e na sentimita maku'mi mukaga na mukaga. <verse eid="EXO 25:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 25:11" />Nanho u'lali'kumbi'le zahabu nsoso mugati' na ha ibala, na ku'li'pilimya lu'ki'go lwa zahabu ki'la lwandi'. <verse eid="EXO 25:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 25:12" />Hangi' u'lasule pete ine zya zahabu, na ku'zitunga ku' magu'lu' galyo ane, pete iv'i'li' lwandi' lu'mo na pete iv'i'li' lwandi' lwa wu'v'i'li'. <verse eid="EXO 25:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 25:13" />U'lav'ezye na miti' iv'i'li' zya mugu'nga na ku'zikumbi'la zahabu. <verse eid="EXO 25:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 25:14" />Miti' zyeni'zyo u'lazisweke ku' pete i'zyo zili' mu mbazu zya isandi'ko, ku'nguno ya ku'li'sombela. <verse eid="EXO 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 25:15" />Hangi' miti' zyeni'zyo zilikale haho ha pete zya isandi'ko, ku'du' zize zisiniwe. <verse eid="EXO 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 25:16" />Mugati' na isandi'ko lyeni'lo u'latu'u'lemo mav'ale av'i'li' ga mawe ga wu'sangi'lwa u'wo ndaku'pe.<verse eid="EXO 25:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 25:17" />“U'lav'ezye nfundi' ya wu'swanano ku' zahabu nsoso. Wu'lihu wayo wu'lav'e wa sentimita igana li'mo na iku'mi na wu'gali'nhu wayo sentimita maku'mi mukaga na mukaga. <verse eid="EXO 25:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 25:18" />Hangi' u'lav'ezye na masu'mbano av'i'li' ga wikole na v'amalaika v'akelubi ku' zahabu i'yo yi'sulilwe ku' nnundo, na ku'gatu'u'la ku' ki'la mpelo ya nfundi'. <verse eid="EXO 25:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 25:19" />U'latu'u'le isu'mbano li'mo ku' mpelo yi'mo na isu'mbano li'ngi' ku' mpelo ya wu'v'i'li'. Masu'mbano genago u'lagatu'u'le gav'e ki'ntu' ki'mo na yeni'yo nfundi', ku' mpelo zyose iv'i'li'. <verse eid="EXO 25:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 25:20" />Masu'mbano genago galav'e ganzile manana gago ku' igu'lya, na ku'yi'kumbi'la nfundi'. Nago galav'e gilolile, ku'no gayi'dolekile nfundi'. <verse eid="EXO 25:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 25:21" />Mugati' na isandi'ko u'latu'u'le mav'ale av'i'li' ga mawe ga wu'sangi'lwa ago ndaku'pe, na ha igu'lya yalyo u'latu'u'le nfundi'. <verse eid="EXO 25:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 25:22" />Nanne ndav'e nu'poma nanho henanho ha igu'lya na nfundi', i'lo li'li' hagati' ya v'akelubi v'enav'o v'av'i'li' av'o v'ali' ha igu'lya na isandi'ko lya wu'sangi'lwa. Ndav'e nu'su'nsu'mu'la nanho henanho na ku'ku'pa milagi' zyose ku'nguno ya V'aizilaeli.<verse eid="EXO 25:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Meza ya migate misondo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 37:10-16">Ku'fuma 37:10-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 25:23" />“Nanho u'lav'ezye meza ya mbawo zya mugu'nga yi'v'e na wu'lihu wa sentimita maku'mi munane na munane, wu'gali'nhu wayo sentimita maku'mi ane na ine, na wi'i'ma wayo sentimita maku'mi mukaga na mukaga. <verse eid="EXO 25:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 25:24" />Meza yeni'yo u'layi'kumbi'le zahabu nsoso, na ku'yi'pilimi'zya lu'ki'go lwa zahabu ki'la lwandi'. <verse eid="EXO 25:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 25:25" />Hangi' u'lav'ezye kalu'bawo na ku'yi'pilimi'zya meza ki'la lwandi', na u'lakapilimi'zye lu'ki'go lwa zahabu. Kalu'bawo kenako kalav'e na wu'gali'nhu wa sentimita munane. <verse eid="EXO 25:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 25:26" />U'lav'ezye pete ine zya zahabu ku'nguno ya meza yeni'yo, na ku'zizwi'ka ku' ki'la mugu'lu' gwa meza yeni'yo. <verse eid="EXO 25:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 25:27" />Pete zyeni'zyo u'lazitu'u'le ziv'e bi'hi' na ako kalu'bawo, ki'gele ziv'e hu' ha ku'dimi'zya i'zyo miti' zya ku'yi'sombela meza. <verse eid="EXO 25:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 25:28" />U'lav'ezye miti' zya mugu'nga ziv'e zya ku'yi'sombela meza, na ku'zikumbi'la zahabu. <verse eid="EXO 25:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 25:29" />Hangi' u'lav'ezye viseme vyayo ku' zahabu nsoso: sahani na tu'viseme ku'nguno ya wu'bani, na vikombe na mabakuli ku'nguno ya ku'pu'ngu'li'la kalu'mbi'lo ka ki'neneko. <verse eid="EXO 25:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 25:30" />U'lazitu'u'le migate misondo ha igu'lya na meza ziv'e ha mbele yanne ku' matungo gose.<verse eid="EXO 25:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ki'nala cha ku'tu'u'li'la tala</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 37:17-24">Ku'fuma 37:17-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 25:31" />“U'lav'ezye ki'nala cha ku'tu'u'li'la tala ku' zahabu nsoso i'yo yi'sulilwe ku' nnundo. Kikali'lo chacho, kamuti' kacho, vikombe vyacho, magundo gacho na mauwa gacho, vyose viv'e ki'ntu' ki'mo. <verse eid="EXO 25:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 25:32" />Matambi' mukaga gafumi'le mu mbazu zyacho, matambi' adatu' gav'e lwandi' lu'mo, na matambi' adatu' lwandi' lwa wu'v'i'li'. <verse eid="EXO 25:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 25:33" />Ku' ki'la itambi' mugati' na genago mukaga ku'lav'e na vikombe vidatu' vya wikole na malawu' ga muti' gwa mulozi, ki'la ki'mo na magundo gacho na malawu' gacho. <verse eid="EXO 25:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 25:34" />Ku' kamuti' vilav'e vili'ho vikombe vine i'vyo viv'eziv'ilwe ku' wikole wa malawu' ga mulozi, haki'mo na magundo gavyo na malawu' gavyo. <verse eid="EXO 25:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 25:35" />Ki'la lwandi' u'lo lu'lav'e lu'li'fumi'i'la matambi' av'i'li', ha nsi'li'li' yaho halav'e na igundo li'mo li'mo. <verse eid="EXO 25:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="EXO 25:36" />Magundo genago na matambi' gago galav'e ki'ntu' ki'mo na cheni'cho ki'nala cha ku'tu'u'li'la tala, na vyose vilav'e vya zahabu nsoso i'yo yi'sulilwe ku' nnundo. <verse eid="EXO 25:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="EXO 25:37" />Hangi' u'lav'ezye tala mupungati', na ku'zitu'u'la ha igu'lya na ki'nala cheni'cho, ki'gele zimu'li'ke ha mbele yacho. <verse eid="EXO 25:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="EXO 25:38" />U'lav'ezye mikasi zya ku'gelani'zi'zya wu'tambi' na sahani zyayo vyose viv'e vya zahabu nsoso. <verse eid="EXO 25:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="EXO 25:39" />U'latu'mi'le kilo maku'mi adatu' na itano zya zahabu nsoso<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">25:39 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kilo maku'mi adatu' na itano ku' Ki'ebulania yi'li' talanta yi'mo.</char></note> ku'v'ezezya ki'nala cha ku'tu'u'li'la tala haki'mo na vilwani'lo vyacho vyose. <verse eid="EXO 25:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="EXO 25:40" />Wangali'le aho u'li'viv'ezya u'viv'ezye ki'ti' i'vyo walagi'lilwe ku' lu'gu'lu'.”<verse eid="EXO 25:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="EXO 26" />
  <para style="s">Ihema isondo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 36:8-38">Ku'fuma 36:8-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 26:1" />Hangi' Gu'ku' Mulungu wendeleyaga ku'muwi'la Mose ati', “Hangi', u'lav'ezye Ihema Isondo ku' miki'ngo iku'mi zya katani nsoga i'yo yi'pelegilwe, na zya wu'zi wa langi ya bululu, zambalawo na yazaa. Miki'ngo zyeni'zyo u'lazityane ku' wu'tonto ku' kolwa masu'mbano ga v'akelubi. <verse eid="EXO 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 26:2" />Ki'la muki'ngo gu'lav'e na wu'lihu wa mita iku'mi na iv'i'li', na wu'gali'nhu wago mita iv'i'li'. Miki'ngo zyeni'zyo zyose zilav'e zya ki'pimo ki'mo. <verse eid="EXO 26:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 26:3" />U'lalu'ngye ku' ku'suma miki'ngo itano ziv'e muki'ngo gu'mo, na miki'ngo zingi' itano ziv'e muki'ngo gwa wu'v'i'li'. <verse eid="EXO 26:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 26:4" />U'lasumi'le ngovyo zya langi ya bululu ku' ipi'ndo lya muki'ngo gwa kwandya, na vyene vivyo u'lasumi'le ngovyo zingi' ku' ipi'ndo lya muki'ngo gwa wu'v'i'li'. <verse eid="EXO 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 26:5" />U'lav'ezye ngovyo maku'mi atano ku' ipi'ndo lya muki'ngo gu'mo, na ngovyo maku'mi atano zingi' ku' ipi'ndo lya muki'ngo gwa wu'v'i'li', nazyo ngovyo zyose zilinge. <verse eid="EXO 26:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 26:6" />Hangi' u'lav'ezye visikizo maku'mi atano vya zahabu, ki'gele vilu'ngi'zye i'zyo miki'ngo iv'i'li', na ku'ziv'ezya ziv'e ki'ntu' ki'mo ku'nguno ya ihema.<verse eid="EXO 26:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 26:7" />“U'lav'ezye nfundi' ya ihema ku' miki'ngo iku'mi na gu'mo zya wu'yenze wa mbu'li. <verse eid="EXO 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 26:8" />Ki'la muki'ngo gu'lav'e na wu'lihu wa mita iku'mi na idatu', na wu'gali'nhu mita iv'i'li'. Miki'ngo zyose iku'mi na gu'mo zilav'e na ki'pimo ki'mo. <verse eid="EXO 26:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 26:9" />U'lazilu'ngye ku' ku'suma miki'ngo itano ziv'e muki'ngo gu'mo, na i'zyo miki'ngo zingi' mukaga ziv'e muki'ngo gu'mo. Ali'vi muki'ngo gwa mukaga u'lagu'gonde kamo ha mbele ya ihema. <verse eid="EXO 26:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 26:10" />Hangi' u'lav'ezye ngovyo maku'mi atano ku' ipi'ndo lya muki'ngo gu'mo, na ngovyo maku'mi atano ku' ipi'ndo lya muki'ngo gwa wu'v'i'li'. <verse eid="EXO 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 26:11" />U'lav'ezye visikizo maku'mi atano vya shaba, na ku'vingi'zya mu i'zyo ngovyo, ki'gele ku'yi'lu'ngya nfundi' ya ihema yi'v'e ki'ntu' ki'mo. <verse eid="EXO 26:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 26:12" />Ki'pande cha muki'ngo i'cho ki'li'sigali'la ki'lenene ku' lwandi' lwa ku' mupi'ndo gwa ihema, na nusu ya muki'ngo gwa ku' mpelo yi'lasyelembe ha nsi'. <verse eid="EXO 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 26:13" />Ki'pande ki'ngi' ki'lenene mu mbazu zya ihema na ki'lagu'v'i'te muki'ngo gwa mugati' nusu mita, ki'gele ku'li'kumbi'la mpaka ha nsi'. <verse eid="EXO 26:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 26:14" />U'lav'ezye nfundi' ya ihema ku' ndi'li' zya ng'ondi i'zyo ziv'ililwe langi yazaa, na ha igu'lya yayo u'lav'ezye nfundi' yi'ngi' ya ndi'li' zya ndimu zingi' zya mu nyanza.<verse eid="EXO 26:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 26:15" />“U'lav'ezye felemu ku'tu'mi'la mbawo zya mugu'nga zya ku'ki'ndi'ki'la ihema. <verse eid="EXO 26:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 26:16" />Ki'la felemu yi'lav'e na mbawo iv'i'li' zya wu'lihu wa mita ine, na wu'gali'nhu wa maba sentimita maku'mi mukaga na mukaga. <verse eid="EXO 26:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 26:17" />Ki'la lu'bawo lu'v'e na lu'li'mi lu'mo lwa ku'sopeka ku' kikali'lo. Felemu zyose zya ihema u'laziv'ezezye ndi'mi iv'i'li' iv'i'li'. <verse eid="EXO 26:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 26:18" />U'lav'ezye felemu maku'mi av'i'li' ku' lwandi' lwa dakama lwa ihema, <verse eid="EXO 26:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 26:19" />na vikali'lo maku'mi ane vya mawe ga feza vya ku'tu'u'la ha nsi'li'li' na zyeni'zyo felemu maku'mi av'i'li'. Ki'la felemu yi'v'e na vikali'lo viv'i'li', ki'gele zidimi'li'le i'zyo ndi'mi zyayo iv'i'li'. <verse eid="EXO 26:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 26:20" />Hangi' u'lav'ezye felemu zingi' maku'mi av'i'li' ku'nguno ya lwandi' lwa sukuma lwa ihema, <verse eid="EXO 26:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 26:21" />na vikali'lo vyazyo maku'mi ane vya mawe ga feza. Ki'la felemu yi'v'e na vikali'lo viv'i'li'. <verse eid="EXO 26:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 26:22" />U'lav'ezye felemu mukaga ku'nguno ya lwandi' lwa ku' mupi'ndo gwa ihema, u'go gu'li' ku' mweli. <verse eid="EXO 26:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 26:23" />Hangi' u'lav'ezye felemu zingi' iv'i'li' ku'nguno ya vituzi vya ihema ku' lwandi' lwalyo lwa ku' mupi'ndo. <verse eid="EXO 26:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 26:24" />Ku' vituzi vyeni'vyo viv'i'li' felemu zyeni'zyo zilaki'ndi'kwe yi'mo yi'mo ku' ki'la ki'tuzi kwandi'zya ha nsi' mpaka ku' igu'lya, na ki'la felemu yi'ladimwe na pete ku' ki'tuzi ku' igu'lya. Felemu zyeni'zyo iv'i'li' ziv'eziwe vyene vivyo ki'gele ziv'ezye vituzi viv'i'li'. <verse eid="EXO 26:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 26:25" />Ku'nguno yeni'yo ziv'eho felemu munane ku' mupi'ndo gwa ihema, na vikali'lo iku'mi na mukaga zya mawe ga feza. Ki'la felemu yi'v'e na vikali'lo viv'i'li'.<verse eid="EXO 26:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 26:26" />“U'lav'ezye ngito zya muti' gwa mugu'nga: ngito itano ku'nguno ya felemu zya lwandi' lu'mo lwa ihema, <verse eid="EXO 26:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 26:27" />ngito itano ku'nguno ya lwandi' lwa wu'v'i'li', na ngito itano ku'nguno ya felemu zya lwandi' lwa ku' mupi'ndo gwa ihema, u'lo lu'li' ku' mweli. <verse eid="EXO 26:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 26:28" />Mugati' nazyo, lu'gito lu'mo lu'lav'i'te hagati' na felemu ku'fuma ku' mpelo yi'mo mpaka ku' mpelo yi'ngi'. <verse eid="EXO 26:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 26:29" />Felemu zyose u'lazikumbi'le zahabu na ku'ziv'ezezya pete zya zahabu i'zyo ziladimi'li'le ngito zyeni'zyo. Hangi' na ngito u'lazikumbi'le zahabu. <verse eid="EXO 26:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 26:30" />U'lali'v'ezye Ihema Isondo lyeni'lo ku'gelani'la na wikole u'wo naku'lagi'lile ku' lu'gu'lu'.<verse eid="EXO 26:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 26:31" />“Hangi' u'lagu'v'ezye muki'ngo gwa mugati' ku' wu'zi wa langi ya bululu, zambalawo na yazaa, na katani nsoga i'yo yi'pelegilwe. Muki'ngo gwenu'go gu'lafuumwe ku' wu'tonto na kolwa masu'mbano ga v'akelubi. <verse eid="EXO 26:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 26:32" />Hangi' u'lagwenenie muki'ngo ku' nhi'ngi' ine zya mugu'nga i'zyo zikumbi'lilwe zahabu, i'zyo zili' na nkontozyo zya zahabu, na vikali'lo vine vya mawe ga feza. <verse eid="EXO 26:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 26:33" />U'lagwenenie muki'ngo gwenu'go ha nsi'li'li' na visikizo zya muki'ngo gwa ku' igu'lya, na ku'tu'u'la isandi'ko lya wu'sangi'lwa ku' mupi'ndo na muki'ngo. Muki'ngo gwenu'go gu'lahakome Hantu' Hasondo na Hantu' Hasondo Muno. <verse eid="EXO 26:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 26:34" />Mugati' na Hantu' Hasondo Muno u'latu'u'le i'yo nfundi' ya wu'swanano ha igu'lya na isandi'ko lya wu'sangi'lwa. <verse eid="EXO 26:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 26:35" />I'yo meza ya mugu'nga u'layi'tu'u'le lwandi' lwa ha ibala lwa muki'ngo gwenu'go mu sukuma, na i'cho ki'nala cha ku'tu'u'li'la tala u'laki'tu'u'le ki'v'e lwandi' lwa dakama matanda na meza yeni'yo.<verse eid="EXO 26:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="EXO 26:36" />“Ku'nguno ya wingi'li'lo wa ihema u'lav'ezye muki'ngo ku' wu'zi wa langi ya bululu, zambalawo na yazaa, na katani nsoga i'yo yi'pelegilwe, na ku'pu'ndwa visoga. <verse eid="EXO 26:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="EXO 26:37" />Hangi' u'lav'ezye nhi'ngi' itano zya mugu'nga ku'nguno ya gwenu'go muki'ngo, u'lazikumbi'le zahabu na ku'ziv'ezezya nkontozyo zya zahabu. Hangi' u'sule vikali'lo vitano vya shaba ku'nguno yazyo.”<verse eid="EXO 26:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="EXO 27" />
  <para style="s">Ihozezyo lya ku'zigi'zya vitaambo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 38:1-7">Ku'fuma 38:1-7</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 27:1" />Gu'ku' Mulungu wendeleyaga ku'muwi'la Mose ati', “U'lazyenge ihozezyo ku' mbawo zya muti' gwa mugu'nga. Ihozezyo lyeni'lo li'lav'e lya mugelani'lo, wu'lihu walyo na wu'gali'nhu walyo mita iv'i'li' na lobo, na wi'i'ma walyo mita yi'mo na lobo. <verse eid="EXO 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 27:2" />U'lali'v'ezye li'v'e lya mapembe ane mu mapembo galyo ane ki'gele gav'e ki'ntu' ki'mo na ihozezyo lyeni'ki'li'. Ihozezyo lyose u'lali'kumbi'le shaba. <verse eid="EXO 27:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 27:3" />U'lav'ezye vilwani'lo vyalyo vyose ku' shaba: mafuli'la ga ku'sini'zya matunde, mayolelo ga ku'kokotela ha ihozezyo, mabakuli, wuma zya ku'timi'la nyama na sahani zya ku'lapu'li'la moto. <verse eid="EXO 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 27:4" />Hangi' u'lav'ezye wavu wa shaba u'wo wu'li' na pete ine zya shaba, ku' ki'la ipembo pete yi'mo. <verse eid="EXO 27:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 27:5" />Wavu wenu'wo u'lawu'tu'u'le ha nsi'li'li' na leli ya ihozezyo, ki'gele wu'fike hagati' ya ihozezyo. <verse eid="EXO 27:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 27:6" />U'lav'ezye miti' zya mugu'nga zya ku'li'sombela ihozezyo na ku'zikumbi'la shaba. <verse eid="EXO 27:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 27:7" />Miti' zyeni'zyo zilaswekwe mu i'zyo pete zya mu mbazu zya lyeni'lo ihozezyo aho li'li'sombwa. <verse eid="EXO 27:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 27:8" />U'lav'ezye ihozezyo li'v'e na nkululi mugati' ku' ku'tu'mi'la mbawo. U'lali'v'ezye ki'ti' i'vyo walagi'lilwe ku' lu'gu'lu'.”<verse eid="EXO 27:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lu'gu'tu' lwa Ihema Isondo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 38:9-20">Ku'fuma 38:9-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 27:9" />Gu'ku' Mulungu wendeleyaga ku'yomba ati', “U'lav'ezye lu'gu'tu' ku'nguno ya Ihema Isondo. Lwandi' lwa ku' dakama ku'lav'e na miki'ngo i'zyo zilav'eziwe ku' katani nsoga i'yo yi'pelegilwe. Miki'ngo zyeni'zyo zilav'e na wu'lihu wa mita maku'mi ane na ine, <verse eid="EXO 27:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 27:10" />haki'mo na nhi'ngi' maku'mi av'i'li' na vikali'lo vya shaba maku'mi av'i'li'. Nkontozyo zya nhi'ngi' zyeni'zyo haki'mo na pete zya ku'zwi'ka nhi'ngi' zilav'e zya mawe ga feza. <verse eid="EXO 27:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 27:11" />Vyene vivyo na lwandi' lwa ku' sukuma, wu'lihu wa miki'ngo wu'lav'e mita maku'mi ane na ine, na nhi'ngi' zyazyo maku'mi av'i'li' na vikali'lo vyazyo maku'mi av'i'li' vya shaba. Hangi' nkontozyo zya nhi'ngi' na pete zya ku'zwi'ka nhi'ngi' zilav'e zya mawe ga feza. <verse eid="EXO 27:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 27:12" />Lwandi' lwa ku' mweli lu'lav'e na miki'ngo zya wu'lihu wa mita maku'mi av'i'li' na iv'i'li', na nhi'ngi' zyazyo iku'mi na vikali'lo vyazyo iku'mi. <verse eid="EXO 27:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 27:13" />Lwandi' lwa ku' ki'ya, u'ko ku'li' na wingi'li'lo, lu'gu'tu' lu'lav'e na wu'gali'nhu wa mita maku'mi av'i'li' na iv'i'li'. <verse eid="EXO 27:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 27:14" />Miki'ngo zya ku' lwandi' lu'mo lwa wingi'li'lo zilav'e na wu'lihu wa mita mukaga na nusu, haki'mo na nhi'ngi' idatu' na vikali'lo vyazyo vidatu'. <verse eid="EXO 27:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 27:15" />Vyene vivyo ku' lwandi' lwa wu'v'i'li', miki'ngo zilav'e na wu'lihu wa mita mukaga na nusu, haki'mo na nhi'ngi' idatu' na vikali'lo vyazyo vidatu'. <verse eid="EXO 27:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 27:16" />Wingi'li'lo weni'ki'li' wa lu'gu'tu' wu'lav'e na muki'ngo gwa wu'lihu wa mita kenda, u'go gu'v'eziv'ilwe ku' wu'zi wa langi ya bululu, zambalawo na yazaa, na katani nsoga i'yo yi'pelegilwe, na ku'pu'ndwa visoga. Muki'ngo gwenu'go gu'leneniwe ku' nhi'ngi' ine i'zyo zili' na vikali'lo vine. <verse eid="EXO 27:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 27:17" />Nhi'ngi' zyose zya lu'gu'tu' zilazwi'kwe pete zya mawe ga feza, na nkontozyo zyazyo zilav'eziwe ku' mawe ga feza. Sumbwa vikali'lo vyazyo vilav'e vya shaba. <verse eid="EXO 27:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 27:18" />Lu'gu'tu' lwenu'lo lu'lav'e na wu'lihu wa mita maku'mi ane na ine, wu'gali'nhu mita maku'mi av'i'li' na iv'i'li', na wi'i'ma walo mita iv'i'li' na lobo. Miki'ngo zyalo zilav'e zya katani nsoga i'yo yi'pelegilwe na vikali'lo vya shaba. <verse eid="EXO 27:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 27:19" />Vilwani'lo vyose vya Ihema Isondo vya ku'tu'mi'la ki'la muli'mo, haki'mo na mmambo zyalyo zyose na i'zyo zya lu'gu'tu' zilav'e zya shaba.<verse eid="EXO 27:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Maguta ku'nguno ya tala</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LEV 24:1-4">V'alawi 24:1-4</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 27:20" />“Nanho u'lafumye ilagi'li'zyo ku' V'aizilaeli v'aku'letele maguta masoga ga muzeituni ku'nguno ya tala, ki'gele ku'v'eho na tala i'yo yi'li'v'aka nsiku' zyose. <verse eid="EXO 27:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 27:21" />Mugati' na Ihema lyene li'lo lya Ku'sangi'zya, ha ibala na muki'ngo, u'go gu'li' ha mbele ya isandi'ko lya wu'sangi'lwa, Aloni haki'mo na v'ana v'akwe v'a ki'gosya v'alav'e v'ali'yi'su'nga tala ha mbele yanne ku'fuma mpi'ndi' mpaka ndiyu'. Yeni'yi' yi'ku'v'a nhama ya nhananhana ku' V'aizilaeli v'ose na wu'v'yalwa wav'o u'wo wu'lalonde.”<verse eid="EXO 27:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="EXO 28" />
  <para style="s">Vizwalo vya ki'hozya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 39:1-31">Ku'fuma 39:1-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 28:1" />Hangi' Gu'ku' Mulungu wendeleyaga ku'muwi'la Mose ati', “Mugati' na V'aizilaeli, u'mulete ku' wanne Aloni, muku'lu'yo, haki'mo na v'ana v'akwe v'a ki'gosya Nadabu, Abihu, Eleazali, na Itamali, ki'gele v'antu'mami'le muli'mo gwa wu'hozya. <verse eid="EXO 28:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 28:2" />U'lamusumi'le muku'lu'yo Aloni vizwalo visondo ki'gele apandi'ke lu'kumo na wu'soga. <verse eid="EXO 28:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 28:3" />U'v'awi'le v'afundi v'ose av'o nav'apile loho ya wu'manyi, v'amusumi'le Aloni vizwalo ki'gele asondohiwe ku'nguno ya muli'mo gwa wu'hozya. <verse eid="EXO 28:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 28:4" />I'vi hu' vizwalo i'vyo v'alasume: kamufuko ka ha ki'kuv'a, ki'zibao, ijoho, nhanzo ya wu'lembwe, isimangi'la na mukwato gwa mu muki'mbi'li'. Vyeni'vyo vizwalo visondo vilasumwe ku'nguno ya ku'zwala mudu'gu'yo Aloni haki'mo na v'ana v'akwe, ki'gele v'antu'mami'le muli'mo gwa wu'hozya. <verse eid="EXO 28:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 28:5" />V'enav'o v'afundi u'v'awi'le v'atu'mi'le zahabu, wu'zi wa langi ya bululu, zambalawo, na yazaa, haki'mo na katani nsoga.<verse eid="EXO 28:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 28:6" />“Hangi' v'av'ezye ki'zibao ku' wu'zi wa zahabu na wa langi ya bululu, zambalawo na yazaa, haki'mo na katani nsoga i'yo yi'pelegilwe, na ku'fuumwa ku' wu'tonto. <verse eid="EXO 28:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 28:7" />Ki'zibao cheni'cho ki'lav'e na mikwato iv'i'li' zya ku'tungi'la mu mav'ega, ki'la iv'ega mukwato gu'mo u'go gu'sumi'lilwe ku' nsoto. <verse eid="EXO 28:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 28:8" />Mukwato gwa ki'zibao gwa wu'lembwe gwa ku'tunga mu muki'mbi'li' gu'lav'eziwe ku' vilwani'lo vyene vivyo, ku' wu'zi wa zahabu, na wa langi ya bululu, zambalawo na yazaa, haki'mo na katani nsoga i'yo yi'pelegilwe, gu'lasumi'li'lwe gu'v'e ki'ntu' ki'mo na ki'zibao cheni'cho.<verse eid="EXO 28:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 28:9" />“Hangi' u'lasole mawe av'i'li' ga mupango ga shohamu, na ha igu'lya yago u'latone mina ga v'ana v'a ki'gosya v'amwa Izilaeli. <verse eid="EXO 28:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 28:10" />U'latone mina mukaga ku' iwe lya kwandya, na mina mukaga gangi' ku' iwe lya wu'v'i'li'. Mina genago gize gahelwe ku'londana na ku'v'yalwa kwav'o. <verse eid="EXO 28:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 28:11" />U'lagatone mina genago ga v'ana v'amwa Izilaeli ha igu'lya na mawe genago av'i'li', ki'ti' i'vyo musuli i'vyo ali'gu'tonaga muhuli. Hangi' u'lagatu'u'le mu vyokazyo vya zahabu vya wu'lembwe. <verse eid="EXO 28:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 28:12" />Mawe genago ago gali' mu vyokazyo u'lagatunge ha igu'lya na mikwato zya mu mav'ega ga i'cho ki'zibao, ki'gele gav'e mwizu' ku' V'aizilaeli. Nawe Aloni alagazwale mina genago ku' mav'ega gakwe ha mbele yanne ene Gu'ku' Mulungu ki'ti' mwizu'. <verse eid="EXO 28:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 28:13" />U'lav'ezye vyokazyo vyeni'vyo viv'i'li' vya zahabu, <verse eid="EXO 28:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 28:14" />na mikufu iv'i'li' zya zahabu nsoso i'zyo zipelegilwe ki'ti' lu'goye, na u'zitunge mikufu zyeni'zyo ku' vyokazyo.<verse eid="EXO 28:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 28:15" />“U'lav'ezye kamufuko ka ha ki'kuv'a ku'nguno ya ku'koov'ela wu'yangu' wa v'antu' ku'mwa Mulungu. Kav'eziwe ku' wu'tonto ku' wu'zi wa zahabu, na wa langi ya bululu, zambalawo na yazaa, na katani nsoga i'yo yi'pelegilwe, ki'ti' i'cho ki'zibao. <verse eid="EXO 28:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 28:16" />Kalav'e ka mugelani'lo ako kalagondwe kav'e na wu'lihu na wu'gali'nhu wako sentimita maku'mi av'i'li' na iv'i'li'. <verse eid="EXO 28:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 28:17" />Kamufuko kenako kalalembwe ku' mihelo ine zya mawe ga mupango. Muhelo gwa kwandya gu'v'e na mawe ga akiki, topazi na bahalamani. <verse eid="EXO 28:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 28:18" />Muhelo gwa wu'v'i'li' gu'v'e na mawe ga zumalidi, yakuti na alimasi. <verse eid="EXO 28:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 28:19" />Muhelo gwa wu'datu' gu'v'e na mawe ga yasinto, ageti na ametisito. <verse eid="EXO 28:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 28:20" />Muhelo gwa wu'ne gu'v'e na mawe ga kilisolito, shohamu na yasipi. Gose gatu'u'lwe mu vyokazyo vya zahabu vya wu'lembwe. <verse eid="EXO 28:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 28:21" />Hohene ku'lav'e na mawe iku'mi na av'i'li', ago gatonilwe mina iku'mi na av'i'li' ga v'ana v'amwa Izilaeli. Ki'la li'mo li'tonwe ki'ti' muhuli ki'gele li'v'e na lina li'mo mugati' na mina ga magongo ago iku'mi na av'i'li'.<verse eid="EXO 28:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 28:22" />“U'lav'ezye mikufu zya zahabu nsoso i'zyo zipelegilwe ki'ti' lu'goye, ku'nguno ya kamufuko ka ha ki'kuv'a. <verse eid="EXO 28:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 28:23" />Vyene vivyo u'lav'ezye pete iv'i'li' zya zahabu ku'nguno ya kamufuko, na ku'zitungi'la ku' mapembo av'i'li' ga ku' igu'lya na kamufuko kenako. <verse eid="EXO 28:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 28:24" />U'lazitunge nsoto iv'i'li' zya mikufu ku' pete zyeni'zyo i'zyo zili' ku' mapembo ga kamufuko kenako. <verse eid="EXO 28:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 28:25" />Hangi' na i'zyo nsoto zingi' zya mikufu u'lazitunge ku' i'vyo vyokazyo viv'i'li' vya mawe. Vyene vivyo u'lazitungani'zye ku' mikwato zya mu mav'ega ga i'cho ki'zibao ku' lwandi' lwa ku' mbele. <verse eid="EXO 28:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 28:26" />U'lav'ezye pete iv'i'li' zya zahabu, na ku'zitu'u'la mu mapembo av'i'li' ga ha nsi'li'li' na kamufuko ku' nnuma yako bi'hi' na ki'zibao. <verse eid="EXO 28:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 28:27" />U'lav'ezye pete zingi' iv'i'li' zya zahabu, na u'zidimani'zye ha lwandi' lwa ha nsi'li'li' ya mikwato zya mav'ega, ha lwandi' lwa ku' mbele lwa cheni'cho ki'zibao, bi'hi' na ipi'ndo ha igu'lya hadoo na mukwato gwa mu muki'mbi'li'. <verse eid="EXO 28:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 28:28" />Pete zya kamufuko kenako zilatungani'ziwe na pete zya ki'zibao ku' lu'goye lwa langi ya bululu, ki'gele kaleke ku'soka na kikali'le mukwato gwa wu'lembwe gwa mu muki'mbi'li'.<verse eid="EXO 28:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 28:29" />“Itungo i'lo Aloni alav'e ali'wingi'la Hantu' Hasondo, alazwalage kamufuko ka ha ki'kuv'a ku'nguno ya ku'v'ezezya wu'yangu' ako kali' na mina ga v'ana v'amwa Izilaeli, ku'v'a mwizu' ku' matungo gose ha mbele yanne ene Gu'ku' Mulungu. <verse eid="EXO 28:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 28:30" />Hangi' mu kamufuko kenako u'latu'u'le Ulimu na Sumimu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">28:30 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mihayo Ulimu na Sumimu yi'li'wigelisya ku'v'a gav'age mawe masondo ago muhozya wagatu'u'lage mu kamufuko. Ku' itungo li'mo v'ahozya v'agatu'mi'lage ku'manya wu'yangu' wamwa Mulungu.</char></note> viv'e ha igu'lya na ki'kuv'a gwamwa Aloni. Nsiku' zyose aho Aloni alav'e ali'wingi'la ha mbele yamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu, vintu' vyeni'vyo alavisombe ha igu'lya na ki'kuv'a gwakwe. I'vi hu' vyene alakowole ku'fumya wu'yangu' ku' V'aizilaeli ha mbele yanne.<verse eid="EXO 28:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 28:31" />“Hangi' u'lasume ijoho lya ku'zwali'la ki'zibao ku' ki'tambala cha langi ya bululu. <verse eid="EXO 28:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 28:32" />Hagati' u'ladu'le idu'lu'lu' lya ku'v'i'ti'zya mutwe. Ha lwandi' lwa nhingo u'lahapilimye ki'tambala i'cho ki'fuumilwe ki'gele ku'du' li'tandu'ke. <verse eid="EXO 28:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 28:33" />Ku' wu'pi'nde walyo wa ha nsi'li'li' ku'pilima lwandi' lose yi'lalembwe ku' masu'mbano ga makomamanga ga langi ya bululu, zambalawo na yazaa. Hagati' na ki'la ikomamanga ku'v'e na muyi'mba gwa zahabu. <verse eid="EXO 28:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 28:34" />Zyeni'zyo miyi'mba zya zahabu na makomamanga zilihele ku'li'pilima ipi'ndo lya ijoho lyeni'lo: ikomamanga, muyi'mba, ikomamanga, muyi'mba. <verse eid="EXO 28:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 28:35" />Aloni alazwale ijoho lyeni'lo aho alav'e ali'tu'mama muli'mo gwa wu'hozya, na muzwi gwa zyeni'zyo miyi'mba mulagwigwe aho ali'wingi'la Hantu' Hasondo ha mbele yanne na aho ali'fuma, ki'gele aleke ku'fwa.<verse eid="EXO 28:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="EXO 28:36" />“Hangi' u'lav'ezye ndezi ya zahabu nsoso, na ku'yi'tona ha igu'lya yayo, ki'ti' i'vyo gu'li'tonagwa muhuli, ‘MUSONDO KU'MWA GU'KU' MULUNGU.’ <verse eid="EXO 28:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="EXO 28:37" />Ndezi yeni'yo u'layi'tunge ha igu'lya na isimangi'la ku' lwandi' lwa ku' mbele ku' lu'goye lwa langi ya bululu. <verse eid="EXO 28:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="EXO 28:38" />Aloni alayi'zwalage ndezi yeni'yo ha wu'syu' wakwe ku' matungo gose aho alav'e ali'v'ezya muli'mo gwa wu'hozya, na alasombage musango gwa V'aizilaeli u'go v'akowolile ku'v'a v'ahu'v'ile ku' ku'nfumi'zya vitaambo visondo, nanne ndavizumyage vitaambo vyav'o. <verse eid="EXO 28:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="EXO 28:39" />U'lamufuumi'le Aloni nhanzo ku' katani nsoga, na u'muv'ezezye isimangi'la ku' katani nsoga na mukwato gwa wu'pu'ndwe gwa mu muki'mbi'li'.<verse eid="EXO 28:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="EXO 28:40" />“U'lav'asumi'le v'ana v'amwa Aloni nhanzo, mikwato zya mu muki'mbi'li' na nkofila, ki'gele v'apandi'ke lu'kumo na wu'soga.<verse eid="EXO 28:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="EXO 28:41" />“Aho u'lav'e wav'azwi'ka Aloni, muku'lu'yo, haki'mo na v'ana v'akwe vizwalo vyeni'vyo, u'lav'av'ile maguta na ku'v'asondohya na ku'v'asimi'ka, ki'gele v'antu'mami'le muli'mo gwa wu'hozya. <verse eid="EXO 28:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="EXO 28:42" />Vyene vivyo u'lav'asumi'le vizwalo vya mugati' vya katani, i'vyo vilav'akumbi'le ki'la yu'mo ku'fuma mu muki'mbi'li' mpaka mu matango, ki'gele v'iku'v'i'le miv'i'li' zyav'o. <verse eid="EXO 28:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="EXO 28:43" />Aloni na v'ana v'akwe yi'lav'adime ku'vizwala ki'la aho v'alav'e v'ali'wingi'la mu Ihema lya Ku'sangi'zya, ninga aho v'alav'e v'ali'lyegela ihozezyo lya vitaambo itungo lya muli'mo gwa wu'hozya ha lu'gu'tu' lwa Ihema Isondo, ki'gele v'ize v'aleke ku'pu'v'ya v'afwe. Yeni'yi' yi'v'e nhama ya nhananhana ku'mwa Aloni na wu'v'yalwa wakwe.”<verse eid="EXO 28:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 28" />
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="EXO 29" />
  <para style="s">Milagi' zya ku'v'asimi'ka v'ahozya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LEV 8:1-36">V'alawi 8:1-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 29:1" />Hangi' Gu'ku' Mulungu wamuwi'laga Mose ati', “I'li' hu' igambo i'lo u'lav'av'ezezye Aloni na v'ana v'akwe v'a ki'gosya ku' ku'v'asondohya ki'gele v'antu'mami'le ku' muli'mo gwa wu'hozya: U'lasole ng'ombe nzagamba yi'mo na ng'ondi iv'i'li' i'zyo zili' wu'du'hu' wu'lema, <verse eid="EXO 29:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 29:2" />haki'mo na migate zya mikoli idatu' i'zyo zikatumba: migate i'zyo zikaseleganiwa maguta, migate zya wu'seleganiwe na maguta ga muzeituni na migate milelemazu zya wu'v'ilwe maguta. Zyose zyeni'zyo ziv'e ziv'eziv'ilwe ku' wu'fuma wu'nelezu wa ngano. <verse eid="EXO 29:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 29:3" />Nanho u'lazitu'u'le zyeni'zyo migate mu ki'sege ki'mo, na ku'nfumi'zya haki'mo na i'zyo ng'ombe nzagamba na ng'ondi iv'i'li'.<verse eid="EXO 29:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 29:4" />“Hangi' u'lamulete Aloni haki'mo na v'ana v'akwe bi'hi' na wingi'li'lo wa Ihema lya Ku'sangi'zya, na ku'v'akusa ku' minzi'. <verse eid="EXO 29:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 29:5" />U'lasole vizwalo i'vyo vya ki'hozya na ku'muzwi'ka Aloni nhanzo, ijoho lya ku'zwali'la ki'zibao, ki'zibao, kamufuko ka ha ki'kuv'a, na ku'mutunga mukwato gwa ki'zibao gwa wu'lembwe mu muki'mbi'li'. <verse eid="EXO 29:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 29:6" />Hangi' u'lamutunge isimangi'la ku' mutwe, na ku'tunga ndezi nsondo ha igu'lya na lyeni'lo isimangi'la ku' lwandi' lwa ku' mbele. <verse eid="EXO 29:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 29:7" />Aho u'lav'e wamali'la ku'v'ezya vyeni'vyo, u'lasole ago maguta ga ku'v'ila, u'mwiti'li'le Aloni ku' mutwe gwakwe na ku'musondohya. <verse eid="EXO 29:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 29:8" />Hangi' u'lav'alete v'ana v'amwa Aloni, na u'v'azwi'ke nhanzo. <verse eid="EXO 29:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 29:9" />U'lav'atunge mikwato mu miki'mbi'li' na ku'v'azwi'ka nkofila zyav'o. Aloni haki'mo na v'ana v'akwe v'av'e v'ahozya ku' nhama ya nhananhana. I'vi hu' vyene u'lav'asimi'ke ku' muli'mo gwa wu'hozya.<verse eid="EXO 29:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 29:10" />“Hangi' u'layi'lete i'yo ng'ombe ha mbele ya Ihema lya Ku'sangi'zya. Aloni na v'ana v'akwe v'alatu'u'le makono gav'o ha igu'lya na mutwe gwa ng'ombe yeni'yo. <verse eid="EXO 29:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 29:11" />Haho u'layi'si'nze ha mbele yamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu, bi'hi' na wingi'li'lo wa Ihema lya Ku'sangi'zya. <verse eid="EXO 29:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 29:12" />U'lasole lwandi' lwa magazi ga ng'ombe yeni'yo na u'v'ile ku' mapembe ga ihozezyo lyeni'lo ku' lyala lyako, na magazi ago galasigali'le u'lagiti'le ha lwandi' lwa ha nsi'li'li' ya ihozezyo. <verse eid="EXO 29:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 29:13" />Hangi' u'lasole lu'sasa lose na lwandi' lu'soga lwa iti'ma, haki'mo na nfigo iv'i'li' na maguta gazyo, u'lavitime vyose ha igu'lya na ihozezyo. <verse eid="EXO 29:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 29:14" />Ali'vi nyama ya ng'ombe yeni'yo, haki'mo na ndi'li' na wu'se wayo, u'lavisole na ku'vitima ha ibala na nkambi' yinywe. Cheni'cho ki'lav'e ki'taambo cha ku'sini'zya wu'kenagu'zi.<verse eid="EXO 29:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 29:15" />“Hangi' u'lasole ng'ondi yi'mo mugati' na i'zyo ng'ondi, na Aloni haki'mo na v'ana v'akwe v'alatu'u'le makono gav'o ha igu'lya na mutwe gwayo. <verse eid="EXO 29:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 29:16" />U'layi'si'nze ng'ondi yeni'yo, na u'lasole magazi gayo na ku'ganyanyagi'la ku' ki'la lwandi' lwa ihozezyo lyeni'lo. <verse eid="EXO 29:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 29:17" />Hangi' u'layi'tambagu'zye yeni'yo ng'ondi mamonke mamonke, na u'kuse wu'la haki'mo na magu'lu' na vikono vyayo, u'vitu'u'le vyose haki'mo na mutwe na viv'alango vingi'. <verse eid="EXO 29:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 29:18" />Nanho u'lavizigye vyeni'vyo viv'alango vyose vya ng'ondi yeni'yo ha igu'lya na ihozezyo ku'v'a ki'taambo cha ku'zigya ku'mwa Gu'ku' Mulungu. Kenako kali' kalu'mbi'lo ka ku'zigya ako kali' na wu'motu wa ku'mutogezya Gu'ku' Mulungu.<verse eid="EXO 29:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 29:19" />“Hangi' u'layi'sole i'yo ng'ondi ya wu'v'i'li', na Aloni haki'mo na v'ana v'akwe v'alatu'u'le makono gav'o ha igu'lya na mutwe gwayo. <verse eid="EXO 29:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 29:20" />Haho u'layi'si'nze, na ku'sola magazi madoo na ku'gav'ila ku' nsoto zya matwi ga mulyi'la gamwa Aloni haki'mo na v'ana v'akwe, na ku' mankumwa ga makono gav'o ga mulyi'la, na ku' mankumwa ga magu'lu' gav'o ga mulyi'la. Magazi ago galasigali'le u'laganyanyagi'le ku' ki'la lwandi' lwa ihozezyo. <verse eid="EXO 29:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 29:21" />Hangi' u'lasole lwandi' lwa magazi ago gali' ha igu'lya na ihozezyo haki'mo na ago maguta ga ku'v'ila, na u'lamunyanyagi'le Aloni na vizwalo vyakwe. Hangi' u'lav'anyanyagi'le v'ana v'akwe haki'mo na vizwalo vyav'o. Haho Aloni haki'mo na v'ana v'akwe v'alav'e v'asondo ku' wanne, haki'mo na vizwalo vyav'o vyose.<verse eid="EXO 29:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 29:22" />“Hangi' u'lasole maguta ga i'yo ng'ondi: muki'la gwayo haki'mo na maguta gago, lu'sasa, lwandi' lu'soga lwa iti'ma, nfigo iv'i'li' na maguta gazyo, haki'mo na itango lya ku' mulyi'la. Ku'nguno ng'ondi yeni'yo yi'li' ya ku'v'asimi'ki'la ku' muli'mo gwa wu'hozya. <verse eid="EXO 29:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 29:23" />U'lasole na migate i'zyo zikatumba. Ku'fuma ku' ki'sege i'cho ki'li' ha mbele yamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu u'lasole mugate gu'mo u'go gu'kaseleganiwa na maguta, na mugate gu'mo gwa wu'seleganiwe na maguta ga muzeituni, na mugate mulelemazu gu'mo. <verse eid="EXO 29:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 29:24" />Vyose vyeni'vi u'lavitu'u'le mu makono gamwa Aloni haki'mo na v'ana v'akwe, nav'o v'alaviwu'sye viv'e lu'manyi'lo lwa ku'nfumi'zya kalu'mbi'lo ene Gu'ku' Mulungu. <verse eid="EXO 29:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 29:25" />Hangi' u'lavisole vintu' vyeni'vyo ku'fuma mu makono gav'o, na ku'vizigya ha igu'lya na ihozezyo haki'mo na i'yo ng'ondi ya ki'taambo cha mbele. Kenako kali' kalu'mbi'lo ka ku'zigya ako kali' na wu'motu wa ku'mutogezya Gu'ku' Mulungu.<verse eid="EXO 29:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 29:26" />“Hangi' u'lasole ki'dali cha yeni'yo ng'ondi ya ku'musimi'ki'la Aloni, na ku'ki'wu'sya ki'v'e lu'manyi'lo lwa ku'nfumi'zya kalu'mbi'lo ene Gu'ku' Mulungu. Nacho ki'lav'e ifungu lyako. <verse eid="EXO 29:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 29:27" />Nanho u'visondohye ki'dali i'cho chawu'siv'agwa na itango i'lo lyafumiv'agwa lya yeni'yo ng'ondi ya ku'v'asimi'ki'la, na vyeni'vyo vilav'e vyamwa Aloni na v'ana v'akwe. <verse eid="EXO 29:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 29:28" />Nsiku' zyose yi'lav'e nhama ku' V'aizilaeli ku'fumya ifungu lyeni'li' ku'fuma ku' vitaambo vya kwiswanania ku'nguno yamwa Aloni na v'ana v'akwe. Ifungu lyeni'li' li'lav'e kalu'mbi'lo kav'o ku'mwa Gu'ku' Mulungu.<verse eid="EXO 29:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 29:29" />“Aho alav'e wagulala Aloni, vizwalo vyakwe visondo v'alapiwe v'av'yalwa v'akwe, nav'o v'alavizwale lu'siku' lwav'o lwa ku'v'ilwa maguta na ku'simi'kwa ku' muli'mo gwa wu'hozya. <verse eid="EXO 29:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 29:30" />Mwana wamwa Aloni u'yo alav'e muhozya ha lwandi' lwamwa ise, na kwingi'la mu Ihema lya Ku'sangi'zya ku'tu'mama ha Hantu' Hasondo, alavizwale vizwalo vyeni'vyo nsiku' mupungati'. <verse eid="EXO 29:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 29:31" />Nanho u'layi'sole nyama ya yeni'yo ng'ondi ya ku'v'asimi'ki'la, na ku'yi'tekela mugati' na lu'gu'tu' lwa Ihema Isondo. <verse eid="EXO 29:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 29:32" />Aloni na v'ana v'akwe v'alayi'lye i'yo nyama ya ng'ondi, na migate i'zyo zili' mu ki'sege aho ha mbele ya wingi'li'lo wa Ihema lya Ku'sangi'zya. <verse eid="EXO 29:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 29:33" />V'alavilye vintu' vyeni'vyo i'vyo vitu'mamile ku' wu'swanano itungo lya ku'v'asimi'ka na ku'v'asondohya ku'nguno ya muli'mo gwa wu'hozya. Ali'vi muntu' yu'ngi' ku'du' avilye ku'nguno vili' visondo. <verse eid="EXO 29:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 29:34" />U'lu' yav'a nyama ninga yi'mo ya yeni'yo ng'ondi i'yo yatu'mamile ku' ku'v'asimi'ki'la ninga mugate gu'mo i'vyo vilasigali'le mpaka ndiyu', vilatimwe. I'vyo vyasigali'lile vikasye viliwe ku'nguno vili' vintu' visondo.<verse eid="EXO 29:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 29:35" />“Vyeni'vyo hu' i'vyo u'lav'av'ezezye Aloni na v'ana v'akwe, ku'londana na gose ago naku'lagi'li'zizye. U'ladime itungo lya nsiku' mupungati' zya ku'v'asimi'ka ku' muli'mo gwa wu'hozya. <verse eid="EXO 29:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="EXO 29:36" />Ki'la lu'siku' u'lav'e u'li'fumya ng'ombe nzagamba yi'v'e ki'taambo cha ku'sini'zya wu'kenagu'zi, ki'gele ku'v'ezya wu'swanano. Ku' ku'v'ezya vyeni'vyo u'lali'sondohye ihozezyo, na ku'li'v'ila maguta ki'gele li'v'e isondo. <verse eid="EXO 29:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="EXO 29:37" />Ku' nsiku' mupungati' u'lali'v'ezezye wu'swanano ihozezyo na ku'li'sondohya. Ku'nguno yeni'yo, ihozezyo li'lav'e isondo muno, na ki'la ki'ntu' i'cho ki'lali'kuumye ki'lav'e ki'sondo.<verse eid="EXO 29:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ki'taambo cha ki'la lu'siku'</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="NUM 28:1-8">Lu'v'alo 28:1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="EXO 29:38" />“Hohene ki'taambo i'cho u'lav'e u'li'fumya ha igu'lya na ihozezyo ki'la lu'siku' ki'lav'e i'vi: tu'di'lana tu'v'i'li' twa nkolo u'to tu'li' na musimo gwa mwaka gu'mo. <verse eid="EXO 29:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="EXO 29:39" />Kadi'lana kamo u'lakafumye ki'taambo ndiyu', na kangi' mpi'ndi'. <verse eid="EXO 29:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="EXO 29:40" />Haki'mo na kadi'lana ka kwandya, u'lafumye kilo yi'mo ya wu'fuma wu'nelezu u'wo wu'seleganiv'ilwe na nsu'pa yi'mo ya maguta masoga, na ku'pu'ngu'li'la nsu'pa yi'mo ya ki'neneko ku'v'a kalu'mbi'lo. <verse eid="EXO 29:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="EXO 29:41" />Kenako kadi'lana kangi' u'lakafumye ki'taambo ha itungo lya mpi'ndi', haki'mo na kalu'mbi'lo ka mbutoo na ka ki'neneko, ki'ti' i'vyo wav'ezyaga ndiyu'. Kenako kali' kalu'mbi'lo ka ku'zigya ako kali' na wu'motu wa ku'mutogezya Gu'ku' Mulungu. <verse eid="EXO 29:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="EXO 29:42" />Ku' wu'v'yalwa u'wo wu'lalonde yi'lav'e ki'ti'le ku'fumya ki'taambo cheni'chi' cha ku'zigya bi'hi' na wingi'li'lo wa Ihema lya Ku'sangi'zya ha mbele yanne, ene Gu'ku' Mulungu, aho ndav'e nu'poma na inywe na ku'yomba na inywe. <verse eid="EXO 29:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="EXO 29:43" />Henanho haho ndav'e nu'poma na V'aizilaeli, na lu'kumo lwanne lu'lahav'ezye hose hav'e hasondo. <verse eid="EXO 29:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="EXO 29:44" />Nanne ndali'sondohye Ihema lya Ku'sangi'zya haki'mo na ihozezyo, nanne ndamusondohye Aloni haki'mo na v'ana v'akwe, ki'gele v'antu'mami'le ene ku' muli'mo gwa wu'hozya. <verse eid="EXO 29:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="EXO 29:45" />Ndav'ezye wikalo mugati' na V'aizilaeli, na ku'v'a Mulungu wav'o. <verse eid="EXO 29:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="EXO 29:46" />Nav'o v'alamanye ku'v'a ene hu' ni' Gu'ku' Mulungu, Mulungu wav'o, u'yo wav'afumizye ku' Misili ki'gele mbezye wikalo mugati' nav'o. Ene hu' ni' Gu'ku' Mulungu, Mulungu wav'o.”<verse eid="EXO 29:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 29" />
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="EXO 30" />
  <para style="s">Ihozezyo lya ku'zuki'zi'zya wu'vumba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 37:25-28">Ku'fuma 37:25-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 30:1" />Gu'ku' Mulungu wendeleyaga ku'muwi'la Mose ati', “U'lav'ezye ihozezyo li'ngi' lya ku'zuki'zi'zya wu'bani ku' mbawo zya mugu'nga. <verse eid="EXO 30:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 30:2" />Ihozezyo lyeni'lo li'v'e lya mugelani'lo, wu'lihu na wu'gali'nhu walyo sentimita maku'mi ane na itano, na wi'i'ma walyo sentimita maku'mi kenda. U'lali'v'ezye li'v'e na mapembe ga mu igu'lya ki'gele gav'e ki'ntu' ki'mo na ihozezyo lyeni'lo. <verse eid="EXO 30:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 30:3" />U'lali'kumbi'le lyeni'lo ihozezyo ku' igu'lya na mu mbazu zyalyo haki'mo na mapembe galyo ku' zahabu nsoso, na u'lali'v'ezezye lu'ki'go lwa zahabu lu'li'pilime. <verse eid="EXO 30:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 30:4" />Hangi' u'lav'ezye pete iv'i'li' zya zahabu na ku'zitu'u'la ha nsi'li'li' na lu'ki'go mu mbazu zyalyo, ku' ki'la lwandi' pete yi'mo yi'mo, ku'nguno ya ku'dimi'li'la miti' itungo lya ku'li'somba. <verse eid="EXO 30:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 30:5" />U'lav'ezye miti' iv'i'li' zya mugu'nga na ku'zikumbi'la zahabu. <verse eid="EXO 30:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 30:6" />Ihozezyo lyeni'lo u'lali'tu'u'le ha mbele ya muki'ngo gwa mugati' u'go gu'li' ha mbele ya isandi'ko lya wu'sangi'lwa na nfundi' ya wu'swanano, aho ndav'age nu'sangi'zya nanho. <verse eid="EXO 30:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 30:7" />Ki'la lu'siku' ndiyu' aho Aloni alav'e ali'zisu'nga tala i'zyo zili'ho henanho, alazuki'zye wu'bani wu'motu ha igu'lya na ihozezyo lyeni'lo. <verse eid="EXO 30:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 30:8" />Hangi' alazuki'zye wu'bani ha itungo lya mpi'ndi' aho ali'v'asya tala. Kwisenga kwenu'ku' ha mbele yanne ku'lav'e kwa matungo gose ku' wu'v'yalwa winywe wose. <verse eid="EXO 30:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 30:9" />Ha ihozezyo lyeni'lo, muzilo, ku'du' mwize muzuki'zye wu'bani u'wo wu'kav'ile wu'sondo, ninga ku'fumya ki'taambo cha ku'zigya, ninga kalu'mbi'lo ka mbutoo, ninga ku'pu'ngu'li'la ha igu'lya yalyo kalu'mbi'lo ka ki'neneko. <verse eid="EXO 30:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 30:10" />Aloni yi'lamudime ku'v'ezya wu'swanano ha igu'lya na mapembe ga ihozezyo lyeni'lo kamo ku' ki'la mwaka. Alav'ezye wu'swanano ku' magazi ga ki'taambo cha ku'sini'zya wu'kenagu'zi kamo ku' ki'la mwaka, ku' wu'v'yalwa winywe wose. Ihozezyo lyeni'lo li'li' isondo muno ku' wanne ene Gu'ku' Mulungu.”<verse eid="EXO 30:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kalu'mbi'lo ka wu'swanano</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 30:11" />Gu'ku' Mulungu wamuwi'laga Mose, <verse eid="EXO 30:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 30:12" />“Ki'la aho u'lav'e u'li'v'asolozya V'aizilaeli, ki'la mugosya alali'pe mpenzi ku'nguno ya wu'panga wakwe ha mbele yanne, ki'gele ku'du' ku'v'e na ki'gu'mo mugati' nav'o ha itungo lya ku'v'asolozya. <verse eid="EXO 30:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 30:13" />Ki'la yu'mo u'yo alasoloziwe yi'lamudime ali'pe ki'pimo cha feza gilamu mukaga<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">30:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Gilamu mukaga ku' Ki'ebulania yi'li' nusu shekeli. Hangi' Ki'ebulania ki'li'yomba shekeli yi'mo yi'gelani'lile na gela maku'mi av'i'li'.</char></note>, ku'londana na vipimo i'vyo vitu'u'lilwe ha hantu' hasondo. Kenaka hu' kalu'mbi'lo kakwe ako alanfumi'zye. <verse eid="EXO 30:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 30:14" />Ki'la muntu' u'yo alasoloziwe, ku'lamuli'la wa musimo gwa myaka maku'mi av'i'li' na kwendeleya, alanfumi'zye kalu'mbi'lo kenako ene Gu'ku' Mulungu. <verse eid="EXO 30:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 30:15" />Musav'i ku'du' ize afumye nyingi ku'ki'la ki'pimo cheni'cho cha feza gilamu mukaga, ninga mupi'na ku'du' ize afumye ndoo i'zyo zikafika ki'pimo cheni'cho cha feza. Mulav'e muli'fumya kalu'mbi'lo kenako ki'gele muv'ezye wu'swanano ku'nguno ya wu'panga winywe. <verse eid="EXO 30:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 30:16" />Nanho u'lapokele feza zyeni'zyo zya wu'swanano ku' V'aizilaeli, na u'lazitu'mi'le ku' mili'mo zya Ihema lya Ku'sangi'zya, nago gu'v'e mwizu' ku' V'aizilaeli ha mbele yanne, mpenzi ya wu'panga winywe.”<verse eid="EXO 30:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ikalaye lya shaba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 30:17" />Gu'ku' Mulungu wamuwi'laga Mose ati', <verse eid="EXO 30:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 30:18" />“U'lav'ezye ikalaye lya shaba lya kwikusi'la i'lo li'li' na kikali'lo cha shaba. Ikalaye lyeni'lo u'li'tu'u'le hagati' ya Ihema lya Ku'sangi'zya na ihozezyo lya ku'zigi'zya vitaambo, na u'li'ti'ti'li'le minzi' mugati' yalyo, <verse eid="EXO 30:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 30:19" />ki'gele Aloni na v'ana v'akwe v'akusi'le makono gav'o na magu'lu' gav'o mwenu'mo. <verse eid="EXO 30:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 30:20" />Itungo i'lo v'alav'e mbe v'ali'wingi'la mu Ihema lya Ku'sangi'zya, ninga aho v'alav'e mbe v'ali'wegela ha ihozezyo ki'gele v'atu'mame ku' ku'leta kalu'mbi'lo ka ku'zigya ku'mwa Gu'ku' Mulungu, v'alikusage minzi' ki'gele ku'du' v'afwe. <verse eid="EXO 30:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 30:21" />Yi'lav'adime ku'kusa makono gav'o na magu'lu' gav'o ki'gele ku'du' v'afwe. Yeni'yi' yi'lav'e nhama ya nhananhana ku'mwa Aloni na wu'v'yalwa wakwe, haki'mo na wu'v'yalwa u'wo wu'lalonde ku' wav'o.”<verse eid="EXO 30:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Maguta ga ku'v'ila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 30:22" />Gu'ku' Mulungu wamuwi'laga Mose ati', <verse eid="EXO 30:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 30:23" />“U'lasole visanjo i'vi visoga: wisu'lyu' wa manemane mbi'si' kilo mukaga, mudalasini mumotu kilo idatu', maguv'a mamotu kilo idatu', <verse eid="EXO 30:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 30:24" />haki'mo na mudalasini u'go gu'ngi' kilo mukaga. Vipimo vyose vyeni'vyo vilapimwe ku'londana na vipimo i'vyo vitu'u'lilwe ha hantu' hasondo. Hangi' u'lasole maguta ga muzeituni nsu'pa ine. <verse eid="EXO 30:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 30:25" />U'laviv'ezye visanjo vyeni'vyo viv'e maguta masondo ga ku'v'ila ga wu'motu wu'soga u'wo wu'seleganiv'ilwe ku' wu'tonto. Genago galatu'mame muli'mo gwa ku'sondohezya. <verse eid="EXO 30:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 30:26" />Hangi' u'lav'ile maguta genago ku' Ihema lya Ku'sangi'zya, isandi'ko lya wu'sangi'lwa, <verse eid="EXO 30:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 30:27" />meza na vilwani'lo vyayo vyose, ki'nala cha ku'tu'u'li'la tala na vilwani'lo vyacho, ihozezyo lya ku'zuki'zi'zya wu'bani, <verse eid="EXO 30:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 30:28" />ihozezyo lya ku'zigi'zya vitaambo na vilwani'lo vyalyo vyose, na ikalaye haki'mo na kikali'lo chalyo. <verse eid="EXO 30:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 30:29" />U'lavisondohye ki'gele viv'e visondo muno, na ki'la i'cho ki'lavikuumye ki'lav'e ki'sondo. <verse eid="EXO 30:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 30:30" />Hangi' ev'e u'lav'av'ile maguta Aloni haki'mo na v'ana v'akwe na ku'v'asondohya, ki'gele v'antu'mami'le ku' muli'mo gwa wu'hozya. <verse eid="EXO 30:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 30:31" />U'lav'awi'le V'aizilaeli ati', ‘Aga gaku'v'a maguta ganne masondo ga ku'v'ila ku' wu'v'yalwa winywe wose. <verse eid="EXO 30:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 30:32" />Ku'du' mwize mugapu'ngu'li'le ha igu'lya na miv'i'li' zya v'antu', ninga ku'du' mwize muv'ezye maguta gangi' ga wikole na genaga. Maguta genaga gali' masondo na yi'lamudime mugawone ku'v'a gali' masondo. <verse eid="EXO 30:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 30:33" />Muntu' u'yo alav'ezye maguta ki'ti' genaga, ninga ku'muv'ila muntu' u'yo akav'ile muhozya, yi'lamudime muntu' mwenu'yo akomwe ku'le na iv'ilingano lya V'aizilaeli.’ ”<verse eid="EXO 30:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wu'vumba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 30:34" />Hangi' Gu'ku' Mulungu wamuwi'laga Mose ati', “U'lasole visanjo vya wu'motu wu'soga i'vi: wisu'lyu' wa natafi, shekeleti, kelibena na wu'vumba wu'soga. Vyose vyeni'vi viv'e na ki'pimo ki'mo. <verse eid="EXO 30:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 30:35" />U'laseleganie vintu' vyeni'vi ku'v'ezya wu'bani wu'motu ku' muli'mo gwa mumanyi u'yo ali'v'ezyaga vintu' vya wu'motu. Wu'lati'ti'lwe munyu ki'gele wu'v'e wu'soga na wu'sondo. <verse eid="EXO 30:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="EXO 30:36" />Hangi' mugati' na wenu'wo u'sole wu'ngi' u'wu'sye na ku'wu'v'ezya wu'fuma wu'nelezu, ki'gele wu'tu'u'lwe mu Ihema lya Ku'sangi'zya ha mbele ya isandi'ko lya wu'sangi'lwa, aho ndasangi'zyage nanho. Wenu'wo wu'lav'e wu'vumba wu'sondo muno ku' winywe. <verse eid="EXO 30:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="EXO 30:37" />Muzilo, ku'du' mwize muv'ezye wu'bani wa ku'selegania ki'ti' wenu'wo ku' ku'tu'mi'la inywe v'eni'ki'li', ku'nguno wu'vumba wenu'wo muwu'wone ku'v'a wu'li' wu'sondo ku'nguno yanne.” <verse eid="EXO 30:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="EXO 30:38" />Muntu' u'yo aliv'ezezye wu'vumba ki'ti' wenu'wo, na ku'wu'tu'mi'la mweni'ki'li' ku' wu'motu wawo, yi'lamudime muntu' mwenu'yo akomwe ku'le na iv'ilingano lya V'aizilaeli.<verse eid="EXO 30:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 30" />
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="EXO 31" />
  <para style="s">V'afundi v'a ihema v'ali'wokaziwa loho ya wu'manyi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 35:30-36:1">Ku'fuma 35:30-36:1</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 31:1" />Gu'ku' Mulungu wamuwi'laga Mose ati', <verse eid="EXO 31:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 31:2" />“Lingaga, ene namusogolaga Bezaleli, mwana wamwa Uli, mwizu'ku'lu' wamwa Huli, wa igongo lya Yuda, <verse eid="EXO 31:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 31:3" />na ku'mokazya Loho ya Mulungu. Namupaga wu'tonto, wu'kowozi, masala, na wu'manyi wa ku'v'ezya ki'la muli'mo, <verse eid="EXO 31:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 31:4" />ki'gele iganike ki'v'ezezye cha mili'mo zya ku'sula mawe ga feza, zahabu na shaba, <verse eid="EXO 31:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 31:5" />ku'pu'nza mawe ga ku'tu'u'la mu vyokazyo, na ku'pu'nza magogo, zyose zyeni'zi ku'nguno ya mili'mo zyose zya wu'manyi. <verse eid="EXO 31:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 31:6" />Hangi' namusogolaga Oholiabu, mwana wamwa Ahisamaki, wa igongo lya Dani, atu'mame haki'mo nawe. Vyene vivyo nav'apaga wu'manyi v'afundi v'angi' ku'nguno ya mili'mo hekeheke, ki'gele v'av'ezye vintu' vyose i'vyo nalagi'li'zizye viv'eziwe: <verse eid="EXO 31:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 31:7" />Ihema lya Ku'sangi'zya, haki'mo na vilwani'lo vyalyo vyose, isandi'ko lya wu'sangi'lwa na nfundi' yalyo, <verse eid="EXO 31:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 31:8" />meza na vilwani'lo vyayo, ki'nala cha ku'tu'u'li'la tala cha zahabu nsoso na vilwani'lo vyacho, ihozezyo lya ku'zuki'zi'zya wu'bani, <verse eid="EXO 31:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 31:9" />ihozezyo lya ku'zigi'zya vitaambo na vilwani'lo vyalyo vyose, ikalaye haki'mo na kikali'lo chalyo, <verse eid="EXO 31:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 31:10" />haki'mo na vizwalo visondo i'vyo vifuumilwe visoga vya muhozya Aloni, na vizwalo vya v'ana v'akwe, av'o v'alav'ezye muli'mo gwa wu'hozya, <verse eid="EXO 31:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 31:11" />hangi' na maguta ga ku'v'ila na wu'bani wu'motu ku'nguno ya Hantu' Hasondo. Vintu' vyeni'vyo vyose viv'eziwe ku'gelani'la na i'vyo naku'lagi'li'zizye.”<verse eid="EXO 31:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lu'siku' lwa ku'suuha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 31:12" />Hangi' Gu'ku' Mulungu wamuwi'laga Mose ati', <verse eid="EXO 31:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 31:13" />“U'v'awi'le V'aizilaeli i'vi: Yi'li'mudima inywe mulu'dime lu'siku' lwa ki'suuho u'lo lu'li' Sabato yanne, yaani, ku'nguno lwenu'lo lu'lav'e hu' lu'manyi'lo mugati' yinywe nanne, ku' wu'v'yalwa winywe wose, ku'v'a ene hu' ni' Gu'ku' Mulungu u'yo nu'musondohya. <verse eid="EXO 31:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 31:14" />Mulalu'dime lu'siku' lwenu'lo lwa ki'suuho, ku'nguno lu'li' lu'sondo ku' winywe. Ki'la muntu' u'yo alalu'v'ezezye zoma lu'siku' lwenu'lo yi'lamudime ku'wu'lagwa. Muntu' u'yo alatu'mame muli'mo ninga gu'mo lu'siku' lwenu'lo alakomwe ku'le na v'antu' v'akwe. <verse eid="EXO 31:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 31:15" />Ku' itungo lya nsiku' mukaga mulav'e muli'tu'mama, ali'vi lu'siku' lwa mupungati' lu'li' lu'siku' lwa ku'suuha ku' winywe. Lu'li' Sabato nsondo ku'mwa Gu'ku' Mulungu. Muntu' u'yo alatu'mame lu'siku' lwenu'lo yi'lamudime ku'wu'lagwa. <verse eid="EXO 31:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 31:16" />Ku'nguno yeni'yo V'aizilaeli v'alalu'dime lu'siku' lwa ki'suuho na ku'londa nzi'la yayo ku' wu'v'yalwa wav'o wose, ku'v'a ilagano lya nhananhana. <verse eid="EXO 31:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 31:17" />Igambo lyeni'li' li'lav'e lu'manyi'lo lwa nhananhana hagati' yanne na V'aizilaeli, ku'nguno ku' nsiku' mukaga ene Gu'ku' Mulungu natundaga ilunde na li'welelo, na lu'siku' lwa mupungati' nkatu'mamile, nasuuhaga.”<verse eid="EXO 31:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 31:18" />Yav'aga Gu'ku' Mulungu aho wamali'laga ku'yomba na Mose ku' lu'gu'lu' lwa Sinai, haho wamupaga Mose mav'ale av'i'li' ga mawe ga wu'sangi'lwa, ago gatonilwe ku' lyala lyamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu mweni'ki'li'.<verse eid="EXO 31:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 31" />
  <chapter number="32" style="c" sid="EXO 32" />
  <para style="s">Ki'mbulimbuli cha ndama cha zahabu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="DEU 9:6-29">Mwizu' 9:6-29</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 32:1" />V'antu' aho ndi' v'awona ku'v'a Mose wakendela ku'su'v'a ku'fuma ku' lu'gu'lu', hohene v'ikumingaga ha mbele yamwa Aloni na ku'muwi'la ati', “Haya! Ku'v'ezezye mulungu u'go gu'ku'ku'londola. Ku'nguno mwenu'yo Mose u'yo waku'fumizye ku' nsi' ya Misili, ku'kamanya igambo i'lo lyamupandi'kile.” <verse eid="EXO 32:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 32:2" />Aloni wasu'v'yaga ati', “Muzule vipini vya zahabu mu matwi i'vyo v'azwalile v'aki' v'inywe na v'ana v'inywe v'a ki'gosya na v'a ki'ki'ma, mundetele.” <verse eid="EXO 32:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 32:3" />Hohene, v'antu' v'ose v'avisiniaga vipini vyose vya zahabu mu matwi gav'o, na ku'muletela Aloni. <verse eid="EXO 32:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 32:4" />Nawe wavisolaga, wavisulaga, na wav'ezyaga ki'mbulimbuli cha wikole na ndama ngosya ku' ku'fyatu'la mu ki'seme. Nav'o v'aliiniaga mizwi zyav'o na ku'yomba ati', “Ev'e Izilaeli, u'yu' hu' mulungu winywe, u'yo wamufumizye ku' nsi' ya Misili.”<figure style="fig" file="cn01920.jpg" size="col" ref="32:4">Ki'mbulimbuli cha ndama cha zahabu</figure><verse eid="EXO 32:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 32:5" />Hangi' Aloni wazyengaga ihozezyo ha mbele na ki'mbulimbuli cha ndama na ku'tangazya: “Igolo ku'lav'e na mwanya ku'nguno yamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu.” <verse eid="EXO 32:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 32:6" />Wangalu'ke v'antu' v'ipunaga ndiyu', v'afumyaga vitaambo vya ku'zigya na vitaambo vya kwiswanania. V'antu' v'ikalaga ha nsi', v'alyaga na ku'nywa, hangi' v'i'maga na ku'v'ezya mwanya ku' lu'soko. <verse eid="EXO 32:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 32:7" />Haho Gu'ku' Mulungu wamuwi'laga Mose, “Sooka wangu', ku'nguno v'antu' v'ako av'o wav'afumizye ku' nsi' ya Misili, v'av'ezyaga mav'i. <verse eid="EXO 32:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 32:8" />V'angu'haga muno ku'yi'leka nzi'la i'yo nafumizye ilagi'li'zyo v'ayi'londe. V'iv'ezezyaga ki'mbulimbuli cha ndama ngosya ya ku'fyatu'la mu ki'seme, nav'o v'akisengaga na v'aki'fumi'zyaga vitaambo na ku'yomba ati', ‘Ev'e Izilaeli, u'yu' hu' mulungu winywe, u'yo wamufumizye ku' nsi' ya Misili!’ ” <verse eid="EXO 32:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 32:9" />Hangi' Gu'ku' Mulungu wamuwi'laga Mose ati', “Nawonaga v'antu' v'enav'a v'ali' na myoyo milambu. <verse eid="EXO 32:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 32:10" />Gi'si' ndeke ki'gele ki'sila channe ki'panki'le ku' wav'o, nanne mbazimangu'zye. Ali'vi ev'e nku'ku'v'ezya ku'v'a nsi' nhanya.”<verse eid="EXO 32:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 32:11" />Ali'vi Mose wamwikongaga Gu'ku' Mulungu, Mulungu wakwe, na ku'yomba, “Ev'e Gu'ku' Mulungu, ku' ki' ki'sila chako ki'panki'le vidaki ku' v'antu' v'ako, av'o wav'afumizye ku' nsi' ya Misili ku' wu'kowozi wu'hanya na mukono gwa nguzu? <verse eid="EXO 32:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 32:12" />U'lu' u'v'ezye vyeni'vyo, nhana V'amisili v'aku'yomba ati', ‘Wav'afumizye ku' ndaka mbi ki'gele akav'awu'lagi'le ku' ngu'lu' na ku'v'azimangu'zya mu welelo.’ Ev'e Gu'ku' Mulungu, tunia ki'sila chako ki'daki, na u'li'leke igambo lyeni'li' i'lo walomaga ku'li'v'ezya ku' v'antu' v'ako. <verse eid="EXO 32:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 32:13" />U'v'izu'ki'le v'akumba v'ako, Abalahamu, Isaka na Izilaeli, av'o walahi'la ku' moyo gwako mweni'ki'li', na ku'yomba, ‘Ndawingi'hye wu'v'yalwa winywe ki'ti' nsonda zya mu ilunde, na nsi' yeni'yi' i'yo nu'mulagana ndawu'pe wu'v'yalwa winywe wu'yi'saale nhananhana.’ ” <verse eid="EXO 32:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 32:14" />Hohene, Gu'ku' Mulungu walekaga ku'v'av'ezezya v'antu' v'akwe igambo iv'i i'lo ndi' wayombaga. <verse eid="EXO 32:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 32:15" />Hangi' Mose wasookaga ku'fuma ku' lu'gu'lu' na ago mav'ale av'i'li' ga mawe ga wu'sangi'lwa mu makono gakwe. Gav'age gatonilwe ku' ki'la lwandi', ku' mbele na ku' nnuma. <verse eid="EXO 32:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 32:16" />Mav'ale genago ndi' muli'mo gwakwe Mulungu mweni'ki'li' na wu'tone wenu'wo ndi' watona Mulungu mweni'ki'li'. <verse eid="EXO 32:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 32:17" />Yoswa aho wigwa ibu'bu' lya v'antu', wamuwi'laga Mose, “Ku'li' na ibu'bu' lya wu'lu'gu' ku' nkambi'.” <verse eid="EXO 32:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 32:18" />Ali'vi Mose wasu'v'yaga ati', “Li'kav'ile ibu'bu' lya ku'kinda ninga lya ku'kindwa, sumbwa li'li' ibu'bu' lya v'antu' av'o v'ali'wi'mba.” <verse eid="EXO 32:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 32:19" />Mose aho wegelaga ha nkambi' na ku'yi'wona yeni'yo ndama na v'antu' v'ali'negu'la, ki'sila chakwe chapanki'laga, nawe wagatami'zyaga mawe ago gali' mu makono gakwe na ku'gav'elagu'la mav'ale mav'ale henanho ha nsi'li'li' na lu'gu'lu'.<figure style="fig" file="co00836.jpg" size="col" loc="Not on same page as previous picture" ref="32:19">Mose ali'v'elagu'la mawe ga nhama</figure> <verse eid="EXO 32:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 32:20" />Hohene wayi'solaga yeni'yo ndama na ku'yi'tima mu moto, wayi'syaga mpaka yav'aga wu'fuma, na wawu'seselaga wu'fuma wenu'wo mu minzi' na ku'v'asingi'li'zya V'aizilaeli v'anywe.<verse eid="EXO 32:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 32:21" />Mose wamuwu'zyaga Aloni, “V'aku'v'ezezyaga ki' v'antu' v'enav'a mpaka ku'v'ingi'zya mu wu'kenagu'zi wu'hanya vyeni'vyo?” <verse eid="EXO 32:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 32:22" />Aloni wasu'v'yaga, “Nu'ku'lomba, ev'e gu'ku' wanne, ki'sila chako ku'du' ki'panki'le ku' wanne. U'v'amanyile v'antu' v'enav'a i'vyo v'ali' v'abu'hu ku'v'ezya wu'kenagu'zi. <verse eid="EXO 32:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 32:23" />V'eni'ki'li' v'ambwi'lile ati', ‘Ku'v'ezezye mulungu u'go gu'ku'ku'londola, ku'nguno mwenu'yo Mose u'yo waku'fumizye ku' nsi' ya Misili, ku'kamanya igambo i'lo lyamupandi'kile’. <verse eid="EXO 32:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 32:24" />Haho nav'awi'laga, ‘Ki'la yu'mo u'yo azwalile ki'ntu' cha zahabu aki'zule.’ Hohene v'aviletaga, nanne navitagi'laga mu moto, haho yafumi'i'laga ndama yeni'yi'!” <verse eid="EXO 32:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 32:25" />Mose aho ndi' wawona ku'v'a v'antu' v'enav'a v'akatala na ku'v'ezya ki'ti' i'vyo v'atogilwe, ku'nguno Aloni wakav'alekani'zya v'atale na kwiletela nsoni ku' v'anisi v'av'o, <verse eid="EXO 32:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 32:26" />Haho Mose wi'maga ha wingi'li'lo wa nkambi' na ku'yomba, “Muntu' u'yo ali' ku' lwandi' lwamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu, ize ku' lwandi' lwanne.” V'alawi v'ose v'ikumingaga haki'mo ha mbele yakwe. <verse eid="EXO 32:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 32:27" />Nawe wav'awi'laga ati', “Gu'ku' Mulungu, Mulungu wa Izilaeli, ali'yomba i'vi: ‘Ki'la muntu' itunge lu'panga lwakwe mu muki'mbi'li', av'i'te ku'fuma wingi'li'lo wu'mo wa nkambi' mpaka wa wu'v'i'li' na ku'su'v'a, na ki'la yu'mo amuwu'lage mudu'gu'ye, munwaniye na muzenganwa wakwe.’ ” <verse eid="EXO 32:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 32:28" />Haho V'alawi v'av'ezyaga ki'ti' i'vyo Mose walagi'li'zyaga. Lu'siku' lwenu'lo ndi' v'awu'lagwa v'antu' ki'ti' vihu'mbi' vidatu'. <verse eid="EXO 32:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 32:29" />Hangi' Mose wayombaga ati', “Walelo mwasimi'kagwa ku'mwa Gu'ku' Mulungu, ku'nguno mukisisikile ku'v'awu'laga v'ana v'inywe ninga v'adu'gu' v'inywe. Mulungu wamudosyaga lu'v'ango walelo yeni'yi'.”<verse eid="EXO 32:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 32:30" />Wangalu'ke Mose wav'awi'laga v'antu', “Mwav'ezizye wu'kenagu'zi wu'hanya! Gi'si' nu'ya ku' igu'lya ku' lu'gu'lu', ku'mwa Gu'ku' Mulungu. Hamo nku'kowola ku'v'ezya wu'swanano ku'nguno ya wu'kenagu'zi winywe.” <verse eid="EXO 32:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 32:31" />Haho Mose wasu'v'aga ku'mwa Gu'ku' Mulungu na ku'muwi'la ati', “Nu'saya! V'antu' v'enav'a v'av'ezyaga wu'kenagu'zi wu'hanya. V'iv'ezezyaga mulungu gwa zahabu. <verse eid="EXO 32:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 32:32" />Ali'vi gi'si', nu'ku'lomba u'v'atondole wu'kenagu'zi wav'o. Mbe u'kav'atondolile, nu'kwikonga u'fute lina lyanne ku' ki'tabu chako i'cho u'v'atonile v'antu' v'ako.” <verse eid="EXO 32:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 32:33" />Nawe Gu'ku' Mulungu wasu'v'yaga ati', “Muntu' u'yo wakambezezya wu'kenagu'zi hu' mwene ndafute lina lyakwe mu ki'tabu channe. <verse eid="EXO 32:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 32:34" />Gi'si' u'kav'alondole v'antu' v'enav'a, u'ye mpaka ku' lwandi' u'lo naku'wi'lile. Lingaga, malaika wanne alaku'tongelele. Ninga vyeni'vyo, itungo aho li'lav'e lyafika ndav'ape lu'duko ku'nguno ya wu'kenagu'zi wav'o.”<verse eid="EXO 32:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 32:35" />Haho Gu'ku' Mulungu wav'agu'maga v'antu' v'enav'o ku' wu'lwile wa tauni, ku'nguno ya ku'v'ezya ndama i'yo v'alenga wayi'v'ezya Aloni.<verse eid="EXO 32:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 32" />
  <chapter number="33" style="c" sid="EXO 33" />
  <para style="s">Ilagi'li'zyo lya ku'wu'ka ku' Sinai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 33:1" />Hangi' Gu'ku' Mulungu wamuwi'laga Mose, “Wu'ka henanha, ev'e haki'mo na v'antu' av'o wav'afumizye ku' nsi' ya Misili, muye ku' nsi' i'yo nav'alagana Abalahamu, Isaka na Yakobo, aho ndi' nayomba, ‘Ndav'ape v'av'yalwa v'inywe nsi' yeni'yi'.’ <verse eid="EXO 33:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 33:2" />Ene ndamutu'me malaika amutongelele, nanne ndav'asage V'akanaani, V'aamoli, V'ahiti, V'apelizi, V'ahivi na V'ayebusi. <verse eid="EXO 33:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 33:3" />Yagi ku' nsi' ya lu'tongo i'yo yi'li'keneneka mav'eele na wu'ki'. Ali'vi ku'nguno inywe muli' na myoyo milambu, nkasye nje haki'mo na inywe, ku'du' nize muzimangu'zye mu nzi'la.”<verse eid="EXO 33:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 33:4" />V'antu' aho v'igagwa mmola yeni'yo mbi, v'ali'laga muno, hangi' ku'du'hu' muntu' ninga yu'mo u'yo wazwalaga wu'lembo wakwe. <verse eid="EXO 33:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 33:5" />V'av'ezyaga vyeni'vyo ku'nguno Gu'ku' Mulungu wasangwa wamuwi'laga Mose ati', “V'awi'le V'aizilaeli, ‘Inywe muli' v'antu' v'a myoyo milambu. U'lu' nje haki'mo na inywe ku' itungo ido du', nku'muzimangu'zya. Ku'nguno yeni'yo muzule wu'lembo winywe ki'gele manye lya ku'muv'ezezya.’ ” <verse eid="EXO 33:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 33:6" />Hohene, V'aizilaeli v'awu'zulaga wu'lembo wav'o, henanho ha lu'gu'lu' lwa Holebu na v'akazwalile hangi' ninga ku' mbele ya musi'nzo.<verse eid="EXO 33:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ihema lya Ku'sangi'zya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 33:7" />Nawe Mose wav'age na ki'ti'le cha ku'li'ki'ndi'ka ihema katanalo na nkambi'. Ihema lyeni'lo wali'paga lina, Ihema lya Ku'sangi'zya. Yav'age muntu' u'yo wakoov'age wu'yangu' ku'mwa Gu'ku' Mulungu, wayage ku' Ihema lya Ku'sangi'zya, i'lo lyav'age katanalo na nkambi'. <verse eid="EXO 33:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 33:8" />Hangi' Mose aho wav'age ali'fuma ku'ya ku' ihema lyeni'lo, v'antu' v'ose v'i'i'mage ha mizigo zya mahema gav'o, na ku'mulola Mose mpaka aho ali'wingi'la mugati' na ihema lyeni'lo. <verse eid="EXO 33:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 33:9" />Ha itungo i'lo Mose ali'wingi'la mu ihema lyeni'lo, i'lo ilunde li'li' ki'ti' nhi'ngi' lyasookage ha muzigo gwa ihema, haho Gu'ku' Mulungu wayombage na Mose. <verse eid="EXO 33:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 33:10" />V'antu' v'ose aho v'av'age mbe v'ali'wona i'lo ilunde li'li' ki'ti' nhi'ngi' ya ha muzigo gwa ihema, ki'la yu'mo waku'v'i'i'lage ha muzigo gwa ihema lyakwe. <verse eid="EXO 33:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 33:11" />I'vi hu' vyene Gu'ku' Mulungu wayombage na Mose ki'ti' minso ku' minso, yaani ki'ti' muntu' na munwaniye. Hangi' Mose wasu'v'age ku' nkambi', ali'vi musu'mbana Yoswa, mwana wamwa Nuni, u'yo wav'age mugwasya wakwe, ndi' akamufumaga mu ihema.<verse eid="EXO 33:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mose ali'lomba ku'wona lu'kumo lwamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 33:12" />Mose wamuwi'laga Gu'ku' Mulungu ati', “Lingaga! Ev'e u'li'mbwi'la, ‘V'alondole v'antu' v'enav'a,’ ali'vi u'kampile mmola ati', nde u'lamutu'me av'e haki'mo nanne. Ninga i'vyo wayombile ati', ‘Nku'manyile lina lyako, nanho wapandi'kile wu'soga ha mbele yanne.’ <verse eid="EXO 33:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 33:13" />Gi'si' nu'kwikonga, u'lu' napandi'kaga wu'soga ha mbele yako, u'ndagi'le nzi'la zyako, ki'gele mpandi'ke ku'ku'manya na kwendeleya ku'pandi'ka wu'soga ha mbele yako. Hangi' wizu'ki'le ku'v'a nsi' yeni'yi' v'ali' v'antu' v'ako.”<verse eid="EXO 33:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 33:14" />Haho Mulungu wasu'v'yaga ati', “Ene mweni'ki'li' nku'ya haki'mo nanho, na ku'ku'lembezya.” <verse eid="EXO 33:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 33:15" />Hangi' Mose wayombaga ati', “U'lu' u'kav'ile ku'ya haki'mo niswe, hohene, ku'du' u'ku'sinie henanha. <verse eid="EXO 33:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 33:16" />Ku'nguno yi'ku'manyi'ka vihe ku'v'a napandi'kaga wu'soga ha mbele yako, ene haki'mo na v'antu' v'ako? Sumbwa du' ku'nguno ya ev'e ku'ya haki'mo na iswe yi'ku'manyi'ka ku'v'a ene haki'mo na v'antu' v'ako ku'li' v'a heke mugati' na v'antu' v'ose mu welelo.”<verse eid="EXO 33:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 33:17" />Gu'ku' Mulungu wamuwi'laga Mose ati', “Nku'ku'v'ezezya igambo lyeni'li' i'lo walombaga, ku'nguno wapandi'kaga wu'soga ha mbele yanne, nanne nku'manyile lina lyako.” <verse eid="EXO 33:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 33:18" />Haho Mose wayombaga, “Nu'kwikonga u'ndagi'le lu'kumo lwako.” <verse eid="EXO 33:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 33:19" />Nawe Gu'ku' Mulungu wasu'v'yaga ati', “Nku'v'i'tya wu'soga wanne wose ha mbele yako, nanne nku'li'kumalu'sya lina lyanne, ‘Gu'ku' Mulungu.’ Ene ndamuwonele ki'sa u'yo ntogilwe ku'muwonela ki'sa, na ku'musayi'la u'yo ntogilwe ku'musayi'la. <verse eid="EXO 33:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 33:20" />Ali'vi u'kasye u'kowole ku'mbona wu'syu' wanne, ku'nguno ku'du'hu' muntu' u'yo akowolile ku'mbona nawe av'e muzuwu'ku.” <verse eid="EXO 33:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 33:21" />Hangi' Gu'ku' Mulungu wamuwi'laga Mose ati', “Lingaga, ku'li' na lwandi' lwa bi'hi' nanne u'lo ukwi'ma ha igu'lya na itale. <verse eid="EXO 33:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 33:22" />Lu'kumo lwanne aho lu'ku'v'a lu'li'v'i'ta, nku'ku'tu'u'la mu mpembo ha itale na nku'ku'kumbi'la na mukono gwanne, mpaka aho nku'v'a nav'i'ta. <verse eid="EXO 33:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 33:23" />Hangi' nku'gu'sinia mukono gwanne nanho u'ku'mbona ku' nnuma, ali'vi wu'syu' wanne u'ku'leka ku'wu'wona.”<verse eid="EXO 33:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 33" />
  <chapter number="34" style="c" sid="EXO 34" />
  <para style="s">Mav'ale mapya ga mawe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="DEU 10:1-5">Mwizu' 10:1-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 34:1" />Hangi' Gu'ku' Mulungu wamuwi'laga Mose ati', “U'pu'nze mav'ale av'i'li' ga mawe ki'ti' ago ga kwandya, nanne nku'gatona mihayo zyanne i'zyo ndi' zili' ku' mawe genago ga kwandya, ago wagav'elile. <verse eid="EXO 34:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 34:2" />Wiv'ange igolo ikingilima, wize u'pome nanne ku' nsoto ya lu'gu'lu' lwa Sinai. <verse eid="EXO 34:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 34:3" />Muntu' ninga yu'mo ku'du' ize haki'mo nanho, ninga ku'du' egele muntu' ninga yu'mo ku' igu'lya na lu'gu'lu'. Ninga ng'ombe, nkolo na mbu'li ku'du' zidi'mi'le mu ngiligili na lwenu'lo lu'gu'lu'.” <verse eid="EXO 34:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 34:4" />Hohene Mose wapu'nzaga mav'ale av'i'li' ga mawe ki'ti' ago ga kwandya. Wawu'kaga ikingilima, na waliinaga ku' lu'gu'lu' lwa Sinai, ku'no adimile genago mav'ale mu makono gakwe, ki'ti' i'vyo Gu'ku' Mulungu wakamulagi'li'zyaga. <verse eid="EXO 34:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 34:5" />Haho Gu'ku' Mulungu wasookaga mugati' na ilunde, wi'maga haki'mo na Mose, na ku'li'kumalu'sya lina lyakwe, “Gu'ku' Mulungu.” <verse eid="EXO 34:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 34:6" />Hangi' Gu'ku' Mulungu wav'i'taga ha mbele yamwa Mose na ku'tangazya, “Gu'ku' Mulungu, Gu'ku' Mulungu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">34:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lina “Gu'ku' Mulungu” ku' Ki'ebulania li'li' lina “Yahweh” ninga “Yehova.”</char></note>, ali' Mulungu wa ki'sa na ki'gongo. Akav'ile mubu'hu wa ki'sila ali'vi okalile chelu' na nhana. <verse eid="EXO 34:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 34:7" />Ene nu'lagi'la chelu' ku' wu'v'yalwa mahu'ya, na ku'v'atondola v'antu' ihu'v'yo, wu'kenagu'zi na wu'tale wav'o, ali'vi nkasye ndeke ku'muv'azi'zya ihu'v'yo muntu' wa musango. Nu'v'asali'kya v'ana na v'izu'ku'lu' wu'kenagu'zi wa v'asav'o na v'agu'ku' v'av'o, ninga wu'v'yalwa wa wu'datu' na wa wu'ne.”<verse eid="EXO 34:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 34:8" />Nawe Mose wangu'haga ku'kundamya mutwe na ku'ku'v'i'i'la. <verse eid="EXO 34:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 34:9" />Hangi' wayombaga, “Ev'e Gu'ku', u'lu' napandi'kaga wu'soga ha mbele yako, nu'ku'lomba u'ye haki'mo na iswe, ninga i'vi v'antu' v'enav'a v'ali' na myoyo milambu. Ali'vi u'ku'tondole ihu'v'yo na wu'kenagu'zi wiswe, na u'kwanuku'le ku'v'e isaalo lyako ev'e mweni'ki'li'.”<verse eid="EXO 34:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mulungu ali'v'ezya ilagano ipya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 23:14-19">Ku'fuma 23:14-19</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 7:1-5">Mwizu' 7:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 16:1-17">16:1-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 34:10" />Gu'ku' Mulungu wamuwi'laga ati', “Lingaga, nu'v'ezya ilagano na v'antu' v'ako v'ose. Nku'v'ezya migaka ha mbele yav'o i'zyo zikaali' ku'v'eziwa mu welelo yose, ninga mu ki'la nsi'. V'antu' v'ose av'o mwikalile mugati' nav'o v'alawone mili'mo zyanne mihanya, ku'nguno nku'v'ezya igambo lya ku'kumya ku'nguno yako.<verse eid="EXO 34:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 34:11" />“U'zidime milagi' i'zyo nu'ku'pa walelo. Lingaga, nku'v'asaga ha mbele yako V'aamoli, V'akanaani, V'ahiti, V'apelizi, V'ahivi na V'ayebusi. <verse eid="EXO 34:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 34:12" />Wiangali'le ku'du' wize u'v'ezye ilagano na v'ikazi v'a nsi' i'yo u'yile, ku'nguno lyeni'lo li'lav'e ki'ti' mutego ku' wako. <verse eid="EXO 34:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 34:13" />Ali'vi u'lagabomole mahozezyo gav'o, na ku'ziv'elanga nhi'ngi' zyav'o zya mawe zya kwisengela, na ku'gaputanga mavimbulimbuli ga miti' gamwa mulungu wav'o Ashela<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">34:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lina “Ashela” gwav'age mulungu gwa ki'ki'ma u'go v'agwisengage V'akanaani.</char></note>. <verse eid="EXO 34:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 34:14" />Ku'du' wize u'mwisenge mulungu yu'ngi', ku'nguno ene lina lyanne ni' ‘Wa Iwu'v'a,’ ni' Mulungu wa iwu'v'a. <verse eid="EXO 34:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 34:15" />Wiangali'le ku'du' wize u'v'ezye ilagano na v'ikazi v'a nsi' yeni'yo, ku'nguno aho v'alav'e v'ali'zisenga milungu zyav'o zya wu'fi na ku'zifumi'zya vitaambo, v'alaku'kaati'ke nanho u'lalye vitaambo i'vyo v'ali'wisengela milungu zyav'o. <verse eid="EXO 34:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 34:16" />U'lahambagale u'li'v'atozya v'asu'mbana v'ako ku' v'aniki' v'av'o, na v'enav'o v'aniki' aho v'alaye ku'kisenga milungu zyav'o zya wu'fi, v'alav'ahu'mbye v'asu'mbana v'ako ku'zisenga milungu zyav'o.<verse eid="EXO 34:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 34:17" />“Ku'du' wiv'ezezye milungu zya ku'sula ku' ku'fyatu'la mu ki'seme.<verse eid="EXO 34:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 34:18" />“Mudime nsiku' zya Mwanya gwa Migate I'zyo Zikatumba. Mulav'e muli'lya migate i'zyo zikatumba mugati' na nsiku' mupungati', ki'ti' i'vyo namulagi'li'zizye. Mulav'ezye vyeni'vyo ku' itungo i'lo li'tu'u'lilwe lya mwezi gwa Abibu, u'go gu'li' hu' mwezi gwa kwandya, ku'nguno mwezi gwenu'go hu' gwene mwafuma ku' nsi' ya Misili.<verse eid="EXO 34:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 34:19" />“Ki'la muv'yalwa wa mbele wa ki'gosya ali' wanne, haki'mo na ki'v'yalwa cha mbele cha ki'gosya cha mitugo zinywe zyose, ki'v'e cha ng'ombe, nkolo ninga mbu'li. <verse eid="EXO 34:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 34:20" />Sumbwa ki'v'yalwa cha mbele cha mpunda u'laki'komole ku' ku'li'pa kadi'lana, ali'vi u'yo akaanile ku'ki'komola, alaki'wu'lage lwa ku'ki'vuna nhingo yacho. Hangi' ki'la muv'yalwa wa mbele wa muntu' u'lamukomole. Muntu' ku'du' ize ha mbele yanne ali' makono du'.<verse eid="EXO 34:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 34:21" />“Ku' itungo lya nsiku' mukaga u'lav'e u'li'tu'mama mili'mo, ali'vi lu'siku' lwa mupungati' u'lav'e u'li'suuha, ninga yi'v'e itungo lya ili'ma ninga lyi'mbu'la.<verse eid="EXO 34:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 34:22" />“Mulav'ezye Mwanya gwa Mayuma ku' ku'fumya kalu'mbi'lo ka viliwa vya ntomolwa vya ngano, na Mwanya gwa Ku'kuminga ku' ndugo ya mwaka. <verse eid="EXO 34:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 34:23" />V'agosya v'ose v'alav'e v'ali'wikuminga kali' kadatu' ku' mwaka ha mbele yanne ene Gu'ku' Mulungu, Mulungu wa Izilaeli. <verse eid="EXO 34:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 34:24" />Ku'nguno ene ndagasage makabi'la gangi' ha mbele yinywe na ku'zigali'nhya mbi'mbi' zinywe. Ku'du'hu' muntu' u'yo alav'e ali'yigomelwa nsi' yinywe ku' itungo i'lo mulav'e muli'ya ku'kanisenga ene Gu'ku' Mulungu, Mulungu winywe, kali' kadatu' ku' ki'la mwaka.<verse eid="EXO 34:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 34:25" />“Ku'du' munfumi'zye magazi ga ki'taambo channe haki'mo na mugate u'go gu'tumbile, ninga ki'taambo cha Mwanya gwa Pasaka ku'du' ki'sigali'le mpaka ndiyu'.<verse eid="EXO 34:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 34:26" />“Hangi' ntomolwa ya ntangi'lo ya nsi' yako u'lav'e u'li'yi'leta mu nnumba yanne, ene Gu'ku' Mulungu, Mulungu wako.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EXO 34:26">“Ku'du' wize u'kasev'ye kadi'lana mu mav'eele gamwa nnina.” <verse eid="EXO 34:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 34:27" />Hangi' Gu'ku' Mulungu wamuwi'laga Mose ati', “U'tone mihayo zyeni'zi, ku'nguno ku'v'i'ti'la mihayo zyeni'zi nav'ezyaga ilagano nanho, na ku' V'aizilaeli.” <verse eid="EXO 34:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 34:28" />Itungo lyeni'lo Mose wav'age kwenu'ko ku' lu'gu'lu' haki'mo na Gu'ku' Mulungu nsiku' maku'mi ane, wu'ziku' na lyu'v'a, nawe akalile ki'liwa ninga ku'nywa minzi'. Hangi' wazitonaga mihayo zyeni'zyo zya ilagano, i'zyo nhama iku'mi, ku' mav'ale genago.<verse eid="EXO 34:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ku'kelema kwa wu'syu' wamwa Mose</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 34:29" />Yav'aga Mose aho wasookaga ku' lu'gu'lu' lwa Sinai ku'no ali' na mav'ale av'i'li' ga wu'sangi'lwa mu makono gakwe, ndi' akamanyile ku'v'a wu'syu' wakwe wu'li'kelema ku'nguno ya ku'su'nsu'mu'la na Gu'ku' Mulungu. <verse eid="EXO 34:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 34:30" />Hohene Aloni haki'mo na V'aizilaeli v'ose aho ndi' v'amuwona Mose, kasinaga wu'syu' wakwe wu'li'kelema, haho v'ogohaga ku'mwegela. <verse eid="EXO 34:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 34:31" />Ali'vi Mose wamwitanaga Aloni na v'atongelezi v'a iv'ilingano lya V'aizilaeli, nav'o v'asu'v'aga ku' wakwe, nawe wayombaga nav'o. <verse eid="EXO 34:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 34:32" />Haho V'aizilaeli v'ose v'amwegelaga, nawe wav'awi'laga milagi' zyose i'zyo Gu'ku' Mulungu wamuwi'lile ku' lu'gu'lu' lwa Sinai. <verse eid="EXO 34:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 34:33" />Yav'aga Mose aho wamali'laga ku'yomba nav'o, wikumbi'laga ki'tambala ki'ti' shela. <verse eid="EXO 34:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 34:34" />Ali'vi yav'age ki'ti'le chamwa Mose, ki'la itungo i'lo wav'age ali'ya ku'kasu'nsu'mu'la na Gu'ku' Mulungu mu Ihema lya Ku'sangi'zya, waki'siniage ki'tambala cheni'cho mpaka u'lu' wafuma ha ibala. Nawe wav'age u'lu' wafuma wav'awi'lage mihayo zyose i'zyo walagi'li'ziv'agwa. <verse eid="EXO 34:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 34:35" />Haho V'aizilaeli v'awu'wonage wu'syu' wakwe wu'li'kelema. Nawe Mose wikumbi'lage hangi' ki'tambala ku' wu'syu' wakwe, mpaka aho wav'age mbe ali'ya ku'kasu'nsu'mu'la na Gu'ku' Mulungu.<verse eid="EXO 34:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 34" />
  <chapter number="35" style="c" sid="EXO 35" />
  <para style="s">Ki'ti'le cha lu'siku' lwa ki'suuho u'lo lu'li' Sabato</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 35:1" />Hangi' Mose wakumingaga iv'ilingano lyose lya V'aizilaeli na ku'v'awi'la, “Aga hu' magambo ago Gu'ku' Mulungu walagi'li'zizye mugav'ezye. <verse eid="EXO 35:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 35:2" />Ku' itungo lya nsiku' mukaga mulav'e muli'tu'mama, ali'vi lu'siku' lwa mupungati' lu'li' lu'siku' lu'sondo lwa ku'lenda ku' winywe. Lu'li' Sabato ku'mwa Gu'ku' Mulungu. Muntu' u'yo alatu'mame lu'siku' lwenu'lo yi'lamudime ku'wu'lagwa. <verse eid="EXO 35:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 35:3" />Lu'siku' lwenu'lo lwa ki'suuho, ku'du' mwize mupembe ninga moto mu nnumba zinywe.”<verse eid="EXO 35:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kalu'mbi'lo ka vilwani'lo vya Ihema Isondo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 25:1-9">Ku'fuma 25:1-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 35:4" />Hangi' Mose wali'wi'laga iv'ilingano lyose lya V'aizilaeli ati', “Lyeni'li' hu' igambo i'lo Gu'ku' Mulungu wamulagi'li'zyaga muli'v'ezye: <verse eid="EXO 35:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 35:5" />Mulav'e muli'fumya kalu'mbi'lo ku'mwa Gu'ku' Mulungu. Ki'la muntu' u'yo ali' na moyo gwa ku'togwa, alalete kalu'mbi'lo aka: mawe ga feza, zahabu na shaba, <verse eid="EXO 35:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 35:6" />wu'zi wa langi ya bululu, zambalawo na yazaa, wu'zi wa katani nsoga, wu'yenze wa mbu'li, <verse eid="EXO 35:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 35:7" />ndi'li' zya ng'ondi i'zyo ziv'ililwe langi yazaa, ndi'li' zya ndimu zingi' zya mu nyanza, magogo ga muti' gwa mugu'nga, <verse eid="EXO 35:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 35:8" />maguta ga muzeituni ku'nguno ya tala, visanjo ku'nguno ya maguta ga ku'v'ila na wu'bani wu'motu, <verse eid="EXO 35:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 35:9" />mawe ga mupango ga shohamu na mawe gangi' ga mupango ku'nguno ya ki'zibao na kamufuko ka ha ki'kuv'a ku'nguno ya muhozya muhanya.<verse eid="EXO 35:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 35:10" />“Ki'la fundi mutonto mugati' na inywe, ize ku'v'ezya vintu' vyose i'vyo walagi'li'zizye Gu'ku' Mulungu: <verse eid="EXO 35:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 35:11" />ku'v'ezya Ihema Isondo, nfundi' yalyo, visikizo vyalyo, felemu zyalyo, ngito zyalyo, nhi'ngi' zyalyo na vikali'lo vyalyo, <verse eid="EXO 35:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 35:12" />isandi'ko lya wu'sangi'lwa haki'mo na miti' zyalyo na nfundi' ya wu'swanano, muki'ngo gwa ku'ki'ga Hantu' Hasondo Muno, <verse eid="EXO 35:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 35:13" />meza na miti' zyayo haki'mo na vilwani'lo vyayo vyose, na migate misondo, <verse eid="EXO 35:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 35:14" />ki'nala cha ku'tu'u'li'la tala haki'mo na vilwani'lo vyacho vyose na tala zyacho, na maguta ga ku'v'asi'zya, <verse eid="EXO 35:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 35:15" />ihozezyo lya ku'zuki'zi'zya wu'vumba haki'mo na miti' zyalyo, maguta ga ku'v'ila na wu'bani wu'motu, muki'ngo gwa wingi'li'lo wa Ihema Isondo, <verse eid="EXO 35:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 35:16" />ihozezyo lya ku'zigi'zya vitaambo haki'mo na wavu walyo wa shaba, miti' zyalyo haki'mo na vilwani'lo vyalyo vyose, ikalaye na kikali'lo chalyo, <verse eid="EXO 35:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 35:17" />miki'ngo zya lu'gu'tu', nhi'ngi' zyalo na vikali'lo vyazyo, muki'ngo gwa wingi'li'lo wa lu'gu'tu', <verse eid="EXO 35:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 35:18" />mmambo zya Ihema Isondo na zya lu'gu'tu' haki'mo na ngoye zyazyo, <verse eid="EXO 35:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 35:19" />vizwalo vyose i'vyo vifuumilwe visoga ku'nguno ya muli'mo gwa mugati' ha Hantu' Hasondo, vizwalo visondo vya muhozya Aloni, na vizwalo vya v'ana v'akwe ku'nguno ya muli'mo gwav'o gwa wu'hozya.”<verse eid="EXO 35:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 35:20" />Haho iv'ilingano lyose lya V'aizilaeli lyawu'kaga ha mbele yamwa Mose. <verse eid="EXO 35:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 35:21" />Ki'la muntu' u'yo watogwaga na moyo gwakwe gwamwelaga wizaga na ku'fumya kalu'mbi'lo ku'mwa Gu'ku' Mulungu ku'nguno ya muli'mo gwa wu'zyengi wa Ihema lya Ku'sangi'zya, ku' wu'gwasya wose na vizwalo vyalyo visondo. <verse eid="EXO 35:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 35:22" />I'vi hu' vyene v'antu' v'ose v'a moyo gwa ku'togwa, v'agosya ku' v'aki'ma, v'aletaga saziya, vipini, pete zya muhuli, makoja na ki'la mukoli gwa wu'lembo wa zahabu. V'aviwu'syaga vintu' vya zahabu viv'e lu'manyi'lo lwa kalu'mbi'lo ku'mwa Gu'ku' Mulungu. <verse eid="EXO 35:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 35:23" />Hangi' ki'la muntu' u'yo wav'age na wu'zi wa langi ya bululu, zambalawo ninga yazaa, katani nsoga, wu'yenze wa mbu'li, ndi'li' zya ng'ondi i'zyo ziv'ililwe langi yazaa ninga ndi'li' zya ndimu zingi' zya mu nyanza, v'aviletaga. <verse eid="EXO 35:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 35:24" />Ki'la muntu' u'yo wakowolaga ku'fumya mawe ga feza ninga shaba, waviletaga ku'mwa Gu'ku' Mulungu ki'ti' kalu'mbi'lo kakwe. Hangi' ki'la muntu' u'yo wav'age na magogo ga muti' gwa mugu'nga ku' ki'la muli'mo wagaletaga. <verse eid="EXO 35:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 35:25" />Nav'o v'aki'ma v'ose av'o v'av'age na wu'manyi wa ku'pelega, v'aletaga wu'zi u'wo wu'pelegilwe wa langi ya bululu, zambalawo na yazaa, na wu'zi wa katani nsoga. <verse eid="EXO 35:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 35:26" />Hangi' v'aki'ma v'ose v'a myoyo zya ku'togwa av'o v'av'age na wu'manyi, v'apelegaga wu'zi ku' wu'yenze wa mbu'li. <verse eid="EXO 35:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 35:27" />V'atongelezi v'aletaga mawe ga mupango ga shohamu na mawe gangi' ga mupango ku'nguno ya ki'zibao na kamufuko ka ha ki'kuv'a. <verse eid="EXO 35:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 35:28" />Hangi' v'aletaga visanjo na maguta ga muzeituni ku'nguno ya tala, maguta ga ku'v'ila na wu'bani wu'motu. <verse eid="EXO 35:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 35:29" />V'aizilaeli v'ose, v'agosya ku' v'aki'ma, v'aletaga vintu' vyeni'vyo ki'la yu'mo ku' moyo gwa wu'togwe ku'v'a kalu'mbi'lo ku'mwa Gu'ku' Mulungu, ku'nguno ya muli'mo u'go Gu'ku' Mulungu ndi' wamulagi'li'zya Mose ku'gu'v'ezya.<verse eid="EXO 35:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">V'afundi ku'nguno ya Ihema lya Ku'sangi'zya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 31:1-11">Ku'fuma 31:1-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 35:30" />Hangi' Mose wav'awi'laga V'aizilaeli ati', “Lingagi, Gu'ku' Mulungu wamusogolaga Bezaleli, mwana wamwa Uli, mwizu'ku'lu' wamwa Huli, wa igongo lya Yuda. <verse eid="EXO 35:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 35:31" />Nawe wamokazyaga Loho ya Mulungu, na ku'mupa wu'tonto, wu'kowozi, masala na wu'manyi wa ku'v'ezya ki'la muli'mo, <verse eid="EXO 35:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 35:32" />ki'gele iganike ki'v'ezezye cha mili'mo zya ku'sula mawe ga feza, zahabu na shaba, <verse eid="EXO 35:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 35:33" />ku'pu'nza mawe ga ku'tu'u'la mu vyokazyo, na ku'pu'nza magogo, zyose zyeni'zi ku'nguno ya mili'mo zyose zya wu'manyi. <verse eid="EXO 35:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 35:34" />Nawe wamupaga, mweni'ki'li' haki'mo na Oholiabu, mwana wamwa Ahisamaki, wa igongo lya Dani, wu'kowozi wa ku'v'ahembeka v'angi'. <verse eid="EXO 35:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 35:35" />Wav'apaga wu'manyi wa ku'v'ezya ki'la muli'mo gwa wu'fundi na kwiganika ki'v'ezezye. Hangi' wav'apaga wu'manyi wa koola ku' mawe na ku'pu'nda ku' wu'zi wa langi ya bululu, zambalawo na yazaa, na katani nsoga, haki'mo na ku'fuuma myenda.”<verse eid="EXO 35:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 35" />
  <chapter number="36" style="c" sid="EXO 36" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 36:1" />Mose wendeleyaga ku'yomba ati', “Ku'nguno yeni'yo Bezaleli na Oholiabu, haki'mo na ki'la fundi u'yo Gu'ku' Mulungu wamuyali'laga wu'manyi na masala ga ki'tu'mami'le cha mili'mo zyose ku' wu'zyengi wa hantu' hasondo, aku'tu'mama ku'gelani'la na gose ago Gu'ku' Mulungu walagi'li'zizye.”<verse eid="EXO 36:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 36:2" />Haho Mose wav'itanaga Bezaleli na Oholiabu, na ki'la fundi u'yo Gu'ku' Mulungu ndi' wamupaga wu'manyi na wu'togwe wa kwiza ku'tu'mama. <verse eid="EXO 36:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 36:3" />V'enav'o v'apokelaga kalu'mbi'lo ku'fuma ku'mwa Mose ako kafumiv'agwa na V'aizilaeli ku'nguno ya muli'mo gwa hantu' hasondo. V'antu' v'endeleyaga ku'muletela kalu'mbi'lo kav'o ku' wu'togwe wav'o ki'la ndiyu'. <verse eid="EXO 36:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 36:4" />Ali'vi lyafikaga itungo v'antu' v'ose v'a wu'manyi av'o ndi' v'ali'tu'mama mili'mo zya ki'la mukoli zya ku'zyenga hantu' hasondo v'i'mi'kyaga mili'mo na ku'ya ku'mwa Mose, <verse eid="EXO 36:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 36:5" />nav'o v'amuwi'laga ati', “V'antu' v'ali'leta vintu' vingi muno ku'ki'la i'vyo vili'koov'iwa ku'nguno ya muli'mo gwenu'gu' u'go Gu'ku' Mulungu walagi'li'zizye gu'v'ezyeke.” <verse eid="EXO 36:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 36:6" />Haho Mose wafumyaga ilagi'li'zyo, nav'o v'afilaga mmola mu nkambi' yose, ati', “Ki'la muntu', av'e mugosya ninga muki'ma, ku'du' alete hangi' ki'ntu' ninga ki'mo ku'nguno ya kalu'mbi'lo ka hantu' hasondo.” Hohene v'antu' v'ahangagwa ku'leta vintu', <verse eid="EXO 36:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 36:7" />ku'nguno i'vyo ndi' v'aletaga ndi' vyagelani'laga ku' muli'mo gwenu'go mpaka na ku'sigali'la.<verse eid="EXO 36:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ku'zyenga Ihema Isondo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 26:1-37">Ku'fuma 26:1-37</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 36:8" />Hangi' v'antu' v'ose av'o v'ali' na wu'manyi v'av'ezyaga Ihema Isondo ku' miki'ngo iku'mi zya katani nsoga i'yo yi'pelegilwe, na zya wu'zi wa langi ya bululu, zambalawo na yazaa. Miki'ngo zyeni'zyo zyatyanagwa ku' wu'tonto ku' kolwa masu'mbano ga v'akelubi. <verse eid="EXO 36:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 36:9" />Ki'la muki'ngo gwav'age na wu'lihu wa mita iku'mi na iv'i'li' na wu'gali'nhu wago mita iv'i'li'. Miki'ngo zyeni'zyo zyose zyav'age zya ki'pimo ki'mo.<verse eid="EXO 36:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 36:10" />V'azilu'ngyaga ku' ku'suma miki'ngo itano ku'v'a muki'ngo gu'mo, na miki'ngo zingi' itano ku'v'a muki'ngo gwa wu'v'i'li'. <verse eid="EXO 36:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 36:11" />Hangi' v'asumi'laga ngovyo zya langi ya bululu ku' ipi'ndo lya muki'ngo gwa kwandya, na vyene vivyo v'asumi'laga ngovyo zingi' ku' ipi'ndo lya muki'ngo gwa wu'v'i'li'. <verse eid="EXO 36:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 36:12" />V'av'ezyaga ngovyo maku'mi atano ku' ipi'ndo lya muki'ngo gu'mo, na ngovyo maku'mi atano zingi' ku' ipi'ndo lya muki'ngo gwa wu'v'i'li', nazyo ngovyo zyose zilingaga. <verse eid="EXO 36:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 36:13" />Hangi' v'av'ezyaga visikizo maku'mi atano vya zahabu, i'vyo vyalu'ngi'zyaga i'zyo miki'ngo iv'i'li', nazyo zyav'aga ki'ntu' ki'mo ku'nguno ya ihema.<verse eid="EXO 36:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 36:14" />V'av'ezyaga nfundi' ya ihema ku' miki'ngo iku'mi na gu'mo zya wu'yenze wa mbu'li. <verse eid="EXO 36:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 36:15" />Ki'la muki'ngo gwav'age na wu'lihu wa mita iku'mi na idatu', na wu'gali'nhu mita iv'i'li'. Miki'ngo zyose iku'mi na gu'mo zyav'age na ki'pimo ki'mo. <verse eid="EXO 36:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 36:16" />V'azilu'ngyaga ku' ku'suma miki'ngo itano ku'v'a muki'ngo gu'mo, na i'zyo miki'ngo zingi' mukaga ku'v'a muki'ngo gu'mo. <verse eid="EXO 36:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 36:17" />Hangi' v'av'ezyaga ngovyo maku'mi atano ku' ipi'ndo lya muki'ngo gu'mo, na ngovyo maku'mi atano ku' ipi'ndo lya muki'ngo gwa wu'v'i'li'. <verse eid="EXO 36:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 36:18" />V'av'ezyaga visikizo maku'mi atano vya shaba na ku'vingi'zya mu i'zyo ngovyo, ki'gele ku'yi'lu'ngya nfundi' ya ihema yi'v'e ki'ntu' ki'mo. <verse eid="EXO 36:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 36:19" />V'av'ezyaga nfundi' ya ihema ku' ndi'li' zya ng'ondi i'zyo ziv'ililwe langi yazaa, na ha igu'lya yayo v'av'ezyaga nfundi' yi'ngi' ya ndi'li' zya ndimu zingi' zya mu nyanza.<verse eid="EXO 36:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 36:20" />Hangi' v'av'ezyaga felemu ku'tu'mi'la mbawo zya mugu'nga zya ku'ki'ndi'ki'la ihema. <verse eid="EXO 36:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 36:21" />Ki'la felemu yav'age na mbawo iv'i'li' zya wu'lihu wa mita ine na wu'gali'nhu wa maba sentimita maku'mi mukaga na mukaga. <verse eid="EXO 36:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 36:22" />Ki'la lu'bawo lwav'age na lu'li'mi lu'mo lwa ku'sopeka ku' kikali'lo. Felemu zyose zya ihema v'aziv'ezezyaga ndi'mi iv'i'li' iv'i'li'. <verse eid="EXO 36:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 36:23" />V'av'ezyaga felemu maku'mi av'i'li' ku' lwandi' lwa dakama lwa ihema, <verse eid="EXO 36:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 36:24" />na vikali'lo maku'mi ane vya mawe ga feza vya ku'tu'u'la ha nsi'li'li' na zyeni'zyo felemu maku'mi av'i'li'. Ki'la felemu yav'age na vikali'lo viv'i'li', ki'gele zidimi'li'le i'zyo ndi'mi zyayo iv'i'li'. <verse eid="EXO 36:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 36:25" />Hangi' v'av'ezyaga felemu zingi' maku'mi av'i'li' ku'nguno ya lwandi' lwa sukuma lwa ihema, <verse eid="EXO 36:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 36:26" />na vikali'lo vyazyo maku'mi ane vya mawe ga feza. Ki'la felemu yav'age na vikali'lo viv'i'li'. <verse eid="EXO 36:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 36:27" />V'av'ezyaga felemu mukaga ku'nguno ya lwandi' lwa ku' mupi'ndo gwa ihema, u'go gu'li' ku' mweli. <verse eid="EXO 36:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 36:28" />Hangi' v'av'ezyaga felemu zingi' iv'i'li' ku'nguno ya vituzi vya ihema ku' lwandi' lwalyo lwa ku' mupi'ndo. <verse eid="EXO 36:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 36:29" />Ku' vituzi vyeni'vyo viv'i'li' felemu zyeni'zyo ndi' ziki'ndi'kilwe yi'mo yi'mo ku' ki'la ki'tuzi kwandi'zya ha nsi' mpaka ku' igu'lya, na ki'la felemu ndi' yi'dimilwe na pete ku' ki'tuzi ku' igu'lya. Felemu zyeni'zyo iv'i'li' ziv'eziv'ilwe vyene vivyo ku' vituzi viv'i'li'. <verse eid="EXO 36:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 36:30" />Ku'nguno yeni'yo kwav'ageho felemu munane ku' mupi'ndo gwa ihema, na vikali'lo iku'mi na mukaga zya mawe ga feza. Ki'la felemu yav'age na vikali'lo viv'i'li'.<verse eid="EXO 36:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 36:31" />V'av'ezyaga ngito zya muti' gwa mugu'nga: ngito itano ku'nguno ya felemu zya lwandi' lu'mo lwa ihema, <verse eid="EXO 36:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 36:32" />ngito itano ku'nguno ya lwandi' lwa wu'v'i'li', na ngito itano ku'nguno ya felemu zya lwandi' lwa ku' mupi'ndo gwa ihema, u'lo lu'li' ku' mweli. <verse eid="EXO 36:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 36:33" />Mugati' nazyo lu'gito lu'mo lwav'i'taga hagati' na felemu ku'fuma ku' mpelo yi'mo mpaka ku' mpelo yi'ngi'. <verse eid="EXO 36:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 36:34" />Felemu zyose v'azikumbi'laga zahabu na ku'ziv'ezezya pete zya zahabu zya ku'dimi'li'la ngito zyeni'zyo. Hangi' na ngito v'azikumbi'laga zahabu.<verse eid="EXO 36:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 36:35" />Hangi' v'av'ezyaga muki'ngo gwa mugati' ku' wu'zi wa langi ya bululu, zambalawo na yazaa, na katani nsoga i'yo yi'pelegilwe. Muki'ngo gwenu'go gu'fuumilwe ku' wu'tonto na kolwa masu'mbano ga v'akelubi. <verse eid="EXO 36:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="EXO 36:36" />V'av'ezyaga nhi'ngi' ine zya mugu'nga na ku'zikumbi'la zahabu, na nkontozyo zyazyo zyav'age zya zahabu. Vyene vivyo v'azisuli'laga vikali'lo vine vya mawe ga feza. <verse eid="EXO 36:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="EXO 36:37" />Ku'nguno ya wingi'li'lo wa ihema v'av'ezyaga muki'ngo ku' wu'zi wa langi ya bululu, zambalawo na yazaa, na katani nsoga i'yo yi'pelegilwe, na ku'pu'ndwa visoga. <verse eid="EXO 36:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="EXO 36:38" />Hangi' v'agu'v'ezezyaga nhi'ngi' itano haki'mo na nkontozyo zyazyo. Mitwe zya nhi'ngi' zyeni'zyo v'azikumbi'laga zahabu na pete zya ku'zwi'ka zyav'age zya zahabu. Hangi' v'av'ezyaga vikali'lo vyazyo vitano ku' shaba.<verse eid="EXO 36:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 36" />
  <chapter number="37" style="c" sid="EXO 37" />
  <para style="s">Ku'v'ezya isandi'ko lya wu'sangi'lwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 25:10-22">Ku'fuma 25:10-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 37:1" />Bezaleli wav'ezyaga isandi'ko lya mbawo zya mugu'nga. Wu'lihu walyo wav'age sentimita igana li'mo na iku'mi, wu'gali'nhu sentimita maku'mi mukaga na mukaga, na wi'i'ma walyo sentimita maku'mi mukaga na mukaga. <verse eid="EXO 37:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 37:2" />Wali'kumbi'laga zahabu nsoso mugati' na ha ibala, na ku'li'pilimya lu'ki'go lwa zahabu ki'la lwandi'. <verse eid="EXO 37:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 37:3" />Hangi' wasulaga pete ine zya zahabu, na ku'zitunga ku' magu'lu' galyo ane, pete iv'i'li' lwandi' lu'mo na pete iv'i'li' lwandi' lwa wu'v'i'li'. <verse eid="EXO 37:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 37:4" />Wav'ezyaga na miti' iv'i'li' zya mugu'nga na ku'zikumbi'la zahabu. <verse eid="EXO 37:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 37:5" />Nawe waziswekaga zyeni'zyo miti' ku' pete i'zyo zyav'age mu mbazu zya isandi'ko, ku'nguno ya ku'li'sombela. <verse eid="EXO 37:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 37:6" />Wav'ezyaga nfundi' ya wu'swanano ku' zahabu nsoso, wu'lihu wayo wav'age sentimita igana li'mo na iku'mi, na wu'gali'nhu wayo sentimita maku'mi mukaga na mukaga. <verse eid="EXO 37:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 37:7" />Hangi' wav'ezyaga masu'mbano av'i'li' ga wikole na v'amalaika v'akelubi ku' zahabu i'yo yi'sulilwe ku' nnundo, na ku'gatu'u'la ku' ki'la mpelo ya nfundi', <verse eid="EXO 37:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 37:8" />isu'mbano li'mo ku' mpelo yi'mo, na isu'mbano li'ngi' ku' mpelo ya wu'v'i'li'. Wagatu'u'laga masu'mbano genago ku'v'a ki'ntu' ki'mo na yeni'yo nfundi' ku' mpelo zyose iv'i'li'. <verse eid="EXO 37:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 37:9" />Masu'mbano genago gav'age ganzile manana gago ku' igu'lya, na ku'yi'kumbi'la nfundi', nago gav'age gilolile ku'no gayi'dolekile nfundi'.<figure style="fig" file="gt00010.jpg" size="col" loc="Anywhere in 37:1-9 or at bottom of page" ref="37:9">Isandi'ko lya wu'sangi'lwa yaani lya ilagano</figure><verse eid="EXO 37:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ku'v'ezya meza ya migate misondo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 25:23-30">Ku'fuma 25:23-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 37:10" />Vyene vivyo wav'ezyaga meza ya mbawo zya mugu'nga. Wu'lihu wayo wav'age sentimita maku'mi munane na munane, wu'gali'nhu wayo sentimita maku'mi ane na ine, na wi'i'ma wayo sentimita maku'mi mukaga na mukaga. <verse eid="EXO 37:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 37:11" />Meza yeni'yo wayi'kumbi'laga zahabu nsoso, na ku'yi'pilimi'zya lu'ki'go lwa zahabu ki'la lwandi'. <verse eid="EXO 37:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 37:12" />Hangi' wayi'v'ezezyaga kalu'bawo na ku'yi'pilimi'zya meza ki'la lwandi' na wakapilimi'zyaga lu'ki'go lwa zahabu. Kalu'bawo kenako kav'age na wu'gali'nhu wa sentimita munane. <verse eid="EXO 37:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 37:13" />Wasulaga pete ine zya zahabu ku'nguno ya meza yeni'yo, na ku'zizwi'ka ku' ki'la mugu'lu' gwa meza yeni'yo. <verse eid="EXO 37:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 37:14" />Pete zyeni'zyo wazitu'u'laga bi'hi' na ako kalu'bawo, ki'gele ziv'e hu' ha ku'dimi'zya i'zyo miti' zya ku'yi'sombela meza. <verse eid="EXO 37:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 37:15" />Wav'ezyaga miti' zya mugu'nga zya ku'yi'sombela meza, na ku'zikumbi'la zahabu. <verse eid="EXO 37:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 37:16" />Hangi' wav'ezyaga viseme ku' zahabu nsoso vya ku'tu'u'la ha igu'lya na meza: sahani na tu'viseme ku'nguno ya wu'bani, na vikombe na mabakuli ku'nguno ya ku'pu'ngu'li'la kalu'mbi'lo ka ki'neneko.<verse eid="EXO 37:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ku'v'ezya ki'nala cha ku'tu'u'li'la tala</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 25:31-40">Ku'fuma 25:31-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 37:17" />Wav'ezyaga ki'nala cha ku'tu'u'li'la tala ku' zahabu nsoso i'yo yi'sulilwe ku' nnundo. Kikali'lo chacho, kamuti' kacho, vikombe vyacho, magundo gacho na mauwa gacho, vyose vyav'aga ki'ntu' ki'mo. <verse eid="EXO 37:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 37:18" />Matambi' mukaga gafumi'laga mu mbazu zyacho, matambi' adatu' lwandi' lu'mo na matambi' adatu' lwandi' lwa wu'v'i'li'. <verse eid="EXO 37:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 37:19" />Ku' ki'la itambi' mugati' na genago mukaga kwav'age na vikombe vidatu' vya wikole na malawu' ga muti' gwa mulozi, ki'la ki'mo na magundo gacho na malawu' gacho. <verse eid="EXO 37:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 37:20" />Ku' kamuti' vyav'age vili'ho vikombe vine i'vyo viv'eziv'ilwe ku' wikole wa malawu' ga mulozi, haki'mo na magundo gavyo na malawu' gavyo. <verse eid="EXO 37:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 37:21" />Ki'la lwandi' u'lo lwafumi'i'laga matambi' av'i'li', ha nsi'li'li' yaho hav'aga na igundo li'mo li'mo. <verse eid="EXO 37:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 37:22" />Magundo genago na matambi' gago gav'age ki'ntu' ki'mo na cheni'cho ki'nala cha ku'tu'u'li'la tala, na vyose vyav'age vya zahabu nsoso i'yo yi'sulilwe ku' nnundo. <verse eid="EXO 37:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 37:23" />Wav'ezyaga tala mupungati', mikasi zya ku'gelani'zi'zya wu'tambi', haki'mo na sahani zyayo ku' zahabu nsoso. <verse eid="EXO 37:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 37:24" />Watu'mi'laga kilo maku'mi adatu'<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">37:24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kilo maku'mi adatu' na itano ku' Ki'ebulania yi'li' talanta yi'mo.</char></note> na itano zya zahabu nsoso ku'v'ezezya ki'nala cha ku'tu'u'li'la tala haki'mo na vilwani'lo vyacho vyose.<verse eid="EXO 37:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ku'v'ezya ihozezyo lya ku'zuki'zi'zya wu'vumba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 30:1-5">Ku'fuma 30:1-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 37:25" />Hangi' wav'ezyaga ihozezyo lya ku'zuki'zi'zya wu'bani ku' mbawo zya mugu'nga. Ihozezyo lyeni'lo lyav'age lya mugelani'lo, wu'lihu na wu'gali'nhu walyo sentimita maku'mi ane na itano, na wi'i'ma walyo sentimita maku'mi kenda. Mapembe galyo ga mu igu'lya gose gav'aga ki'ntu' ki'mo na ihozezyo lyeni'lo. <verse eid="EXO 37:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 37:26" />Nawe wali'kumbi'laga lyeni'lo ihozezyo ku' igu'lya na mu mbazu zyalyo haki'mo na mapembe galyo ku' zahabu nsoso, na wali'v'ezezyaga lu'ki'go lwa zahabu ku'li'pilima. <verse eid="EXO 37:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 37:27" />Hangi' wav'ezyaga pete iv'i'li' zya zahabu na ku'zitu'u'la ha nsi'li'li' na lu'ki'go mu mbazu zyalyo, ku' ki'la lwandi' pete yi'mo yi'mo, ku'nguno ya ku'dimi'li'la miti' itungo lya ku'li'somba. <verse eid="EXO 37:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 37:28" />Wav'ezyaga miti' iv'i'li' zya mugu'nga, na ku'zikumbi'la zahabu.<verse eid="EXO 37:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 37:29" />Hangi' wav'ezyaga maguta masondo ga ku'v'ila, na wu'bani wu'soga wa wu'motu, u'wo wu'seleganiv'ilwe ku' wu'tonto.<verse eid="EXO 37:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 37" />
  <chapter number="38" style="c" sid="EXO 38" />
  <para style="s">Ku'v'ezya ihozezyo lya ku'zigi'zya vitaambo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 27:1-8">Ku'fuma 27:1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 38:1" />Hangi' wav'ezyaga ihozezyo lya ku'zigi'zya vitaambo ku' mbawo zya muti' gwa mugu'nga. Ihozezyo lyeni'lo lyav'age lya mugelani'lo, wu'lihu walyo na wu'gali'nhu walyo mita iv'i'li' na lobo, na wi'i'ma walyo mita yi'mo na lobo. <verse eid="EXO 38:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 38:2" />Wav'ezyaga mapembe ane ga mu mapembo galyo ane nago gav'aga ki'ntu' ki'mo na ihozezyo lyeni'ki'li'. Ihozezyo lyose wali'kumbi'laga shaba. <verse eid="EXO 38:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 38:3" />Wav'ezyaga vilwani'lo vyalyo vyose ku' shaba: mafuli'la ga ku'sini'zya matunde, mayolelo ga ku'kokotela ha ihozezyo, mabakuli, wuma zya ku'timi'la nyama na sahani zya ku'lapu'li'la moto. <verse eid="EXO 38:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 38:4" />Hangi' wav'ezyaga wavu wa shaba, na ku'wu'tu'u'la ha nsi'li'li' na leli ya ihozezyo mpaka wafikaga hagati' yalyo. <verse eid="EXO 38:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 38:5" />Hangi' wasulaga pete ine zya shaba, ku' ki'la ipembo pete yi'mo, ku'nguno ya ku'dimi'zya miti' zya ku'li'sombela ihozezyo lyeni'lo. <verse eid="EXO 38:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 38:6" />Wav'ezyaga miti' zyeni'zyo zya mugu'nga na ku'zikumbi'la shaba, <verse eid="EXO 38:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 38:7" />na waziswekaga mu pete i'zyo zyav'age mu mbazu zya lyeni'lo ihozezyo ku'nguno ya ku'li'sombela. Wav'ezyaga ihozezyo i'lo li'li' na nkululi mugati' ku' ku'tu'mi'la mbawo.<figure style="fig" file="co00846.jpg" size="col" loc="Anywhere in 38:1-7, or at the bottom of the page below these verses" ref="38:7">Ihozezyo lya ku'zigi'zya vitaambo</figure><verse eid="EXO 38:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 38:8" />Hangi' wav'ezyaga ikalaye lya shaba na kikali'lo chalyo cha shaba. Ikalaye lyeni'lo lyav'eziv'agwa ku' ku'tu'mi'la vintu' vya shaba i'vyo vili'yekema ki'ti' malole i'vyo ndi' v'afumya v'aki'ma av'o v'atu'mamage ha wingi'li'lo wa Ihema lya Ku'sangi'zya.<verse eid="EXO 38:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ku'zyenga lu'gu'tu' lwa Ihema Isondo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 27:9-19">Ku'fuma 27:9-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 38:9" />Nawe wav'ezyaga lu'gu'tu'. Lwandi' lwa ku' dakama kwav'age na miki'ngo zya lu'gu'tu' i'zyo ziv'eziv'ilwe ku' katani nsoga i'yo yi'pelegilwe. Miki'ngo zyeni'zyo zyav'age na wu'lihu wa mita maku'mi ane na ine. <verse eid="EXO 38:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 38:10" />Nhi'ngi' zyazyo zyav'age maku'mi av'i'li' na vikali'lo vya shaba maku'mi av'i'li'. Nkontozyo zya nhi'ngi' zyeni'zyo haki'mo na pete zya ku'zwi'ka nhi'ngi' zyav'age zya mawe ga feza. <verse eid="EXO 38:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 38:11" />Vyene vivyo na lwandi' lwa ku' sukuma wu'lihu wa miki'ngo wav'age mita maku'mi ane na ine, na nhi'ngi' zyazyo maku'mi av'i'li' na vikali'lo vyazyo maku'mi av'i'li' vya shaba. Hangi' nkontozyo zya nhi'ngi' na pete zya ku'zwi'ka nhi'ngi' zyav'age zya mawe ga feza. <verse eid="EXO 38:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 38:12" />Lwandi' lwa ku' mweli lwav'age na miki'ngo zya wu'lihu wa mita maku'mi av'i'li' na iv'i'li', na nhi'ngi' zyazyo iku'mi na vikali'lo vyazyo iku'mi. Nkontozyo zya nhi'ngi' na pete zya ku'zwi'ka nhi'ngi' zyav'age zya mawe ga feza. <verse eid="EXO 38:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 38:13" />Lwandi' lwa ku' ki'ya, u'ko kwav'age na wingi'li'lo, lu'gu'tu' lwav'age na wu'gali'nhu wa mita maku'mi av'i'li' na iv'i'li'. <verse eid="EXO 38:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 38:14" />Miki'ngo zya ku' lwandi' lu'mo lwa wingi'li'lo zyav'age na wu'lihu wa mita mukaga na nusu, haki'mo na nhi'ngi' idatu' na vikali'lo vyazyo vidatu'. <verse eid="EXO 38:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 38:15" />Vyene vivyo ku' lwandi' lwa wu'v'i'li' lwa wingi'li'lo miki'ngo zyav'age na wu'lihu wa mita mukaga na nusu, haki'mo na nhi'ngi' zyazyo idatu' na vikali'lo vyazyo vidatu'. <verse eid="EXO 38:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 38:16" />Miki'ngo zyose i'zyo zipilimile lu'gu'tu' zyav'age zya katani nsoga i'yo yi'pelegilwe. <verse eid="EXO 38:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 38:17" />Vikali'lo vya nhi'ngi' vyav'age vya shaba, sumbwa nkontozyo zyazyo na pete zya ku'zwi'ka nhi'ngi' zyav'age zya mawe ga feza. Mitwe zyazyo zyav'age zikumbi'lilwe feza, hangi' nhi'ngi' zyose zya lu'gu'tu' zyazwi'kagwa pete zya mawe ga feza. <verse eid="EXO 38:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 38:18" />Muki'ngo gwa wingi'li'lo weni'ki'li' wa lu'gu'tu' gwav'age gu'pu'ndilwe visoga na wu'zi wa langi ya bululu, zambalawo na yazaa, na katani nsoga i'yo yi'pelegilwe. Muki'ngo gwenu'go gwav'age na wu'gali'nhu wa mita kenda, na wi'i'ma wago mita iv'i'li', ku'gelani'la na i'zyo miki'ngo zya lu'gu'tu'. <verse eid="EXO 38:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 38:19" />Nhi'ngi' zyago zyav'age ine na vikali'lo vyazyo vine vya shaba. Nkontozyo zyazyo na pete zya ku'zwi'ka nhi'ngi' zyav'age zya mawe ga feza, na mitwe zyazyo zyav'age zikumbi'lilwe feza. <verse eid="EXO 38:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 38:20" />Mmambo zyose zya Ihema Isondo na zya lu'gu'tu' u'lo lu'li'pilimile ihema zyav'age zya shaba.<verse eid="EXO 38:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mawe ga mupango ku'nguno ya Ihema Isondo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 38:21" />U'gu' hu' mwilondo gwa mawe ga mupango ago gatu'mi'ka ku' ku'li'zyenga Ihema Isondo, yaani Ihema lya Wu'sangi'lwa. Mwilondo gwenu'gu' gwiv'angagwa na V'alawi ki'ti' i'vyo Mose ndi' walagi'li'zya, ku' wi'mi'li'zi wamwa Itamali, mwana wa muhozya Aloni.<verse eid="EXO 38:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 38:22" />Bezaleli, mwana wamwa Uli, mwizu'ku'lu' wamwa Huli, wa igongo lya Yuda, ndi' wav'ezya ki'la ki'ntu' i'cho Gu'ku' Mulungu ndi' wamulagi'li'zya Mose. <verse eid="EXO 38:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 38:23" />Wagwasiv'agwa na Oholiabu, mwana wamwa Ahisamaki, wa igongo lya Dani, u'yo ali' fundi wa ki'la muli'mo, mumanyi wa kwiganika ki'v'ezezye, na mupu'ndi ku' wu'zi wa langi ya bululu, zambalawo na yazaa na katani nsoga.<verse eid="EXO 38:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 38:24" />Zahabu yose i'yo ndi' yatu'mi'ka ku' mili'mo zya hantu' hasondo yav'age yi'li' na wu'timbu wa kilo ki'hu'mbi' ki'mo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">38:24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kilo ki'hu'mbi' ki'mo ku' Ki'ebulania yi'li' talanta maku'mi av'i'li' na kenda na shekeli magana mupungati' na maku'mi adatu'.</char></note>, ku'londana na vipimo i'vyo vitu'u'lilwe ha hantu' hasondo. Zahabu yeni'yo hu' i'yo ndi' yawu'siwa ku'v'a lu'manyi'lo lwa kalu'mbi'lo ku'mwa Gu'ku' Mulungu. <verse eid="EXO 38:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 38:25" />Mawe ga feza ago ndi' gigela ku' v'enav'o v'antu' v'a iv'ilingano av'o ndi' v'asoloziwa ndi' ga wu'timbu wa kilo vihu'mbi' vidatu' na magana ane na maku'mi adatu', ku'londana na vipimo vya hantu' hasondo. <verse eid="EXO 38:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 38:26" />Ki'la mugosya u'yo ndi' wasoloziwa ku'fuma musimo gwa myaka maku'mi av'i'li' ninga ku'ki'la, ndi' wafumya lu'sogo lwakwe lwa feza gilamu mukaga, ku'londana na vipimo vya hantu' hasondo. V'agosya v'ose av'o ndi' v'asoloziwa v'av'age laki mukaga na vihu'mbi' vidatu' na magana atano na maku'mi atano. <verse eid="EXO 38:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 38:27" />Kilo vihu'mbi' vidatu' na magana ane zya mawe ga feza ndi' zyatu'mi'ka ku'suli'la vikali'lo igana li'mo vya hantu' hasondo na vya u'go muki'ngo gwa mugati', yaani kilo maku'mi adatu' na ine ku' ki'la kikali'lo. <verse eid="EXO 38:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 38:28" />I'zyo kilo maku'mi adatu' i'zyo ndi' zyasigali'la, ndi' zyatu'mi'ka ku'v'ezezya nkontozyo zya nhi'ngi' na ku'zikumbi'la feza mitwe zya nhi'ngi' na ku'ziv'ezezya pete zya ku'zwi'ka. <verse eid="EXO 38:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 38:29" />Shaba i'yo V'aizilaeli ndi' v'ayi'wu'sya ku'v'a lu'manyi'lo lwa kalu'mbi'lo ku'mwa Gu'ku' Mulungu, yav'age na wu'timbu wa kilo vihu'mbi' viv'i'li' na magana ane na maku'mi av'i'li' na itano. <verse eid="EXO 38:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 38:30" />Shaba yeni'yo ndi' yatu'mi'ka ku'v'ezezya vikali'lo vya nhi'ngi' zya ha wingi'li'lo wa Ihema lya Ku'sangi'zya, ihozezyo lya shaba, haki'mo na u'wo wavu walyo na vilwani'lo vyalyo vyose, <verse eid="EXO 38:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 38:31" />vikali'lo vya nhi'ngi' zya lu'gu'tu' u'lo lu'li'pilimile ihema na zya ha wingi'li'lo wa lu'gu'tu', na mmambo zyose zya Ihema Isondo haki'mo na zya lu'gu'tu'.<verse eid="EXO 38:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 38" />
  <chapter number="39" style="c" sid="EXO 39" />
  <para style="s">Ku'v'ezya vizwalo vya ki'hozya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 28:1-14">Ku'fuma 28:1-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 39:1" />Ku' ku'tu'mi'la wu'zi wa langi ya bululu, zambalawo na yazaa, v'afuumaga visoga vizwalo vya ku'zwala itungo lya ku'v'ezya muli'mo gwa Hantu' Hasondo. V'amusumi'laga Aloni vizwalo visondo ki'ti' i'vyo Gu'ku' Mulungu wamulagi'li'zizye Mose.<verse eid="EXO 39:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 39:2" />V'av'ezyaga ki'zibao ku' wu'zi wa zahabu na wa langi ya bululu, zambalawo na yazaa, haki'mo na katani nsoga i'yo yi'pelegilwe. <verse eid="EXO 39:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 39:3" />V'ayi'sulaga zahabu ku' nnundo na ku'yi'v'ezya nnieniengazu, na v'ayi'putaga yi'v'e wu'zi ki'gele v'awu'fuume ku' wu'tonto haki'mo na wu'zi wa langi ya bululu, zambalawo na yazaa, na katani nsoga. <verse eid="EXO 39:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 39:4" />Ki'zibao cheni'cho v'aki'v'ezezyaga mikwato iv'i'li' zya ku'tungi'la mu mav'ega ki'la iv'ega mukwato gu'mo, u'go gu'sumi'lilwe ku' nsoto. <verse eid="EXO 39:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 39:5" />Mukwato gwa ki'zibao gwa wu'lembwe gwa ku'tunga mu muki'mbi'li', gwav'eziv'agwa ku' vilwani'lo vyene vivyo, ku' wu'zi wa zahabu, na wa langi ya bululu, zambalawo na yazaa, haki'mo na katani nsoga i'yo yi'pelegilwe, gwasumi'li'lagwa ku'v'a ki'ntu' ki'mo na ki'zibao cheni'cho. V'av'ezyaga ki'ti' i'vyo Gu'ku' Mulungu wamulagi'li'zizye Mose.<verse eid="EXO 39:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 39:6" />V'apu'nzaga mawe av'i'li' ga mupango ga shohamu, na ku'gatu'u'la mu vyokazyo vya zahabu vya wu'lembwe, ago gatonilwe mina ga v'ana v'a ki'gosya v'amwa Izilaeli, ki'ti' musuli i'vyo ali'gu'tonaga muhuli. <verse eid="EXO 39:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 39:7" />Mawe genago ago gali' mu vyokazyo v'agatungaga ha igu'lya na mikwato zya mu mav'ega ga i'cho ki'zibao ki'gele gav'e mwizu' ku' V'aizilaeli, ki'ti' i'vyo Gu'ku' Mulungu wamulagi'li'zizye Mose.<verse eid="EXO 39:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 39:8" />V'av'ezyaga kamufuko ka ha ki'kuv'a ku' wu'tonto ki'ti' i'cho ki'zibao, ku' wu'zi wa zahabu, na wa langi ya bululu, zambalawo na yazaa na katani nsoga i'yo yi'pelegilwe. <verse eid="EXO 39:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 39:9" />Kamufuko kenako kav'age ka mugelani'lo ako ndi' kagondilwe, wu'lihu na wu'gali'nhu wako sentimita maku'mi av'i'li' na iv'i'li'. <verse eid="EXO 39:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 39:10" />Kamufuko kenako kalembagwa ku' mihelo ine zya mawe ga mupango. Muhelo gwa kwandya gwav'age na mawe ga akiki, topazi na bahalamani. <verse eid="EXO 39:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 39:11" />Muhelo gwa wu'v'i'li' gwav'age na mawe ga zumalidi, yakuti na alimasi. <verse eid="EXO 39:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 39:12" />Muhelo gwa wu'datu' gwav'age na mawe ga yasinto, ageti na ametisito. <verse eid="EXO 39:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 39:13" />Muhelo gwa wu'ne gwav'age na mawe ga kilisolito, shohamu na yasipi. Gose gatu'u'lagwa mu vyokazyo vya zahabu vya wu'lembwe. <verse eid="EXO 39:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 39:14" />Hohene kwav'age na mawe iku'mi na av'i'li' ago gatonilwe mina iku'mi na av'i'li' ga v'ana v'amwa Izilaeli. Ki'la li'mo ndi' li'tonilwe ki'ti' muhuli, na ku'v'a na lina li'mo mugati' na mina ga magongo ago iku'mi na av'i'li'. <verse eid="EXO 39:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 39:15" />V'av'ezyaga mikufu zya zahabu nsoso i'zyo zipelegilwe ki'ti' lu'goye, ku'nguno ya kamufuko ka ha ki'kuv'a. <verse eid="EXO 39:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 39:16" />Vyene vivyo v'av'ezyaga vyokazyo viv'i'li' vya zahabu vya wu'lembwe na pete iv'i'li' zya zahabu, na ku'zitungi'la ku' mapembo av'i'li' ga ku' igu'lya na kamufuko kenako. <verse eid="EXO 39:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 39:17" />V'azitungaga nsoto iv'i'li' zya mikufu ku' pete zyeni'zyo i'zyo zili' ku' mapembo ga kamufuko kenako. <verse eid="EXO 39:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 39:18" />Hangi' na i'zyo nsoto zingi' zya mikufu v'azitungaga ku' i'vyo vyokazyo viv'i'li' vya mawe. Vyene vivyo v'azitungani'zyaga ku' mikwato zya mu mav'ega ga i'cho ki'zibao, ku' lwandi' lwa ku' mbele. <verse eid="EXO 39:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 39:19" />V'av'ezyaga pete iv'i'li' zya zahabu, na ku'zitu'u'la mu mapembo av'i'li' ga ha nsi'li'li' na kamufuko ku' nnuma yako bi'hi' na ki'zibao. <verse eid="EXO 39:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 39:20" />V'av'ezyaga pete zingi' iv'i'li' zya zahabu, na ku'zidimani'zya ha lwandi' lwa ha nsi'li'li' ya mikwato zya mav'ega, ha lwandi' lwa ku' mbele lwa cheni'cho ki'zibao, bi'hi' na ipi'ndo ha igu'lya hadoo na mukwato gwa mu muki'mbi'li'. <verse eid="EXO 39:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 39:21" />Pete zya kamufuko kenako zyatungani'ziv'agwa na pete zya ki'zibao ku' lu'goye lwa langi ya bululu, ki'gele kaleke ku'soka na kikali'le mukwato gwa wu'lembwe gwa mu muki'mbi'li', ki'ti' i'vyo Gu'ku' Mulungu wamulagi'li'zizye Mose.<verse eid="EXO 39:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 39:22" />Hangi' v'afuumaga ijoho lya ku'zwali'la ki'zibao ku' ki'tambala cha langi ya bululu. <verse eid="EXO 39:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 39:23" />Hangi' v'adu'laga idu'lu'lu' lya ku'v'i'ti'zya mutwe. Ha lwandi' lwa nhingo v'ahapilimyaga ki'tambala i'cho ki'fuumilwe ki'gele ku'du' li'tandu'ke. <verse eid="EXO 39:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 39:24" />Ku' wu'pi'nde walyo wa ha nsi'li'li' ku'pilima lwandi' lose yalembagwa ku' masu'mbano ga makomamanga ga langi ya bululu, zambalawo na yazaa, na katani nsoga i'yo yi'pelegilwe. <verse eid="EXO 39:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 39:25" />Hangi' v'av'ezyaga miyi'mba zya zahabu nsoso, na ku'zidimani'zya ku'pilimya ku' wu'pi'nde wenu'wo. Hagati' ya ki'la ikomamanga v'atu'u'laga muyi'mba. <verse eid="EXO 39:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 39:26" />Zyeni'zyo miyi'mba na makomamanga vihelaga ku'li'pilima ipi'ndo lya ijoho lyeni'lo: ikomamanga, muyi'mba, ikomamanga, muyi'mba, ki'ti' i'vyo Gu'ku' Mulungu wamulagi'li'zizye Mose.<verse eid="EXO 39:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 39:27" />Hangi' v'av'afuumi'laga nhanzo ku' katani nsoga Aloni haki'mo na v'ana v'akwe, <verse eid="EXO 39:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 39:28" />na isimangi'la na nkofila zya katani nsoga, vizwalo vya mugati' vya katani nsoga i'yo yi'pelegilwe, <verse eid="EXO 39:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 39:29" />na mukwato gwa mu muki'mbi'li' gwapu'ndagwa visoga ku' katani nsoga i'yo yi'pelegilwe na wu'zi wa langi ya bululu, zambalawo na yazaa. V'av'ezyaga ki'ti' i'vyo Gu'ku' Mulungu wamulagi'li'zizye Mose.<verse eid="EXO 39:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 39:30" />Hangi' v'av'ezyaga ndezi nsondo ku' zahabu nsoso, na ku'yi'tona ha igu'lya yayo, ki'ti' i'vyo gu'li'tonagwa muhuli, “MUSONDO KU'MWA GU'KU' MULUNGU.” <verse eid="EXO 39:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 39:31" />Ndezi yeni'yo v'ayi'tungaga ha igu'lya na isimangi'la ku' lu'goye lwa langi ya bululu, ki'ti' i'vyo Gu'ku' Mulungu wamulagi'li'zizye Mose.<figure style="fig" file="gt00098.jpg" size="col" ref="39:31">Muhozya muhanya na vizwalo vyakwe</figure><verse eid="EXO 39:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ku'gelani'la kwa muli'mo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 35:10-19">Ku'fuma 35:10-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 39:32" />Hohene, muli'mo gose gwa Ihema Isondo, yaani Ihema lya Ku'sangi'zya, gwamalaga. V'aizilaeli v'av'ezyaga gose ki'ti' i'vyo Gu'ku' Mulungu wamulagi'li'zizye Mose. <verse eid="EXO 39:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 39:33" />V'amuletelaga Mose Ihema Isondo haki'mo na vilwani'lo vyalyo vyose, visikizo vyalyo, felemu zyalyo, ngito zyalyo, nhi'ngi' zyalyo na vikali'lo vyalyo, <verse eid="EXO 39:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 39:34" />nfundi' ya ndi'li' zya ng'ondi i'zyo ziv'ililwe langi yazaa na nfundi' ya ndi'li' zya ndimu zingi' zya mu nyanza, muki'ngo gwa ku'ki'ga Hantu' Hasondo Muno, <verse eid="EXO 39:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 39:35" />isandi'ko lya wu'sangi'lwa, miti' zyalyo na nfundi' ya wu'swanano, <verse eid="EXO 39:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="EXO 39:36" />meza na vilwani'lo vyayo vyose, migate misondo, <verse eid="EXO 39:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="EXO 39:37" />ki'nala cha ku'tu'u'li'la tala cha zahabu nsoso, tala zyacho ku' ku'hela, vilwani'lo vyacho vyose haki'mo na maguta ga ku'v'asi'zya, <verse eid="EXO 39:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="EXO 39:38" />ihozezyo lya zahabu, maguta ga ku'v'ila, wu'bani wu'motu, muki'ngo gwa wingi'li'lo wa ihema, <verse eid="EXO 39:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="EXO 39:39" />ihozezyo lya shaba haki'mo na wavu walyo wa shaba, miti' zyalyo na vilwani'lo vyalyo vyose, ikalaye na kikali'lo chalyo, <verse eid="EXO 39:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="EXO 39:40" />miki'ngo zya lu'gu'tu', nhi'ngi' zyalo na vikali'lo vyazyo, muki'ngo gwa wingi'li'lo wa lu'gu'tu', ngoye na mmambo zyose, vilwani'lo vyose vya ku'tu'mi'lwa ku' Ihema Isondo, yaani Ihema lya Ku'sangi'zya, <verse eid="EXO 39:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="EXO 39:41" />vizwalo vyose i'vyo vifuumilwe visoga ku'nguno ya muli'mo gwa mugati' ha Hantu' Hasondo, vizwalo visondo vya muhozya Aloni, na vizwalo vya v'ana v'akwe ku'nguno muli'mo gwav'o gwa wu'hozya. <verse eid="EXO 39:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="EXO 39:42" />V'aizilaeli v'agelani'zyaga mili'mo zyose ki'ti' i'vyo Gu'ku' Mulungu wamulagi'li'zizye Mose. <verse eid="EXO 39:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="EXO 39:43" />Mose walingu'laga ki'la ki'ntu', lingaga, wawonaga ku'v'a v'av'ezyaga visoga ki'ti' i'vyo Gu'ku' Mulungu walagi'li'zya. Haho Mose wav'adosyaga.<verse eid="EXO 39:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 39" />
  <chapter number="40" style="c" sid="EXO 40" />
  <para style="s">Ku'ki'ndi'ka na ku'sondohiwa kwa ihema</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 40:1" />Hangi' Gu'ku' Mulungu wamuwi'laga Mose, <verse eid="EXO 40:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 40:2" />“Mu lu'siku' lwa kwandya lwa mwezi gwa kwandya, u'lali'ki'ndi'ke Ihema Isondo, yaani Ihema lya Ku'sangi'zya. <verse eid="EXO 40:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 40:3" />Mugati' na ihema lyeni'lo u'latu'u'le isandi'ko lya wu'sangi'lwa, hangi' u'lali'ki'ge na muki'ngo. <verse eid="EXO 40:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 40:4" />U'laingi'zye meza na ku'hela vintu' ha igu'lya yayo. U'laingi'zye i'cho ki'nala cha ku'tu'u'li'la tala hangi' na ku'zitu'u'la tala zyacho ha igu'lya yacho. <verse eid="EXO 40:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 40:5" />Ihozezyo lya zahabu lya ku'zuki'zya wu'bani, u'lali'tu'u'le ha mbele ya isandi'ko lya wu'sangi'lwa. Hangi' u'lenenie muki'ngo ku' wingi'li'lo wa Ihema Isondo. <verse eid="EXO 40:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 40:6" />Hangi' ha mbele ya wingi'li'lo wa Ihema Isondo, yaani Ihema lya Ku'sangi'zya, u'latu'u'le i'lo ihozezyo lya ku'zigi'zya vitaambo. <verse eid="EXO 40:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 40:7" />Ikalaye u'lali'tu'u'le hagati' ya Ihema lya Ku'sangi'zya na ihozezyo, na ku'lyokazya minzi'. <verse eid="EXO 40:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 40:8" />U'lapilimye lu'gu'tu' na ku'enenia muki'ngo ha wingi'li'lo walo.<verse eid="EXO 40:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 40:9" />“Hangi' u'lasole maguta ga ku'v'ila na ku'li'v'ila Ihema Isondo haki'mo na vintu' vyalyo vyose. U'lali'sondohye haki'mo na vilwani'lo vyose i'vyo vili' mugati' yalyo, nalyo li'lav'e isondo. <verse eid="EXO 40:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 40:10" />Hangi' u'lali'v'ile maguta ihozezyo lya ku'zigi'zya vitaambo haki'mo na vilwani'lo vyalyo vyose, na ku'li'sondohya ihozezyo, nalyo li'lav'e isondo muno. <verse eid="EXO 40:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 40:11" />Ikalaye haki'mo na kikali'lo chalyo, u'lali'v'ile maguta na ku'li'sondohya.<verse eid="EXO 40:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 40:12" />“U'lav'alete Aloni na v'ana v'akwe v'a ki'gosya bi'hi' na wingi'li'lo wa Ihema lya Ku'sangi'zya, nanho u'lav'akuse na minzi'. <verse eid="EXO 40:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 40:13" />Hangi' u'lamuzwi'ke Aloni i'vyo vizwalo visondo, na ku'muv'ila maguta na ku'musondohya, ki'gele antu'mami'le muli'mo gwa wu'hozya. <verse eid="EXO 40:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 40:14" />Vyene vivyo u'lav'alete v'ana v'akwe na ku'v'azwi'ka i'zyo nhanzo. <verse eid="EXO 40:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 40:15" />Hangi' u'lav'av'ile maguta ki'ti' i'vyo wamuv'ilaga sav'o, ki'gele nav'o v'antu'mami'le muli'mo gwa wu'hozya. Ku'v'ilwa maguta kwenu'ku' ku'lav'ingi'zye mu wu'hozya wa wu'leka ku' wu'v'yalwa wav'o wose.”<verse eid="EXO 40:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 40:16" />Hohene, Mose wagelani'zyaga ki'la ki'ntu' ki'ti' i'vyo Gu'ku' Mulungu wamulagi'li'zizye.<verse eid="EXO 40:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 40:17" />Yav'age mu lu'siku' lwa kwandya lwa mwezi gwa kwandya, mwaka gwa wu'v'i'li' gwa ku'fuma ku' Misili, Ihema Isondo lyaki'ndi'kagwa. <verse eid="EXO 40:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 40:18" />Mose watu'u'laga vikali'lo vyalyo na ku'wu'sya felemu zyalyo, wazidimani'zyaga ngito zyalyo na kwi'mi'kya nhi'ngi' zyalyo. <verse eid="EXO 40:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 40:19" />Wasagalaga nfundi' ya miki'ngo ha igu'lya na Ihema Isondo, na ku'tu'u'la nfundi' zya ndi'li' ha igu'lya yalyo, ki'ti' i'vyo Gu'ku' Mulungu wamulagi'li'zizye. <verse eid="EXO 40:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 40:20" />Hangi' wasolaga ago mav'ale av'i'li' ga mawe ga wu'sangi'lwa na ku'gatu'u'la mu i'lo isandi'ko. Watu'u'laga zyeni'zyo miti' mu pete zya isandi'ko na watu'u'laga nfundi' ya wu'swanano ha igu'lya yalyo. <verse eid="EXO 40:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 40:21" />Hangi' wali'tu'u'laga mu ihema na ku'enenia muki'ngo, ki'gele ali'ki'ge isandi'ko lyeni'lo, ki'ti' i'vyo Gu'ku' Mulungu wamulagi'li'zizye.<verse eid="EXO 40:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 40:22" />Watu'u'laga meza mu Ihema lya Ku'sangi'zya, ku' lwandi' lwa sukuma lwa ihema, ha ibala na muki'ngo gwenu'go, <verse eid="EXO 40:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 40:23" />na ku'hela migate ha igu'lya na meza ha mbele yamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu, ki'ti' i'vyo Gu'ku' Mulungu wamulagi'li'zizye. <verse eid="EXO 40:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 40:24" />Watu'u'laga ki'nala cha ku'tu'u'li'la tala mu Ihema lya Ku'sangi'zya, ku' lwandi' lwa dakama, matanda na meza. <verse eid="EXO 40:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 40:25" />Hangi' wazihelaga tala ha igu'lya yacho ha mbele yamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu, ki'ti' i'vyo Gu'ku' Mulungu wamulagi'li'zizye. <verse eid="EXO 40:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 40:26" />Wali'tu'u'laga ihozezyo lya zahabu mu Ihema lya Ku'sangi'zya, ha mbele na muki'ngo gwa mugati', <verse eid="EXO 40:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 40:27" />na ku'zuki'zya wu'bani wu'motu ha igu'lya, ki'ti' i'vyo Gu'ku' Mulungu wamulagi'li'zizye.<figure style="fig" file="gt00144.jpg" size="col" ref="40:27">Mugati' na Hantu' Hasondo: ki'nala cha tala, ihozezyo lya ku'zuki'zya wu'bani na meza ya migate zya wu'sangi'lwa </figure> <verse eid="EXO 40:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 40:28" />Hangi' weneniaga muki'ngo ha wingi'li'lo wa Ihema Isondo. <verse eid="EXO 40:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 40:29" />Wali'tu'u'laga ihozezyo lya ku'zigi'zya vitaambo bi'hi' na wingi'li'lo wa Ihema lya Ku'sangi'zya, na wafumyaga ki'taambo cha ku'zigya na kalu'mbi'lo ka mbutoo vya mu mugu'nda ha igu'lya yalyo, ki'ti' i'vyo Gu'ku' Mulungu wamulagi'li'zizye. <verse eid="EXO 40:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 40:30" />Wali'tu'u'laga ikalaye hagati' na Ihema lya Ku'sangi'zya na ihozezyo, na ku'ti'ti'la minzi' ku'nguno ya kwikusa. <verse eid="EXO 40:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 40:31" />Hangi' Mose, Aloni na v'ana v'akwe, v'ose v'agatu'mi'laga ku' ku'kusi'la makono na magu'lu' gav'o. <verse eid="EXO 40:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 40:32" />Ki'la aho v'av'age v'ali'wingi'la mu ihema, ninga aho v'ali'lyegela ihozezyo, v'ikusage, ki'ti' i'vyo Gu'ku' Mulungu wamulagi'li'zizye Mose. <verse eid="EXO 40:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 40:33" />Hangi' Mose waki'ndi'kaga lu'gu'tu' ku'li'pilima ihema lyeni'lo na ihozezyo, na ku'tu'u'la muki'ngo ha wingi'li'lo wa lu'gu'tu'. Hu' i'vyo Mose wagelani'zyaga muli'mo gose.<figure style="fig" file="xgt00143.jpg" size="col" ref="40:33">Lu'gu'tu' lwa Ihema Isondo haki'mo na vilwani'lo vyalyo vyose</figure><verse eid="EXO 40:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lu'kumo lwamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu mugati' na ihema</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="NUM 9:15-23">Lu'v'alo 9:15-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 40:34" />Hangi' ilunde lyali'kumbi'laga i'lo Ihema lya Ku'sangi'zya, na lu'kumo lwamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu lokalaga mu ihema. <verse eid="EXO 40:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 40:35" />Ninga Mose akakowolile kwingi'la mu Ihema lya Ku'sangi'zya, ku'nguno i'lo ilunde likalaga ha igu'lya yalyo, na lu'kumo lwamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu lokalaga mwenu'mo. <verse eid="EXO 40:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="EXO 40:36" />Ku' misi'nzo zyav'o zyose V'aizilaeli itungo ilunde lyeni'lo aho lyawu'siv'agwe ku'fuma ha igu'lya na Ihema Isondo, haho v'awu'kage musi'nzo, <verse eid="EXO 40:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="EXO 40:37" />ali'vi u'lu' ilunde li'kawu'siv'ilwe, na v'eni'ki'li' v'akawu'kile mpaka lu'siku' u'lo lyawu'siv'agwa. <verse eid="EXO 40:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="EXO 40:38" />Ku' misi'nzo zyav'o zyose, iv'ilingano lya V'aizilaeli v'ali'wonage i'lo ilunde lyamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu ha igu'lya na Ihema Isondo ha itungo lya lyu'v'a, na u'go moto gwav'akage wu'ziku' mu ilunde lyeni'lo.<verse eid="EXO 40:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 40" />
</usx>